INSERT INTO `Operative` VALUES ('AEL','BOK','BOK',3,'DAW','Dire Avenger Warrior','These operatgives are famed for being as deadly on the attack as they are immovable in the defence, and are regarded as being the most tactically flexible of all the Aspects. They use their shuriken catapults to create an impenetrable storm of monomolecular blades.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','4+','8','BLADES OF KHAINE, ALEDARI, ASURYANI, DIRE AVENGER, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('AEL','BOK','BOK',0,'DAX','Dire Avenger Exarch','These warriors are masters of their Aspect and devoted to their craftworld. In keeping with the tactical felxibility of their Aspect, all are master marksmen and bladesmen, as at ease shredding foes with volleys of razor-sharp shuriken as they are duelling enemy heroes in single combat.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','9','BLADES OF KHAINE, ALEDARI, ASURYANI, LEADER, DIRE AVENGER, EXARCH',32,0,''),('AEL','BOK','BOK',4,'HBW','Howling Banshee Warrior','The piercing, psychosonic scream that precedes the assault of these bone-armoured operatives renders those who hear it all but helpless. These shock waves buy the Howling Banshees time enough to strike, each one taking a head with a sweep of their glittering power weapon.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','4+','8','BLADES OF KHAINE, ALEDARI, ASURYANI, HOWLING BANSHEE, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('AEL','BOK','BOK',1,'HBX','Howling Banshee Exarch','Not only do the skills in elegant swordplay displayed by a Hownling Banshee Exarch exceed those of the warriors she leads, but so harrowing and biting are her cries that their echoing reverberations haunt those who hear them long after their screams have died away.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','9','BLADES OF KHAINE, ALEDARI, ASURYANI, LEADER, HOWLING BANSHEE, EXARCH',32,0,''),('AEL','BOK','BOK',5,'SSW','Striking Scorpion Warrior','With limitless patience, after stalking their prey for hours or waiting in position for days, Striking Scorpions burst from concealment. With chainswords whirring and mandiblasters spitting needles of white fire, the Aspect Warriors\' emerald green armour is soon streaked red.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','4+','8','BLADES OF KHAINE, ALEDARI, ASURYANI, STRIKING SCORPION, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('AEL','BOK','BOK',2,'SSX','Striking Scorpion Exarch','These sinister figures are even more skilled than the Aspect Warriors they lead. With the gigantic chainsword known as the Biting Blade, a Striking Scorpion Exarch can cleave their foes in two with a single swing, and use their scorpion\'s claw to tear open Space Marin power armour with ease.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','9','BLADES OF KHAINE, ALEDARI, ASURYANI, LEADER, STRIKING SCORPION, EXARCH',32,0,''),('AEL','BOK24','BOK24',3,'DAW','Dire Avenger Warrior','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','4+','8','BLADES OF KHAINE, ALEDARI, ASURYANI, DIRE AVENGER, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('AEL','BOK24','BOK24',0,'DAX','Dire Avenger Exarch','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','3+','9','BLADES OF KHAINE, ALEDARI, ASURYANI, LEADER, DIRE AVENGER, EXARCH',32,0,''),('AEL','BOK24','BOK24',4,'HBW','Howling Banshee Warrior','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','4+','8','BLADES OF KHAINE, ALEDARI, ASURYANI, HOWLING BANSHEE, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('AEL','BOK24','BOK24',1,'HBX','Howling Banshee Exarch','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','3+','9','BLADES OF KHAINE, ALEDARI, ASURYANI, LEADER, HOWLING BANSHEE, EXARCH',32,0,''),('AEL','BOK24','BOK24',5,'SSW','Striking Scorpion Warrior','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','4+','8','BLADES OF KHAINE, ALEDARI, ASURYANI, STRIKING SCORPION, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('AEL','BOK24','BOK24',2,'SSX','Striking Scorpion Exarch','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','3+','9','BLADES OF KHAINE, ALEDARI, ASURYANI, LEADER, STRIKING SCORPION, EXARCH',32,0,''),('AEL','COM','KBL',0,'GNR','Kabalite Gunner','Drukhari weapons technology is far in advance of the Imperium\'s. Blasters utilise darklight, a mysterious substance that vaporises armour. Shredders, meanwhile, unleash an expanding mesh of barbed monofilaments that entangle the victim in an invisible, slicing net.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','COMMORRITE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, <KABAL>, KABALITE, GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','COM','KBL',0,'HGNR','Kabalite Heavy Gunner','The Drukhari go to battle with powerful weapons for dealing with hordes of opposing troops, battle tanks, and heavily armoured warriors. Kabalites wield Splinter Cannons or Dark Lances to deal with these threats, and when battle is done their kill tallies are jaw-dropping.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','COMMORRITE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, <KABAL>, KABALITE, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman'),('AEL','COM','KBL',0,'SYB','Sybarite','To lead formations of such cruel creatures as Kabalite Warriors requires beings of exceptional ruthlessness and murderous fighting skill. Sybarites have demonstrated their deep sadism on dozens of raids, and rule through fear as much as their effective combat skills.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','9','COMMORRITE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, <KABAL>, KABALITE, LEADER, SYBARITE',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','COM','KBL',0,'WAR','Kabalite Warrior','Kabalite Warriors conduct murderous raids cald in blade-edged, segmented armour. Highly skilled fighters who eschew such notions as honour, they unleash flurries of toxin-coated shards from their Splinter weapons whose poinsonous effects are swift to kill','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','COMMORRITE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, <KABAL>, KABALITE, WARRIOR',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','COM','WYCH',0,'FTR','Wych Fighter','Many Wyches take to the field bearing wicked gladiatorial weapons. Some ensnare foes in the hooked mesh of shardnets before impaling them with twin-bladed spears. Others lash enemies with flicks of their Razorflails or shred them with the crystalline blades of their Hydra Gauntlets.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','COMMORRITE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, <WYCH CULT>, WYCH, FIGHTER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('AEL','COM','WYCH',0,'HEK','Hekatrix','Hekatarii lead Wyches on realspace raids and in the arenas. Countless are the enemies they have slain, and many have achieved a degree of fame in Commorragh only to hunger for more. Cruel and merciless, they lead their charges ruthlessly and lust after their foes\' suffering.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','9','COMMORRITE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, <WYCH CULT>, LEADER, WYCH, HEKATRIX',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('AEL','COM','WYCH',0,'WAR','Wych Warrior','Wyches are acrobatic murder-artists who take great delight in displaying their formidable blade skills. They twist and dart around their foes\' attacks in combat, making the most talented warriors appear clumsy in comparison.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','COMMORRITE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, <WYCH CULT>, WYCH, WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('AEL','COR','COR',0,'FA','Voidscarred Felarch','Felarchs are veteran Corsairs, with centuries or even millenia of experience reaving the starts. They have fought countless different races and mastered numerous weapons, making them deadly enemies for any who face them.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','9','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, LEADER, VOIDSCARRED FELARCH',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','COR','COR',0,'FD','Voidscarred Fate Dealer','Once a Fate Dealer has an enemy in their sights, it is the mark of the unfortunate soul\'s death. Expert infiltrators, they hide in positions with greatest oversight of the whole battlefield, and are rendered all but invisible by camo cloaks.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, VOIDSCARRED FATE DEALER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','COR','COR',0,'GNR','Voidscarred Gunner','Corsairs utilise weapons hailing from every Aeldari society. Shredders unleash an expanding mesh of monofilament, entangling foes in a net and slicing them apart, while Blasters use mysterious darklight technology, lethal even to the most armoured foe.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, VOIDSCARRED GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','COR','COR',0,'HGNR','Voidscarred Heavy Gunner','With rapid volleys of Shuriken fire, Corsairs can shred enemy infantry and provide cover for their coterie. Some Corsairs wield Wraithcannons. These weapons tear rifts between Warp and Realspace, ripping apart targets caught in the vortex.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, VOIDSCARRED HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','COR','COR',0,'KH','Voidscarred Kurnite Hunter','These Corsairs known as Kurnite Hunters are followers of Kurnous, Aeldari god of the hunt. Their bond with creatures of the hunt, such as the Faolchú, is often stronger than that with their fellow Corsairs.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, VOIDSCARRED KURNITE HUNTER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('AEL','COR','COR',0,'KU','Voidscarred Kurnathi','The Kurnathi are true blademasters. Assassins all, they have learned their bloody trade in Asuryani Aspect Shrines, in the arenas of Commorragh, or even alongside the Harlequins. Now they put their skills to work however they see fit.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, VOIDSCARRED KURNATHI',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('AEL','COR','COR',0,'SR','Voidscarred Shade Runner','Shade Runners are experts at the surprise attack. Utilising their blink packs - which function in a similar manner to the Warp jump generators used by Warp Spiders of the Asuryani - they flank their enemies, striking with the swift, savage blows of their Hekatarii Blades.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, FLY, VOIDSCARRED SHADE RUNNER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('AEL','COR','COR',0,'SSD','Voidscarred Starstorm Duellist','Brash and arrogant, Starstorm Duellists are expert pistol wielders who dive through the fray to deliver salvoes of pinpoint fire at close range.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, VOIDSCARRED STARSTORM DUELLIST',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','COR','COR',0,'SW','Voidscarred Soul Weaver','Spiritual mystics, Soul Weavers utilise the power and knowledge of the Aeldari souls in the spirit stones they carry. With this energy they can enhance warrior\'s abilities in combat or heal the wounded.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, PSYKER, MEDIC, VOIDSCARRED SOUL WEAVER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('AEL','COR','COR',0,'WAR','Voidscarred Warrior','Corsairs are lithe and nimble warriors, skilled marksmen and bladesmen both. Swift fighters, they make up for lack of physical strength with sheer agility.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, VOIDSCARRED WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','COR','COR',0,'WS','Voidscarred Way Seeker','It is the role of the Way Seekers to guide and steer smaller Corsair ships on their travels. They are also powerful battlefield psykers who work closely with Fate Dealers and Kurnathi, identifying targets for these assassins as they would identify obstacles to their craft.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, PSYKER, VOIDSCARRED WAY SEEKER',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','COR24','COR24',4,'FD','Voidscarred Fate Dealer','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, FATE DEALER',32,0,''),('AEL','COR24','COR24',1,'FEL','Voidscarred Felarch','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','9','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, FELARCH, LEADER',32,0,''),('AEL','COR24','COR24',2,'GNR','Voidscarred Gunner','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, GUNNER',32,0,''),('AEL','COR24','COR24',3,'HGNR','Voidscarred Heavy Gunner','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,''),('AEL','COR24','COR24',6,'HNT','Voidscarred Kurnite Hunter','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, KURNITE HUNTER',32,0,''),('AEL','COR24','COR24',5,'KUR','Voidscarred Kurnathi','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, KURNATHI',32,0,''),('AEL','COR24','COR24',9,'SD','Voidscarred Starstorm Duellist','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, STARSTORM DUELLIST',32,0,''),('AEL','COR24','COR24',8,'SR','Voidscarred Shade Runner','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, SHADE RUNNER',32,0,''),('AEL','COR24','COR24',7,'SW','Voidscarred Soul Weaver','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, SOUL WEAVER, PSYKER',32,0,''),('AEL','COR24','COR24',11,'WAR','Voidscarred Warrior','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('AEL','COR24','COR24',10,'WS','Voidscarred Way Seeker','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','CORSAIR VOIDSCARRED, AELDARI, ANHRATHE, PSYKER, WAY SEEKER',32,0,''),('AEL','CW','DA',0,'EXA','Dire Avenger Exarch','Dire Avenger Exarchs are masters of their Aspect Shrines, deadly warriors wholly consumed by the practice of war. Whether they go to the field carrying a long diresword or a pair of shuriken catapults, few can stand against them and live.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','9','CRAFTWORLD, AELDARI, ASURYANI, <CRAFTWORLD>, DIRE AVENGER, LEADER',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','CW','DA',0,'WAR','Dire Avenger Warrior','Dire Avengers are experts at wielding their Avenger catapults, which unleash a flurry of monomolecular shuriken with every burst of fire. They have an uncanny knack of knowing when to launch lightning-fast assaults or fall back to draw the enemy into a killing zone.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','CRAFTWORLD, AELDARI, ASURYANI, <CRAFTWORLD>, DIRE AVENGER, WARRIOR',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','CW','GD',0,'HGNR','Guardian Defender Heavy Gunner','Guardian Defenders are also expected to man heavy weapons platforms, guiding the hovering constructs forward. The operators of these weapons are always seeking new targets, ensuring their aims are true and that they are always on the move.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','CRAFTWORLD, AELDARI, ASURYANI, <CRAFTWORLD>, GUARDIAN DEFENDER, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','CW','GD',0,'LDR','Guardian Defender Leader','Those Aeldari who lead Guardian Defender squads are expected to ensure their wards are expert combatants and experienced tacticians. It is a testament to the skill of the Asuryani that even their civilians can engage an enemy force and emerge victorious.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','9','CRAFTWORLD, AELDARI, ASURYANI, <CRAFTWORLD>, GUARDIAN DEFENDER, LEADER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','CW','GD',0,'WAR','Guardian Defender Warrior','Guardians are agile citizen-soldiers, trained for war to defend their Craftworld in times of dire need. Guardian Defenders often serve as support troops, unleashing a withering hail of fire from their shuriken catapults at any foe they encounter.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','CRAFTWORLD, AELDARI, ASURYANI, <CRAFTWORLD>, GUARDIAN DEFENDER, WARRIOR',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','CW','GD',0,'WPLT','Guardian Defender Heavy Weapon Platform','Anti-grav heavy weapons platforms can be equipped with a wide range of support weapons, ranging from vicious shuriken cannons to devastating bright lances.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','0','1','3','3+','12','CRAFTWORLD, AELDARI, ASURYANI, <CRAFTWORLD>, GUARDIAN DEFENDER, HEAVY WEAPON PLATFORM',32,0,'N/A'),('AEL','CW','RNGR',0,'LDR','Ranger Leader','Rangers are outcasts who have left their Craftworld by choice or necessity. Those that survive the harsh Ranger lifestyle beyond their home are inspiring to many fellow Aeldari, thanks to their stories of great adventure and their ruthless combat skill.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','9','CRAFTWORLD, AELDARI, ASURYANI, <CRAFTWORLD>, RANGER, LEADER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','CW','RNGR',0,'WAR','Ranger Warrior','Clad in long camouflaging cloaks, Rangers are unparallelled scouts and expert marksmen. They investigate alien planets, search for lost webway gates, and hunt down those who would harm their Craftworld, killing them with precise shots.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','CRAFTWORLD, AELDARI, ASURYANI, <CRAFTWORLD>, RANGER, WARRIOR',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','CW','SG',0,'GNR','Storm Guardian Gunner','Storm Guardians often bolster their short-ranged firepower with fusion guns and flamers, allowing their teams to better adapt to the ever-changing realities of the battlefield. They ensure the team\'s survival in the face of the most dire or numerous enemies.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','CRAFTWORLD, AELDARI, ASURYANI, <CRAFTWORLD>, STORM GUARDIAN, GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','CW','SG',0,'LDR','Storm Guardian Leader','Storm Guardians fight with all the grace and skill of their kind, guided by experienced leaders. In the hurricane of close combat, Storm Guardians sweep their blades into the foe, using their speed and poise to chop through limbs before their enemies can respond in kind.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','9','CRAFTWORLD, AELDARI, ASURYANI, <CRAFTWORLD>, STORM GUARDIAN, LEADER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('AEL','CW','SG',0,'WAR','Storm Guardian Warrior','In the most desperate of circumstances, the strategic needs of the Craftworld will call for a group of its citizen-soldiers to deploy as Storm Guardians - Warriors specifically armed to fight in the maelstrom of close combat.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','CRAFTWORLD, AELDARI, ASURYANI, <CRAFTWORLD>, STORM GUARDIAN, WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('AEL','HOTA','HOTA',1,'KAG','Kabalite Agent','Well equipped and with murderous talents honed by survival in Commorragh, Agents of Hand of the Archon kill teams are malevolent enforcers. Any prey they cannot painfully cut down with their Splinter Rifles, they slice apart with graceful sweeps of their numerous blades.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HAND OF THE ARCHON, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, KABALITE, AGENT',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','HOTA','HOTA',0,'KAS','Kabalite Archsybarite','Those who wield superiority among their Archon\'s elite have risen to power through ruthlessness and manipulative scheming. They are also dread combatants, for expert bladework and athletic strength are required to maintain authority.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','9','HAND OF THE ARCHON, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, LEADER, KABALITE, ARCHSYBARITE',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','HOTA','HOTA',2,'KCD','Kabalite Crimson Duellist','Crimson Duellists are vicious murder-artists who work with a gory palette of their enemies\' viscera. Masters of various weapons, many hunt with the ostentatious Razorflail, performing signature kills when their Archon requires a highly visible display of power.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HAND OF THE ARCHON, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, KABALITE, CRIMSON DUELLIST',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('AEL','HOTA','HOTA',3,'KDOY','Kabalite Disciple Of Yaelindra','Yaelindra founded an infamous cult of prisoners, said to concoct the most potent toxins known to the Dark City. Her adepts weaponise deadly venoms, laving them into torment grenades or delivering them via hollow slivers fired by Stinger Pistols with horrific results.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HAND OF THE ARCHON, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, KABALITE, DISCIPLE OF YAELINDRA',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('AEL','HOTA','HOTA',4,'KELX','Kabalite Elixicant','Elixicants are expert applicators of the various products of their Kabal\'s biochemical industries. Such stimulants, virulent narcotics, and arcane synthetic hormones invigorate their fellow Kabalites in varying ways. To the enemy, however, they offer only slow and painful death.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HAND OF THE ARCHON, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, KABALITE, ELIXICANT',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('AEL','HOTA','HOTA',5,'KFLAY','Kabalite Flayer','Drukhari hunger for others\' pain, and Flayers are gruesomely adept at generating it in their victims. Their murders are neither swift nor clean, and with every pleasing scream they elicit from their foes, they unleash waves of empowering agony.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HAND OF THE ARCHON, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, KABALITE, FLAYER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('AEL','HOTA','HOTA',6,'KGNR','Kabalite Gunner','From the darklight caress of Blasters to the mesh of monofilament barbs unleashed by Shredders, specialist Gunners of the Kabals revel in unleashing torment on the move. Such warriors may earn these potent weapons through skill, or kill their way to the position.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HAND OF THE ARCHON, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, KABALITE, GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','HOTA','HOTA',7,'KHGNR','Kabalite Heavy Gunner','Drukhari weapons technology is far in advance of most races\' capabilities, and Kabalite Heavy Gunners wield armaments of hellish power. Dark Lances fire midnight beams that can vaporise foes, while Splinter Cannons scythe through the enemy with poisoned shards.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HAND OF THE ARCHON, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, KABALITE, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman'),('AEL','HOTA','HOTA',8,'KSA','Kabalite Skysplinter Assassin','Used to scouting ahead, these operatives stand apart from their comrades and are seen as harbouring secret agendas. Such paranoia is a tool they know how to use in their favour, and the ominous sight of their Razorwings haunt both foes and so-called \'allies\' alike.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HAND OF THE ARCHON, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, KABALITE, SKYSPLINTER ASSASSIN',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','HOTA24','HOTA24',2,'KAG','Kabalite Agent','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','HAND OF THE ARCHON , AELDARI, DRUKHARI, AGENT',32,0,''),('AEL','HOTA24','HOTA24',1,'KAS','Kabalite Archsybarite','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','9','HAND OF THE ARCHON , AELDARI, DRUKHARI, LEADER, ARCHSYBARITE',32,0,''),('AEL','HOTA24','HOTA24',3,'KCD','Kabalite Crimson Duellist','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','HAND OF THE ARCHON , AELDARI, DRUKHARI, CRIMSON DUELLIST',32,0,''),('AEL','HOTA24','HOTA24',4,'KDOY','Kabalite Disciple Of Yaelindra','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','HAND OF THE ARCHON , AELDARI, DRUKHARI, DISCIPLE OF YAELINDRA',32,0,''),('AEL','HOTA24','HOTA24',5,'KELX','Kabalite Elixicant','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','HAND OF THE ARCHON , AELDARI, DRUKHARI, ELIXICANT',32,0,''),('AEL','HOTA24','HOTA24',6,'KFLAY','Kabalite Flayer','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','HAND OF THE ARCHON , AELDARI, DRUKHARI, FLAYER',32,0,''),('AEL','HOTA24','HOTA24',7,'KGNR','Kabalite Gunner','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','HAND OF THE ARCHON , AELDARI, DRUKHARI, GUNNER',32,0,''),('AEL','HOTA24','HOTA24',8,'KHGNR','Kabalite Heavy Gunner','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','HAND OF THE ARCHON , AELDARI, DRUKHARI, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,''),('AEL','HOTA24','HOTA24',9,'KSA','Kabalite Skysplinter Assassin','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','HAND OF THE ARCHON , AELDARI, DRUKHARI, SKYSPLINTER ASSASSIN',32,0,''),('AEL','MND','MND',5,'AB','Mandrake Abyssal','','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','MANDRAKE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, ABYSSAL',32,0,'Marksman'),('AEL','MND','MND',4,'COTF','Mandrake Chooser Of The Flesh','','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','MANDRAKE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, CHOOSER OF THE FLESH',32,0,'Combat'),('AEL','MND','MND',3,'DM','Mandrake Dirgemaw','','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','MANDRAKE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, DIRGEMAW',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','MND','MND',1,'NF','Mandrake Nightfiend','','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','9','MANDRAKE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, LEADER, NIGHTFIEND',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','MND','MND',2,'SW','Mandrake Shadeweaver','','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','MANDRAKE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, SHADEWEAVER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','MND','MND',6,'WAR','Mandrake Warrior','','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','MANDRAKE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','MND24','MND24',3,'ABS','Mandrake Abyssal','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','5+','8','MANDRAKE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, ABYSSAL',32,1,''),('AEL','MND24','MND24',2,'COTF','Mandrake Chooser Of The Flesh','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','5+','8','MANDRAKE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, CHOOSER OF THE FLESH',32,1,''),('AEL','MND24','MND24',4,'DM','Mandrake Dirgemaw','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','5+','8','MANDRAKE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, DIRGEMAW',32,1,''),('AEL','MND24','MND24',1,'NF','Mandrake Nightfiend','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','5+','9','MANDRAKE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, LEADER, NIGHTFIEND',32,1,''),('AEL','MND24','MND24',5,'SW','Mandrake Shadeweaver','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','5+','8','MANDRAKE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, SHADEWEAVER',32,1,''),('AEL','MND24','MND24',6,'WAR','Mandrake Warrior','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','5+','8','MANDRAKE, AELDARI, DRUKHARI, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('AEL','TRP','TRP',0,'GNR','Player Gunner','Some Harlequins wield esoteric and destructive ranged weapons. These include the Fusion Pistol, which can reduce heavily armoured warriors to molten slop, or Neuro Disruptors, which fire beams of energy capable of burning away nervous tissue in an agonising instant.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','6+','8','TROUPE, AELDARI, HARLEQUINS, <MASQUE>, PLAYER, GUNNER',32,0,''),('AEL','TRP','TRP',0,'LDR','Player Leader','Choreographers of conflict and focal points of war by consent of their peers, senior Harlequins clad in extravagant robes direct their comrades\' reactions to the fates of battle and ensure their warriors\' performance in the theatre of war is as perfect as it can be.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','6+','9','TROUPE, AELDARI, HARLEQUINS, <MASQUE>, PLAYER, LEADER',32,0,''),('AEL','TRP','TRP',0,'WAR','Player Warrior','Harlequin Players perform with breathtaking skill, whether their stage is a wraithbone-and-glass amphitheatre bathed in crystalline light or the firelit hell of the battlefield. They tumble, sprint, and leap, every trigger squeeze and blade slash bringing orchestrated death to the enemy.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','6+','8','TROUPE, AELDARI, HARLEQUINS, <MASQUE>, PLAYER, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('AEL','VDT','VDT',2,'DJS','Death Jester','The arrival of a Death Jester in a killzone is announced by a hissing storm of shrieker cannon fire. Enemy infantry are torn apart in sprays of blood and scalded flesh as the weapon\'s gene-toxins cause them to combust horrifically from within. Adding insult to injury, the Death Jester ensures every demise is as cruelly ironic as possible.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','6+','9','VOID-DANCER TROUPE, AELDARI, HARLEQUINS, <MASQUE>, DEATH JESTER',32,0,'Marksman'),('AEL','VDT','VDT',1,'LPL','Lead Player','Choreographers of conflict, Lead Players are experienced Harlequins clad in extravagant garb. They direct their comrades\' reactions to the fates of battle and ensure their warriors\' performances in the theatre of war is as perfect as they can be.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','6+','9','VOID-DANCER TROUPE, AELDARI, HARLEQUINS, <MASQUE>, LEADER, LEAD PLAYER',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','VDT','VDT',3,'PLAY','Player','Harlequin Players perform with breathtaking skill, whether their stage is a wraithbone-and-glass amphitheatre bathed in a crystalline light or the firelit hell of the battlefield. They tumble, sprint and leap, with every trigger squeeze and blade slash bringing orchestrated death to the enemy','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','6+','8','VOID-DANCER TROUPE, AELDARI, HARLEQUINS, <MASQUE>,  PLAYER',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','VDT','VDT',4,'SDS','Shadowseer','Shadowseers can blind enemy operatives and drive them mad with their psychic powers. As they obscure their allies with illusions, they fire hallucinogenic grenades at the foe that cuase disorientation or death. In close combat, Shadowseers crush bones with strikes from their Miststaves, which also scramble the perceptions of those they hit.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','6+','9','VOID-DANCER TROUPE, AELDARI, HARLEQUINS, <MASQUE>,  PSYKER, SHADOWSEER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('AEL','VDT24','VDT24',2,'DJS','Death Jester','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','4+','9','VOID-DANCER TROUPE, AELDARI, HARLEQUINS, DEATH JESTER',32,0,''),('AEL','VDT24','VDT24',1,'LPL','Lead Player','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','4+','9','VOID-DANCER TROUPE, AELDARI, HARLEQUINS, LEADER, LEAD PLAYER',32,0,''),('AEL','VDT24','VDT24',3,'PLAY','Player','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','4+','8','VOID-DANCER TROUPE, AELDARI, HARLEQUINS, PLAYER',32,0,''),('AEL','VDT24','VDT24',4,'SDS','Shadowseer','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','4+','9','VOID-DANCER TROUPE, AELDARI, HARLEQUINS, PSYKER, SHADOWSEER',32,0,''),('CHAOS','BLD','BLD',0,'BRG','Traitor Brimstone Grenadier','Brimstone Grenadiers have an unhealthy penchant for explosive slaughter, and think nothing of wielding unstable explosives capable of showering their victims with unclean alchemical acids and poisons, or even swallowing them up in roiling clouds of infernal Warp sorcery.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','BLOODED, CHAOS, MILITARUM TRAITORIS, <WARBAND>, TRAITOR BRIMSTONE GRENADIER',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('CHAOS','BLD','BLD',0,'BUT','Traitor Butcher','Some amongst the Militarum Traitoris shrug off their humanity altogether, taking monstrous pleasure in hacking their enemies apart at close quarters and devouring chunks of hot, bloody flesh - Sometimes while their luckless victims are still screaming their last.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','BLOODED, CHAOS, MILITARUM TRAITORIS, <WARBAND>, TRAITOR BUTCHER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('CHAOS','BLD','BLD',0,'CHIEF','Traitor Chieftain','Through force of will, threat of violence, and sheer charisma, Chieftains rule over KillTeams of Blooded and lead them to war. Their position gives them the pick of the battlefield riches, ensuring they charge into the fray wielding the most potent of weapons and wargear.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','BLOODED, CHAOS, MILITARUM TRAITORIS, <WARBAND>, LEADER, TRAITOR CHIEFTAIN',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','BLD','BLD',0,'COMMS','Traitor Commsman','Acting as the mouthpieces for their tyrannical masters, Traitor Commsmen spit relayed ortders through the corrupted vozx networks of Blooded KillTeams, broadcasting amplified exhortations for their comrades to fight harder in the name of the blessed Octed.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','BLOODED, CHAOS, MILITARUM TRAITORIS, <WARBAND>, TRAITOR COMMSMAN',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('CHAOS','BLD','BLD',0,'CORPSE','Traitor Corpseman','Having cast aside the ethics and oaths of the true medicae, these twisted field surgeons specialise in concocting potent combat stimulants. These they dole our to drive their comrades into a savage battle-frenzy, and also to control them through increasing dependency.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','BLOODED, CHAOS, MILITARUM TRAITORIS, <WARBAND>, MEDIC, TRAITOR CORPSEMAN',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('CHAOS','BLD','BLD',0,'ENF','Traitor Enforcer','Enforcers are sadistic morale officers. Some began as allegedly incorruptible Commissars, tempted or broken by diabolical artifice. Others are petty tyrants risen from the ranks and garbed mockingly in the tattered garb - or even the flayed hides - of their former masters.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','BLOODED, CHAOS, MILITARUM TRAITORIS, <WARBAND>, TRAITOR ENFORCER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('CHAOS','BLD','BLD',0,'FLN','Traitor Flenser','Even their fellow Traitor Guardsmen look askance at Flensers, who mutter and cackle as they clash their skinning blades together in anticipation of the torments they will inflict in the Dark Gods\' names. Many have died beneath their wicked knives, but few swiftly.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','BLOODED, CHAOS, MILITARUM TRAITORIS, <WARBAND>, TRAITOR FLENSER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('CHAOS','BLD','BLD',0,'GNR','Traitor Gunner','Where Imperial Guardsmen may be issued special weapons such as flamers or plasma guns, renegades claim them from their victims as trophies, bearing them as symbols of power and status. Wielding such a potent weapon assists them in offering more gory sacrifice to the Gods.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','BLOODED, CHAOS, MILITARUM TRAITORIS, <WARBAND>, TRAITOR GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman'),('CHAOS','BLD','BLD',0,'OGR','Traitor Ogryn','Savage brutes even before turning traitor, Ogryns sworn to Chaos are quick to earn mutant blessings through their strength and savagery. However, they are slow-witted and easily exploited as bodyguards, living shields or crude line breakers by their more cunning Human comrades.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','16','BLOODED, CHAOS, MILITARUM TRAITORIS, <WARBAND>, TRAITOR OGRYN',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('CHAOS','BLD','BLD',0,'SS','Traitor Sharpshooter','Skilled marksmen are often scorned by the Blooded for their unwillingness to seek glory at close quarters. Yet Sharpshooters know their own worth, offering up the departed sould of each new victim as they pick them off with their long-las.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','BLOODED, CHAOS, MILITARUM TRAITORIS, <WARBAND>, TRAITOR SHARPSHOOTER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('CHAOS','BLD','BLD',0,'THUG','Traitor Thug','Amongst the Militarum Traitoris, strength and brutality count for more than discipline or loyalty. Many are the Thugs amongst their ragged ranks - violent men and women who have become virtual ogres thanks to their inner savagery and the taint of heresy.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','BLOODED, CHAOS, MILITARUM TRAITORIS, <WARBAND>, TRAITOR THUG',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('CHAOS','BLD','BLD',0,'TRP','Traitor Trooper','Even the troopers of the Blooded are hardened killers, tempered amidst the fires of heresy and consumed by a selfish desire to claw their way to power. Cruel and driven, they will risk everything to catch the eye of a Dark God.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','5+','7','BLOODED, CHAOS, MILITARUM TRAITORIS, <WARBAND>, TRAITOR TROOPER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('CHAOS','BLD','BLD',0,'TRSW','Traitor Trench Sweeper','Trench Sweepers are the rarest of things - a traitor still loyal to their comrades. Retaining something of their former discipline, they focus on shielding their direct superiors during the advance, before surging ahead to clear a bloody path at close quarters.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','BLOODED, CHAOS, MILITARUM TRAITORIS, <WARBAND>, TRAITOR TRENCH SWEEPER',32,0,'Staunch'),('CHAOS','BLD24','BLD24',3,'BUT','Traitor Butcher','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','BLOODED, CHAOS, BUTCHER',32,1,''),('CHAOS','BLD24','BLD24',1,'CHF','Traitor Chieftain','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','BLOODED, CHAOS, CHIEFTAIN, LEADER',32,1,''),('CHAOS','BLD24','BLD24',4,'COM','Traitor Commsman','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','BLOODED, CHAOS, COMMSMAN',32,1,''),('CHAOS','BLD24','BLD24',5,'CRPS','Traitor Corpseman','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','BLOODED, CHAOS, CORPSEMAN',32,1,''),('CHAOS','BLD24','BLD24',6,'ENF','Traitor Enforcer','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','9','BLOODED, CHAOS, ENFORCER',32,1,''),('CHAOS','BLD24','BLD24',7,'FLN','Traitor Flenser','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','BLOODED, CHAOS, FLENSER',32,1,''),('CHAOS','BLD24','BLD24',8,'GNR','Traitor Gunner','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','BLOODED, CHAOS, GUNNER',32,1,''),('CHAOS','BLD24','BLD24',2,'GRN','Traitor Brimstone Grenadier','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','BLOODED, CHAOS, BRIMSTONE GRENADIER',32,1,''),('CHAOS','BLD24','BLD24',9,'OGR','Traitor Ogryn','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','16','BLOODED, CHAOS, OGRYN',32,1,''),('CHAOS','BLD24','BLD24',10,'SS','Traitor Sharpshooter','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','BLOODED, CHAOS, SHARPSHOOTER',32,1,''),('CHAOS','BLD24','BLD24',11,'THUG','Traitor Thug','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','BLOODED, CHAOS, THUG',32,1,''),('CHAOS','BLD24','BLD24',13,'TRP','Traitor Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','BLOODED, CHAOS, TROOPER',32,0,''),('CHAOS','BLD24','BLD24',12,'TRS','Traitor Trench Sweeper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','9','BLOODED, CHAOS, TRENCH SWEEPER',32,1,''),('CHAOS','CSM','CC',0,'CHA','Chaos Cultist Champion','Those who rise to prominence in a cult may be former officers, gang lords, or undergroung preachers, praising the Dark Gods with their varied displays of violence.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','TRAITOR SPACE MARINE, CHAOS, CULTIST, LEADER, CHAMPION',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('CHAOS','CSM','CC',0,'FTR','Chaos Cultist Fighter','Chaos cults foment rebellion and betrayal on thousands of worlds. Cultists arm themselves with an assortment of stolen rifles and improvised clubs and blades, gladly fighting in service of their post-human superiors while seeking the downfall of the Imperium.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','5+','7','TRAITOR SPACE MARINE, CHAOS, CULTIST, FIGHTER',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('CHAOS','CSM','CC',0,'GNR','Chaos Cultist Gunner','Long-hidden heavier weapons are broken out by the cult\'s leaders and assigned to favoured warriors when the time comes. Heavy stubbers are devastating against lightly armoured foes, while flamers douse enemy positions in burning promethium.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','TRAITOR SPACE MARINE, CHAOS, CULTIST, GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','CSM','CSM',0,'AC','Chaos Space Marine Aspiring Champion','Chaos Space Marines follow the strongest and most merciless of their kind to battle. These blood-soaked warriors seek to become the favoured of the gods.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','13','TRAITOR SPACE MARINE, CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, <LEGION>, CHAOS SPACE MARINE, ASPIRING CHAMPION',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','CSM','CSM',0,'GNR','Chaos Space Marine Gunner','While some traitors prefer gory close assault, others glorify in the slaughter of their foes at range. They go to war bearing ancient patterns of plasma guns and meltaguns to tear through heavy opposition, or bathe their enemies in gouts of fire from flamers.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','TRAITOR SPACE MARINE, CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, <LEGION>, CHAOS SPACE MARINE, GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','CSM','CSM',0,'HGNR','Chaos Space Marine Heavy Gunner','These operatives brazenly carry the heaviest weapons to eviscerate the enemy, adorned with foul symbols and bladed combat attachments.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','TRAITOR SPACE MARINE, CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, <LEGION>, CHAOS SPACE MARINE, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','CSM','CSM',0,'IB','Chaos Space Marine Icon Bearer','Some Chaos Space Marines proclaim their devotion to the Dark Gods by carrying twisted icons or banners to battle, strung with offerings of defeated foes.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','TRAITOR SPACE MARINE, CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, <LEGION>, CHAOS SPACE MARINE, ICON BEARER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','CSM','CSM',0,'WAR','Chaos Space Marine Warrior','Chaos Space Marines combine the advantages of their loyalist foes with the power of Chaos, wielding debased marks of boltguns and pistols, and rune-etched blades.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','TRAITOR SPACE MARINE, CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, <LEGION>, CHAOS SPACE MARINE, WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT',1,'BLBL','Blessed Blade','The most devoted and skilled of the Cult Demagogue\'s followers, Blessed Blades server as their fanatically loyal bodyguards. They will gladly die to protect their charge, and have been silenced either by ritual or blade to ensure they never speak over their master.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','CHAOS CULT, CHAOS, DARK COMMUNE, BLESSED BLADE',32,2,''),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT',0,'DEMA','Cult Demagogue','Vile orators who inflame the passions of their adherents, Cult Demagogues are seen by their fanatical underlings as prophets of the Dark Gods. They interpret signs, bless their congregations, and invoke the power of the Warp through ritual sacrifice and fervent prayer.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','CHAOS CULT, CHAOS, LEADER, DARK COMMUNE, CULT DEMAGOGUE',32,1,''),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT',4,'DEV','Chaos Devotee','These cultists are the mortal followers of the Dark Gods - ordinary men and women fallen to promises of temporal power who wish to overthrow Imperial taskmasters. Bearing a motley collection of improvised, stolen, and makeshift weapons, they can overwhelm even determined enemies with their sheer zeal.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','5+','7','CHAOS CULT, CHAOS, DEVOTEE',32,10,''),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT',2,'ICON','Iconarch','Iconarchs have the blessing and the curse of carrying their Cult\'s spike and flame-billowing censer-icon to war. This great symbol radiates with the mutating power of the Warp, affecting the foes and devotees of Chaos alike.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','CHAOS CULT, CHAOS, DARK COMMUNE, ICONARCH',32,1,''),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT',5,'MUT','Chaos Mutant','Whether born of dark ritual, empyric experimentation, or the predations of malign entities, Mutants have diverse, terrifying origins. When faced with an enemy, they lash out with claws, tendrils, or whatever other blasphemous appendages they possess.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','CHAOS CULT, CHAOS, MUTANT',32,0,''),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT',3,'MW','Mindwitch','All that remains of the psyker that is a Mindwitch is a mutated, swollen head mounted on an armature, connected by arcane tubes and cables to a mindless slave. Beings of formidable power, they can torture the minds of their victims and weave vortices of empyric energy.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','CHAOS CULT, CHAOS, DARK COMMUNE, PSYKER, MINDWITCH',32,1,''),('CHAOS','CULT','CULT',6,'TOR','Chaos Torment','These hideous abominations are possessed by one daemon or many. It is impossible to tell how much of the original Devotee remains. Each has a scroll or parchment nailed to its form, upon which are written words in evil tongues to prevent the bound daemons from manifesting in full.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','13','CHAOS CULT, CHAOS, TORMENT',32,0,''),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24',1,'BLBL','Blessed Blade','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','CHAOS CULT, CHAOS, DARK COMMUNE, BLESSED BLADE',32,2,''),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24',0,'DEMA','Cult Demagogue','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','CHAOS CULT, CHAOS, LEADER, DARK COMMUNE, CULT DEMAGOGUE',32,1,''),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24',4,'DEV','Chaos Devotee','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','CHAOS CULT, CHAOS, DEVOTEE',32,10,''),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24',2,'ICON','Iconarch','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','CHAOS CULT, CHAOS, DARK COMMUNE, ICONARCH',32,1,''),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24',5,'MUT','Chaos Mutant','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','CHAOS CULT, CHAOS, MUTANT',32,0,''),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24',3,'MW','Mindwitch','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','CHAOS CULT, CHAOS, DARK COMMUNE, PSYKER, MINDWITCH',32,1,''),('CHAOS','CULT24','CULT24',6,'TOR','Chaos Torment','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','13','CHAOS CULT, CHAOS, TORMENT',32,0,''),('CHAOS','DAEM','BH',0,'BLUE','Blue Horror','Should a Pink Horror be cut down, it may split, with the two halves reforming as smaller daemons. These Blue Horrors are morose and spiteful creatures, aggressively calling on their Warp-spawned powers to destroy those who dared to lay their original form low.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','6+','6','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, TZEENTCH,  BLUE HORROR',32,0,'Scout,Marksman'),('CHAOS','DAEM','BH',0,'BRIM','Brimstone Horror','Blue Horrors that are destroyed may vanish in a cloud of smoke, from which emrge two stunted Brimstone Horrors. These diminutive daemons are manifestations of pure bitterness, seeking to incinerate their enemies with burning talons and fangs.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','2','6+','5','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, TZEENTCH,  BRIMSTONE HORROR',32,0,'N/A'),('CHAOS','DAEM','BL',0,'BR','Bloodreaper','Bloodreapers marshal Khorne\'s frenzied hordes in battle. They are among the deadliest warriors of their kind, each having offered up countless skulls to their lord. They are not blinded by rage, and despatch their lessers with martial precision to ensure no foe escapes.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','10','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, KHORNE, LEADER, BLOODLETTER, BLOODREAPER',32,0,'Combat'),('CHAOS','DAEM','BL',0,'FTR','Bloodletter Fighter','Bloodletters are Khorne\'s most numerous warriors, the foot soldiers of the Blood Legions. Their skin is the colour of spilt gore, and their muscles bulge in response to their rage. They carry jagged Hellblades in their taloned hands that glow with the energies of the Warp.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','9','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, KHORNE, BLOODLETTER, FIGHTER',32,0,'Combat'),('CHAOS','DAEM','BL',0,'HB','Bloodletter Horn Bearer','Accompanying the Blood Legions to war, some daemons bear immense brass war horns. They use these to sound the charge, spurring their diabolical brethren on in a red tide that sweeps away the living in a sea of blood.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','9','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, KHORNE, BLOODLETTER, HORN BEARER',32,0,'Combat'),('CHAOS','DAEM','BL',0,'IB','Bloodletter Icon Bearer','Bloodletters go to war under a semblance of martial affectation. Favoured deamons of their packs display blood-soaked banners, under which their howling kin rend and butcher Khorne\'s enemies with greater ferocity.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','9','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, KHORNE, BLOODLETTER, ICON BEARER',32,0,'Combat'),('CHAOS','DAEM','DETTE',1,'AL','Alluress','Most beauteous and yet more repulsive than most Daemonettes, Alluresses orchestrate their kin\'s slaughter with trilling songs of praise to Slaanesh. Their hypnotic glamour causes foes to falter in their presence, helpless as barbed claws and needle-like teeth close in.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','9','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, SLAANESH, LEADER, DAEMONETTE, ALLURESS',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('CHAOS','DAEM','DETTE',4,'FTR','Daemonette Fighter','Daemonettes are seductive harbingers of torment. They advance in a swift surge, dancing with impossible agility to pounce upon their victims with keening screams of horrific desire. They indulge in inflicting wounds with their razor-sharp claws.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, SLAANESH, DAEMONETTE, FIGHTER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('CHAOS','DAEM','DETTE',3,'HB','Daemonette Horn Bearer','Some Daemonettes brandish sinuous instruments that they play with lascivious exuberance. Emitting a supernatural resonance, they inflame the passions of other Daemonettes, the unnatural music goading them to more inventive debaucheries.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, SLAANESH, DAEMONETTE, HORN BEARER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('CHAOS','DAEM','DETTE',2,'IB','Daemonette Icon Bearer','The icons borne in the clawed grasp of some Daemonettes display the repulsive beauty embodied by Slaanesh. Under their baleful influence, the hedonistic daemons reach new heights of murderous excess.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, SLAANESH, DAEMONETTE, ICON BEARER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('CHAOS','DAEM','PB',0,'FTR','Plaguebearer Fighter','A Plaguebearer\'s body is swollen and bursting with contagion. They shamble purposefully forward with dour inevitability, bringing the promise of corruption with them. Despite their appearance, they swing their disease-laden plagueswords with great strength.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, NURGLE, PLAGUEBEARER, FIGHTER',32,0,'Staunch'),('CHAOS','DAEM','PB',0,'HB','Plaguebearer Horn Bearer','Plaguebearers utter a constant drone as they interminably tally all of Nurgle\'s endless diseases. Some of these fell daemons carry horns of pipes carved from rotten remains. From these, the elicit a dirge that stirs their kind into rapid advance.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, NURGLE, PLAGUEBEARER, HORN BEARER',32,0,'Staunch'),('CHAOS','DAEM','PB',0,'IB','Plaguebearer Icon Bearer','These daemons carry stinking icons of Nurgle into the realm of realspace, the poisonous totems dripping with pus and surrounded by clouds of fat flies. Doleful bells hang from these grim icons, tolling out the death knells of the daemon\'s foes.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, NURGLE, PLAGUEBEARER, ICON BEARER',32,0,'Staunch'),('CHAOS','DAEM','PB',0,'PR','Plagueridden','Despite their death\'s head rictus grin, Plageridden are devoted to the serious business of spreading Nurgle\'s bounteous plagues across reality. They often bear signs fo Nurgle\'s favour - such as more elaborate horns - and direct other Plaguebearers in his grand plans.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','9','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, NURGLE, LEADER, PLAGUEBEARER, PLAGUERIDDEN',32,0,'Staunch'),('CHAOS','DAEM','PH',0,'FTR','Pink Horror Fighter','Pink Horrors are magic made manifest. They caper and whirl, cackling as bolts of raw sorcery leap from their clawed fingertips. These coruscating streams of multicoloured flame do not merely burn, they turn their victims into hedeous or nonsensical forms.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, TZEENTCH, PINK HORROR, FIGHTER',32,0,'Marksman'),('CHAOS','DAEM','PH',0,'HB','Pink Horror Horn Bearer','Some Pink Horrors carry shimmering horns, often in the serpentine form of Tzeentch\'s own sigil. The daemons sound them at random moments, emitting mutating rhythms, streams of nebulous fire, or other strange discharges that send their kind wild with delight.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, TZEENTCH, PINK HORROR, HORN BEARER',32,0,'Marksman'),('CHAOS','DAEM','PH',0,'IB','Pink Horror Icon Bearer','Either held at the end of one gangling limb, or sprouting from the dameon\'s own flesh, favoured Pink Horrors carry a sorcerous icon of Tzeentch. Some of these devices burn with multi-hued fire, or twist into new shapes as their bearers gibber arcane litanies.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, TZEENTCH, PINK HORROR, ICON BEARER',32,0,'Marksman'),('CHAOS','DAEM','PH',0,'IR','Pink Horror Iridescent','Iridescent Horrors are imbued with a sliver of Tzeentch\'s immortal knowledge. They revel in leading their capering daemons in enacting Tzeentch\'s schemes.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','9','CHAOS DAEMON, CHAOS, DAEMON, TZEENTCH, LEADER, PINK HORROR, IRIDESCENT',32,0,'Marksman'),('CHAOS','DG','PM',0,'CHA','Plague Marine Champion','Riddled with stinking buboes and melded with their armour, these veterans grind their opponents down with expert strikes from the daemon-tainted blades.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','13','DEATH GUARD, CHAOS, BUBONIC ASTARTES, <PLAGUE COMPANY>, LEADER, PLAGUE MARINE, CHAMPION',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','DG','PM',0,'FTR','Plague Marine Fighter','Even before their fall to Chaos, the Death Guard were feared as terrifying trench fighters. Now, more dangerous than ever, their diseased muscles are swollen with power and their rotting senses ignore flesh wounds.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','DEATH GUARD, CHAOS, BUBONIC ASTARTES, <PLAGUE COMPANY>, PLAGUE MARINE, FIGHTER',32,0,'Staunch,Combat'),('CHAOS','DG','PM',0,'GNR','Plague Marine Gunner','For all their mutations, Plague Marines remain the perfect infantrymen. Tactically astute and well-equipped, Plague Marines units typically boast specialists capable of responding to any threat with a variety of ancient or Warp-tainted weapons.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','DEATH GUARD, CHAOS, BUBONIC ASTARTES, <PLAGUE COMPANY>, PLAGUE MARINE, GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','DG','PM',0,'HGNR','Plague Marine Heavy Gunner','Against more numerous opposition, heavily armed Plague Marines unleash gouts of foulness from Plague Spewers and armour-piercing shells from Blight Launchers.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','DEATH GUARD, CHAOS, BUBONIC ASTARTES, <PLAGUE COMPANY>, PLAGUE MARINE, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','DG','PM',0,'IB','Plague Marine Icon Bearer','Displaying their devotion to the Chaos God Nurgle for all to witness, these warriors hold aloft a hideous sigil or standard of their deity. Such Plague Marines are typically chosen from amongst those seen as blessed by Nurgle with the most hideous afflictions.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','DEATH GUARD, CHAOS, BUBONIC ASTARTES, <PLAGUE COMPANY>, PLAGUE MARINE, ICON BEARER',32,0,'Staunch'),('CHAOS','DG','PM',0,'WAR','Plague Marine Warrior','Bloated with corruption, the Plague Marines\' rusted power armour is cracked, but thanks to Nurgle\'s blessings they are unnaturally resilient and inured to pain. They advance inexorably up their foes, ignoring horrendous wounds and unleashing hails of boltfire.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','DEATH GUARD, CHAOS, BUBONIC ASTARTES, <PLAGUE COMPANY>, PLAGUE MARINE, WARRIOR',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','DG','PW',0,'PW','Poxwalker','Poxwalkers are all that remain of the victims of an arcane plague. Given animus through the disease\'s corrupting power, these moaning cadavers are slow and clumsy, but they will never stop, ignoring even mortal wounds.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','6+','7','DEATH GUARD, CHAOS, POXWALKER',32,0,'N/A'),('CHAOS','FELL','FELL',1,'DK','Fellgor Deathknell','Beastmen are hunters, and the Fellgor Ravagers are skilled above the rest of their kind. Deathknells carry into battle great war gongs which they use to beat the hunt, signal their packmates, and herald the doom of the enemy.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, DEATHKNELL',32,0,'Staunch'),('CHAOS','FELL','FELL',2,'FB','Fellgor Fluxbray','Many a Fellgor Ravager desires the blessings of the gods. Fluxbrays have been gifted with an extra limb, all the better for carrying additional weapons into battle. When they reach the fray, they launch a multitude of blows that are all but impossible to evade for long.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, FLUXBRAY',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('CHAOS','FELL','FELL',4,'GH','Fellgor Gorehorn','Some Fellgor Ravagers harbour a thirst for blood greater than that of their fellows, throwing themselves into battle with wild abandon. Carnage swiftly follows as they hack off the arms and heads of their foes in violent sprays of viscera.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, GOREHORN',32,0,'Combat'),('CHAOS','FELL','FELL',3,'GS','Fellgor Gnarlscar','Fellgor Ravagers never stop fighting, whether for prey or their place in the pecking order. Few last long, but those that do are heavily scarred, having sustained many injuries. Some are given crude bionics after suffering loss of limb or eye, rendering their appearance all the more fearsome.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, GNARLSCAR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','FELL','FELL',5,'HG','Fellgor Herd-Goad','Fellgor Ravagers have powerful senses as befits such capable hunters. Some relish the feeling of pain and inflicting torturous sensations on others. These Herd-Goads are blessed by the gods with whips infused with empyric power, which the Beastmen use to drive their fellows to fury as well as harm the enemy.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, HERD-GOAD',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('CHAOS','FELL','FELL',0,'IH','Fellgor Ironhorn','The leaders of the Fellgor Ravagers are warriors who have fought their way to the top of their pack. They are uniformly vicious killers, possessed of an inhuman cunning that they use to merciless effect.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','11','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, LEADER, IRONHORN',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','FELL','FELL',6,'MNG','Fellgor Mangler','Manglers have warp-given rage and power, enabling them to smash through bulkheads and deliver skull-crushing headbutts. Though they wear masks, they possess enhanced senses - some Beastmen claim Manglers can see the very souls of their victims as they rip them apart.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, MANGLER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('CHAOS','FELL','FELL',9,'SHA','Fellgor Shaman','Serving as obscene preachers to their kin as well as malevolent advisors to Ironhorns, Shamans are capable of wielding the raw power of Chaos. It is also Shamans who take the lead in the Fellgor Ravagers\' bloody ritual sacrifices before the packs\' herdstone.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, SHAMAN',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('CHAOS','FELL','FELL',8,'TOX','Fellgorn Toxhorn','Even more that the rest of their kind, Toxhorns take particular joy in destroying the technology of their foes. They revel in decay and unleashing the chemicals and toxins that accelerate it, whether against machine or living being.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, TOXHORN',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('CHAOS','FELL','FELL',7,'VND','Fellgor Vandal','Wielders of immense, two-handed mancrushers, Vandals have a simple task among the Fellgor Ravagers - smash apart anything and anyone they or their Ironhorn wish. With every hammering strike they pulversise armour, bone, and flesh.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, VANDAL',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('CHAOS','FELL','FELL',10,'WAR','Fellgor Warrior','The backbone of Fellgor Ravager packs, Warriors have a single duty - kill the enemy. This they do gladly, knowing that the more devastation they cause, the more favour they will gain with the rest of the herd, as well as with the gods themselves.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('CHAOS','FELL24','FELL24',1,'DK','Fellgor Deathknell','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, DEATHKNELL',32,0,''),('CHAOS','FELL24','FELL24',2,'FB','Fellgor Fluxbray','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, FLUXBRAY',32,0,''),('CHAOS','FELL24','FELL24',4,'GH','Fellgor Gorehorn','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, GOREHORN',32,0,''),('CHAOS','FELL24','FELL24',3,'GS','Fellgor Gnarlscar','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','11','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, GNARLSCAR',32,0,''),('CHAOS','FELL24','FELL24',5,'HG','Fellgor Herd-Goad','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, HERD-GOAD',32,0,''),('CHAOS','FELL24','FELL24',0,'IH','Fellgor Ironhorn','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','11','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, LEADER, IRONHORN',32,0,''),('CHAOS','FELL24','FELL24',6,'MNG','Fellgor Mangler','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','11','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, MANGLER',32,0,''),('CHAOS','FELL24','FELL24',7,'SHA','Fellgor Shaman','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, SHAMAN',32,0,''),('CHAOS','FELL24','FELL24',8,'TOX','Fellgorn Toxhorn','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, TOXHORN',32,0,''),('CHAOS','FELL24','FELL24',9,'VND','Fellgor Vandal','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, VANDAL',32,0,''),('CHAOS','FELL24','FELL24',10,'WAR','Fellgor Warrior','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','10','FELLGOR RAVAGER, CHAOS, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('CHAOS','GPI','GPI',1,'BS','Bloatspawn','Said to be things born our of darkest nightmare, Bloatspawn drip watery slime with every thudding step. Their writing masses of tentacles grasp and tear at everything around them, dragging wailing victims into the foetid prisons of their bloated bodies.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','18','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, NURGLE, NIGHTMARE HULK,  BLOATSPAWN',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('CHAOS','GPI','GPI',2,'FS','Fleshscreamer','Clutching implements of brutal butchery, the chorus of dozens of wailing mouths accompanies Fleshscreamers into the fight. Ever ravenous to fill their many maws with rotting flesh and sparking machinery, they wade into the foe like nightmares given form.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','18','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, NURGLE, NIGHTMARE HULK,  FLESHSCREAMER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('CHAOS','GPI','GPI',5,'GL','Glitchling','These deviant plague mites caper and giggle as they infest enemy lines. They delight in the technological mayhem their presense spreads, and are all too happy to bury their victims in a clawing, biting mass for the glory of Grandfather Nurgle.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','2','5+','3','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, NURGLE, GLITCHLING',32,0,'Scout'),('CHAOS','GPI','GPI',4,'GM','Gellerpox Mutant','The Gellerpox works nightmare changes upon its victims, deadening their nerves and twisting their bodies into gross and dangerous new forms. Melded with lumps of malfunctioning technology and stolen metalwork, they lurch into the fight with static-laced groans.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','5+','7','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, NURGLE, GELLERPOX MUTANT',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('CHAOS','GPI','GPI',3,'LG','Lumberghast','These Nightmare Hulks bear gruesome signs of verminous corruption. Insectile limbs and heads sprout frrom their mutant bodies, twitching with their own ghastly life. It is death to stand before such a resilient monster, for they attack with febrile savagery.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','18','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, NURGLE, NIGHTMARE HULK,  LUMBERGHAST',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('CHAOS','GPI','GPI',0,'VTC','Vulgrar Thrice-Cursed','Once, this hulking horror was the master of the New Dawn\'s boilermen. Now, he and others like him have become bloated monsters, melded with those who trusted them and the tainted machines that were once in their care.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','19','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, NURGLE, NIGHTMARE HULK, LEADER, VULGRAR THRICE-CURSED',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('CHAOS','GPI','MV',0,'CM','Cursemite','These revolting creatures were once simple fleas, of the sort that infest every pilgrim\'s robes and labourer\'s shift. Grown monstrous, they can spring through the air as fast as a bullet frrom an autogun, and drain a grown Human of blood in moments.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','2','5+','2','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, NURGLE, MUTOID VERMIN, FLY, CURSEMITE',32,0,'N/A'),('CHAOS','GPI','MV',1,'ESS','Eyestinger Swarm','The shrill whine of insectile wings warns of the approach of the Eyestinger Swarms. Not only are there freakish insects dangerous in their own right, but they also lay their eggs in their victims\' eyes, where they swiftly gestate and burst forth in fresh swarms.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','2','5+','2','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, NURGLE, MUTOID VERMIN, FLY, EYESTINGER SWARM',32,0,'N/A'),('CHAOS','GPI','MV',2,'SG','Sludge-Grub','Fatted with pus and slime, these noxious worms can spit gobbets of corrosive bile over great distances to blind and maim their prey. Should they get close, they latch on with savage tenacity and force their victims to tear and burst them, dousing the foe in acidic filth.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','2','2','5+','2','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, NURGLE, MUTOID VERMIN, SLUDGE-GRUB',32,0,'N/A'),('CHAOS','GPI24','GPI24',2,'BS','Bloatspawn','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','5+','20','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, NIGHTMARE HULK,  BLOATSPAWN',32,0,''),('CHAOS','GPI24','GPI24',7,'CM','Cursemite','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','6+','2','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, MUTOID VERMIN, FLY, CURSEMITE',32,0,''),('CHAOS','GPI24','GPI24',8,'ESS','Eyestinger Swarm','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','6+','2','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, MUTOID VERMIN, FLY, EYESTINGER SWARM',32,0,''),('CHAOS','GPI24','GPI24',3,'FS','Fleshscreamer','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','5+','20','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, NIGHTMARE HULK,  FLESHSCREAMER',32,0,''),('CHAOS','GPI24','GPI24',6,'GL','Glitchling','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','6+','3','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, GLITCHLING',32,0,''),('CHAOS','GPI24','GPI24',5,'GM','Gellerpox Mutant','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','5+','7','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, GELLERPOX MUTANT',32,0,''),('CHAOS','GPI24','GPI24',4,'LG','Lumberghast','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','5+','20','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, NIGHTMARE HULK,  LUMBERGHAST',32,0,''),('CHAOS','GPI24','GPI24',9,'SG','Sludge-Grub','','kt24','4\"','2','0','0','6+','2','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, MUTOID VERMIN, SLUDGE-GRUB',32,0,''),('CHAOS','GPI24','GPI24',1,'VTC','Vulgrar Thrice-Cursed','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','5+','21','GELLERPOX INFECTED, CHAOS, NIGHTMARE HULK, LEADER, VULGRAR THRICE-CURSED',32,0,''),('CHAOS','LEG','LEG',0,'AC','Legionary Aspiring Champion','Aspiring Champions are the strongest and most merciless of their brothers. These blood-soaked warriors enforce their will through brutal acts of might, seeking to become favioured of the Dark Gods.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','13','LEGIONARY, CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, <LEGION>, <MARK OF CHAOS>, LEADER, LEGIONARY ASPIRING CHAMPION',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','LEG','LEG',0,'ANO','Legionary Anointed','Some Heretic Astartes thirst for power and any cost, and offer themselves wholly to Chaos. They become willing hosts to the immaterial creatures of the Warp. This is a slow and painful process, and those in the early stages are known as Anointed due to their mutations.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','LEGIONARY, CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, <LEGION>, <MARK OF CHAOS>, LEGIONARY ANOINTED',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Scout'),('CHAOS','LEG','LEG',0,'BA','Legionary Balefire Acolyte','Balefire Acolytes are psykers blessed by the Chaos Gods with the dark power of the empyrean, which they tunr indiscriminately upon the foe. Many also carry blades made even deadlier thanks to the power of the Warp they are infused with.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','LEGIONARY, CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, <LEGION>, <MARK OF CHAOS>, PSYKER, LEGIONARY BALEFIRE ACOLYTE',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','LEG','LEG',0,'BUT','Legionary Butcher','Bloodthirsty madmen, Butchers are Heretic Astartes that fight without subtlety of any kind in combat. They deal furious strikes with their enormous Chain Axes, which can carve enemies to pieces.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','LEGIONARY, CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, <LEGION>, <MARK OF CHAOS>, LEGIONARY BUTCHER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('CHAOS','LEG','LEG',0,'CHO','Legionary Chosen','Chosen are amongst the most experienced and dedicated Heretic Astartes. They are favoured within their bitter brotherhoods, wearing baroque armour and equipped with the finest wargear. They are more hard-bitten and callous than even others of their kind.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','13','LEGIONARY, CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, <LEGION>, <MARK OF CHAOS>, LEADER, LEGIONARY CHOSEN',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','LEG','LEG',0,'GNR','Legionary Gunner','Armed with flamers, Heretic Astartes burn through swathes of light enemy infantry. With Meltaguns they destroy armoured bunkers and with Plasma Guns they pose a threat to the heaviest of enemy troops','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','LEGIONARY, CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, <LEGION>, <MARK OF CHAOS>, LEGIONARY GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','LEG','LEG',0,'HGNR','Legionary Heavy Gunner','Heretic Astartes bearing heavy weapons provide devastating anti-infantry and anti-armour firepower, dominating large swathes of any killzone.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','LEGIONARY, CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, <LEGION>, <MARK OF CHAOS>, LEGIONARY HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','LEG','LEG',0,'IB','Legionary Icon Bearer','Many Heretic Astartes kill teams include Icon Bearers - warriors bearing totems, banners, or standards dedicated to the glory of the Dark Gods.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','LEGIONARY, CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, <LEGION>, <MARK OF CHAOS>, LEGIONARY ICON BEARER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','LEG','LEG',0,'STL','Legionary ShriveTalon','Inflicting pain and torture becomes a near-addiction for some Heretic Astartes. Those who embrace this propensity become known as ShriveTalons, and they stalk the battlefield looking for enemies to torment.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','LEGIONARY, CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, <LEGION>, <MARK OF CHAOS>, LEGIONARY SHRIVETALON',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('CHAOS','LEG','LEG',0,'WAR','Legionary Warrior','Heretic Astartes are posthuman warriors with the natural strength, speed, resilience, and mental acuity of such beings. Now they have turned against the Imperium.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','LEGIONARY, CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, <LEGION>, <MARK OF CHAOS>, LEGIONARY WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','LEG24','LEG24',1,'AC','Legionary Aspiring Champion','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','15','LEGIONARY , CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, LEADER, ASPIRING CHAMPION',32,0,''),('CHAOS','LEG24','LEG24',3,'ANO','Legionary Anointed','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','LEGIONARY , CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, ANOINTED',32,0,''),('CHAOS','LEG24','LEG24',4,'BA','Legionary Balefire Acolyte','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','LEGIONARY , CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, PSYKER, BALEFIRE ACOLYTE',32,0,''),('CHAOS','LEG24','LEG24',5,'BUT','Legionary Butcher','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','LEGIONARY , CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, BUTCHER',32,0,''),('CHAOS','LEG24','LEG24',2,'CHO','Legionary Chosen','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','15','LEGIONARY , CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, LEADER, CHOSEN',32,0,''),('CHAOS','LEG24','LEG24',6,'GNR','Legionary Gunner','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','LEGIONARY , CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, GUNNER',32,0,''),('CHAOS','LEG24','LEG24',7,'HGNR','Legionary Heavy Gunner','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','LEGIONARY , CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,''),('CHAOS','LEG24','LEG24',