'MAL','Malignant Plaguecaster','','kt24','5\"','3','0','0','3+','14','PLAGUE MARINE , CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, PSYKER, MALIGNANT PLAGUECASTER',32,1,''),('CHAOS','PM24','PM24',7,'WAR','Plague Marine Warrior','','kt24','5\"','3','0','0','3+','14','PLAGUE MARINE , CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, WARRIOR',32,1,''),('CHAOS','TS','RUB',0,'GNR','Rubric Marine Gunner','With their armour\'s servos infused with sorcery, the spirit wihin a Rubric Marine\'s shell easily hefts the heaviest of arcane weapons. Their Soulreaper Cannons shoot streams of shells alight with magical power, while their Warpflamers unleash gouts of iridescent fire.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','12','THOUSAND SONS, CHAOS, ARCANA ASTARTES, <GREAT CULT>, RUBRIC MARINE, GUNNER',32,0,''),('CHAOS','TS','RUB',0,'IB','Rubric Marine Icon Bearer','Rubric Marines and their masters ultimately serve the schemes of the Chaos God Tzeentch. Some of these arcane warriors bear sorcerous icons of the Changer of the Ways that crawl with corsucating energy, searing the unenlightened with mutating flames.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','12','THOUSAND SONS, CHAOS, ARCANA ASTARTES, <GREAT CULT>, RUBRIC MARINE, ICON BEARER',32,0,''),('CHAOS','TS','RUB',0,'SOR','Aspiring Sorcerer','An Aspiring Sorcerer who has gained control over a unit of Rubric Marines yokes them to his will. He directs them like a puppeteer, employing them as bulwarks against his foes while channelling his dark magics of manipulation through a spychically attuned force staff.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','13','THOUSAND SONS., CHAOS, ARCANA ASTARTES, <GREAT CULT>, PSYKER, LEADER, RUBRIC MARINE, ASPIRING SORCERER',32,0,''),('CHAOS','TS','RUB',0,'WAR','Rubric Marine Warrior','Rubric Marines are animated suits of power armour inhabited by the bound souls of thier former occupants. With ruinous proficiency, they steadily fire bursts of eldritch shells from their Inferno Boltguns, advancing upon their psychic master\'s enemies.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','12','THOUSAND SONS, CHAOS, ARCANA ASTARTES, <GREAT CULT>, RUBRIC MARINE, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('CHAOS','TS','TZA',0,'FTR','Tzaangor Fighter','Tzaangors are mutated fusions of avian beasts and corrupted humans. In thrall to Tzeentch, they serve the Thousand Sons as bestial shock troops, attacking with savage blows from ritual blades and tearing flesh with their jagged beaks.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','THOUSAND SONS, CHAOS, TZAANGOR, FIGHTER',32,0,''),('CHAOS','TS','TZA',0,'HB','Tzaangor Horn Bearer','Often, a member of a Tzaangor flock will carry a daemonically mawed instrument, the piercing blasts of which stir its fellow creatures into a bestial frenzy. Their shrill cries echo and their horns clatter together as they vie to be first into the fray to hack their victims apart.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','THOUSAND SONS, CHAOS, TZAANGOR, HORN BEARER',32,0,''),('CHAOS','TS','TZA',0,'IB','Tzaangor Icon Bearer','Driven by a desire to accumulate arcane knowledge, Tzaangor hop to use such a prize to gain even more favour with Tzeentch. Particularly fervent Tzaangor carry sinuous icons and banners they believe draw their desity\'s gaze and mutative blessings.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','THOUSAND SONS, CHAOS, TZAANGOR, ICON BEARER',32,0,''),('CHAOS','TS','TZA',0,'TB','Twistbray','The most savage member of a flock is a Twistbray, usually bearing the most extreme mutations of their creator-god. Raised by Tzeentch above the predatory instincts of their fellow mutatns, they exhibit great cunning, formulating complex ploys to outwit their prey.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','9','THOUSAND SONS, CHAOS, LEADER, TZAANGOR, TWISTBRAY',32,0,''),('CHAOS','WC','WC',0,'GNR','Rubric Marine Gunner','With their armour\'s servos infused with sorcery, the spirit within a Rubric Marine\'s shell easily hefts the heaviest of arcane weapons. Their soulreaper cannons shoot streams of shells alight with magical power, while their warpflamers unleash gouts of iridescent fire.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','WARPCOVEN, CHAOS, ARCANA ASTARTES, <GREAT CULT>, RUBRIC MARINE, GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','WC','WC',0,'IB','Rubric Marine Icon Bearer','Rubric Marines and their masters ultimately serve the schemes of the Chaos God Tzeentch. Some of these arcane warriors bear sorcerous icons of the Changer of the Ways that crawl with coruscating energy, which the sorcerers can draw upon to enhance their power.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','WARPCOVEN, CHAOS, ARCANA ASTARTES, <GREAT CULT>, RUBRIC MARINE, ICON BEARER',32,0,'Staunch'),('CHAOS','WC','WC',0,'SOR','Sorcerer','Sorcerers are the leaders of the Thousand Sons Legion. They control forces of Rubric Marines, having yoked them to their will. Sorcerers direct them like puppeteers, employing Rubric Marines as bulwarks against their foes as they channel dark magics of manipulation through their psychically attuned weapons.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','13','WARPCOVEN, CHAOS, ARCANA ASTARTES, <GREAT CULT>, PSYKER, SORCERER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','WC','WC',0,'TZC','Tzaangor Champion','These ferocious Tzaangor wield enormous two-handed blades or axes that can cleave enemy warriors in two. It takes fighters with great skill as well as aggression to carry such formidable weapons, and they cause as much terror as they do casualties.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','9','WARPCOVEN, CHAOS, TZAANGOR, CHAMPION',32,0,'Combat'),('CHAOS','WC','WC',0,'TZFTR','Tzaangor Fighter','Tzaangor fighters are mutated fusions of avian beasts and corrupted Humans. In thrall to Tzeentch, they serve the Thousand Sons as bestial shock troops, attacking with savage blows from ritual blades and tearing flesh with their jagged beaks.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','9','WARPCOVEN, CHAOS, TZAANGOR, FIGHTER',32,0,'Combat, Scout'),('CHAOS','WC','WC',0,'TZHB','Tzaangor Horn Bearer','Often, a member of a Tzaangor flock will carry a daemonically mawed instrument, the piercing blasts of which stir its fellow creatures into a bestial frenzy. Their shrill cries echo and their horns clatter together as they vie to be first into the fray to hack their victims apart.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','9','WARPCOVEN, CHAOS, TZAANGOR, HORN BEARER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('CHAOS','WC','WC',0,'TZIB','Tzaangor Icon Bearer','Driven by a desire to accumulate arcane knowledge, Tzaangor hope to use such a prize to gain even more favour with Tzeentch. Particularly fervent Tzaangor carry sinuous icons and banners they believe draw their deity’s gaze and mutative blessings.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','9','WARPCOVEN, CHAOS, TZAANGOR, ICON BEARER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('CHAOS','WC','WC',0,'WAR','Rubric Marine Warrior','Rubric Marine Warriors are animated suits of power armour inhabited by the bound souls of their former occupants. With ruinous proficiency, they steadily fire bursts of eldritch shells from their inferno boltguns, advancing upon their psychic masters’ enemies.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','WARPCOVEN, CHAOS, ARCANA ASTARTES, <GREAT CULT>, RUBRIC MARINE, WARRIOR',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('CHAOS','WC24','WC24',4,'GNR','Rubric Marine Gunner','','kt24','5\"','3','0','0','2+','14','WARPCOVEN , CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, RUBRIC MARINE, GUNNER',32,0,''),('CHAOS','WC24','WC24',5,'IB','Rubric Marine Icon Bearer','','kt24','5\"','3','0','0','2+','14','WARPCOVEN , CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, RUBRIC MARINE, ICON BEARER',32,0,''),('CHAOS','WC24','WC24',1,'SOD','Sorcerer Of Destiny','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','WARPCOVEN , CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, PSYKER, SORCERER, DESTINY',32,0,''),('CHAOS','WC24','WC24',2,'SOT','Sorcerer Of Tempyrion','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','WARPCOVEN , CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, PSYKER, SORCERER, TEMPYRION',32,0,''),('CHAOS','WC24','WC24',3,'SOW','Sorcerer Of Warpfire','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','WARPCOVEN , CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, PSYKER, SORCERER, WARPFIRE',32,0,''),('CHAOS','WC24','WC24',7,'TZC','Tzaangor Champion','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','10','WARPCOVEN , CHAOS, TZAANGOR, CHAMPION',32,0,''),('CHAOS','WC24','WC24',8,'TZHB','Tzaangor Horn Bearer','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','9','WARPCOVEN , CHAOS, TZAANGOR, HORN BEARER',32,0,''),('CHAOS','WC24','WC24',9,'TZIB','Tzaangor Icon Bearer','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','9','WARPCOVEN , CHAOS, TZAANGOR, ICON BEARER',32,0,''),('CHAOS','WC24','WC24',10,'TZWAR','Tzaangor Warrior','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','9','WARPCOVEN , CHAOS, TZAANGOR, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('CHAOS','WC24','WC24',6,'WAR','Rubric Marine Warrior','','kt24','5\"','3','0','0','2+','14','WARPCOVEN , CHAOS, HERETIC ASTARTES, RUBRIC MARINE, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('HBR','AEF','AEF',4,'CAL','Callidus Assassin','The all-female Assassins of the Officio Assassinorum\'s Callidus Temple are the most subtle of the Imperium of Man\'s secret operatives, specialising in deceit and the use of artful deception to accomplish their objectives, usually assisted in their bloody tasks by the shape-changing Polymorphine drug.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','6+','12','ASSASSIN EXECUTION FORCE, IMPERIUM, CALLIDUS ASSASSIN',32,2,'Scout'),('HBR','AEF','AEF',2,'CUL','Culexus Assassin','The Culexus Temple is one of the most sinister and feared orders of the Officio Assassinorum and its Assassins have been described by Aeldari Warlocks as nothing short of the embodiment of pure evil. Even amongst the upper ecehlons of the Officio Assassinorum this Temple is always viewed with extreme caution.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','6+','12','ASSASSIN EXECUTION FORCE, IMPERIUM, CULEXUS ASSASSIN',32,2,'Staunch,Marksman,Scout'),('HBR','AEF','AEF',3,'EVS','Eversor Assassin','The Eversor Temple is possibly the most gruesome of the many Temples that train Imperial Assassins for the Officio Assassinorum. The Eversor Assassins specialise in shock and terror tactics, instilling fear of Imperial retribution into the hearts and minds of all who hold positions of power in the Imperium of Man.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','6+','12','ASSASSIN EXECUTION FORCE, IMPERIUM, EVERSOR ASSASSIN',32,2,'Combat,Scout'),('HBR','AEF','AEF',1,'VND','Vindicare Assassin','Vindicare operatives are the most skilled snipers and marksmen in the Imperium of Man and are usually direted to assassinate targets who are believed to have been possessed by daemonic entities or to have been corrupted by the Ruinous Powers of Chaos.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','6+','12','ASSASSIN EXECUTION FORCE, IMPERIUM, VINDICARE ASSASSIN',32,2,'Marksman,Scout'),('HBR','MALNPO','DEMO',4,'HVY','Demolition Heavy','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','DEMOLITIONS, NPO, HEAVY',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','DEMO',3,'TGH','Demolition Tough','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','10','DEMOLITIONS, NPO, TOUGH',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','DEMO',1,'TRP','Demolition Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','DEMOLITIONS, NPO, TROOPER',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','DEMO',2,'WAR','Demolition Warrior','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','DEMOLITIONS, NPO, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','DIM',4,'HVY','Diminutive Heavy','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','10','DIMINUTIVE, NPO, HEAVY',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','DIM',3,'TGH','Diminutive Tough','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','DIMINUTIVE, NPO, TOUGH',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','DIM',1,'TRP','Diminutive Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','5','DIMINUTIVE, NPO, TROOPER',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','DIM',2,'WAR','Diminutive Warrior','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','DIMINUTIVE, NPO, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','FRZ',4,'HVY','Frenzied Heavy','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','FRENZIED, NPO, HEAVY',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','FRZ',3,'TGH','Frenzied Tough','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','10','FRENZIED, NPO, TOUGH',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','FRZ',1,'TRP','Frenzied Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','FRENZIED, NPO, TROOPER',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','FRZ',2,'WAR','Frenzied Warrior','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','FRENZIED, NPO, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','FTR',4,'HVY','Fighter Heavy','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','FIGHTER, NPO, HEAVY',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','FTR',3,'TGH','Fighter Tough','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','10','FIGHTER, NPO, TOUGH',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','FTR',1,'TRP','Fighter Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','FIGHTER, NPO, TROOPER',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','FTR',2,'WAR','Fighter Warrior','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','FIGHTER, NPO, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','INF',4,'HVY','Infiltrator Heavy','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','INFILTRATOR, NPO, HEAVY',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','INF',3,'TGH','Infiltrator Tough','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','10','INFILTRATOR, NPO, TOUGH',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','INF',1,'TRP','Infiltrator Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','INFILTRATOR, NPO, TROOPER',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','INF',2,'WAR','Infiltrator Warrior','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','INFILTRATOR, NPO, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','SHT',4,'HVY','Shooter Heavy','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','SHOOTER, NPO, HEAVY',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','SHT',3,'TGH','Shooter Tough','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','10','SHOOTER, NPO, TOUGH',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','SHT',1,'TRP','Shooter Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','SHOOTER, NPO, TROOPER',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','SHT',2,'WAR','Shooter Warrior','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','SHOOTER, NPO, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','SLD',4,'HVY','Soldier Heavy','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','SOLDIER, NPO, HEAVY',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','SLD',3,'TGH','Soldier Tough','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','10','SOLDIER, NPO, TOUGH',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','SLD',1,'TRP','Soldier Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','SOLDIER, NPO, TROOPER',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','SLD',2,'WAR','Soldier Warrior','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','SOLDIER, NPO, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','SPEC',4,'HVY','Specialist Heavy','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','4+','14','SPECIALIST, NPO, HEAVY',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','SPEC',3,'TGH','Specialist Tough','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','10','SPECIALIST, NPO, TOUGH',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','SPEC',1,'TRP','Specialist Trooper','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','5+','7','SPECIALIST, NPO, TROOPER',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','SPEC',2,'WAR','Specialist Warrior','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','4+','8','SPECIALIST, NPO, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','TAC',4,'HVY','Tactical Heavy','','kt24','5\"','3','0','0','2+','14','TACTICAL, NPO, HEAVY',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','TAC',3,'TGH','Tactical Tough','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','TACTICAL, NPO, TOUGH',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','TAC',1,'TRP','Tactical Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','TACTICAL, NPO, TROOPER',32,0,''),('HBR','MALNPO','TAC',2,'WAR','Tactical Warrior','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','4+','10','TACTICAL, NPO, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('HBR','SHV','SHV',2,'FTR','Space Hulk Veteran Fighter','Always seen at the spearhead of any Astartes assault, Terminators will use close combat weapons such as the Thunder Hammer and Lightning Claws to crush their enemies in ruthless assaults.\nWith these brutally efficient weapons, combined with their battlefield experience and immense bulk, they make short work of the enemies of Mankind.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','2+','18','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, TERMINATOR, SPACE HULK VETERAN, FIGHTER',32,0,''),('HBR','SHV','SHV',1,'GNR','Space Hulk Veteran Gunner','Terminator Gunners provide devastating and accurate fire for their brothers.\nArmed with either an Assault Cannon to unleash hails of long range firepower at the enemy, or Heavy Flamers to cover entrenched enemies in torrents of flame.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','2+','18','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, TERMINATOR, SPACE HULK VETERAN, GUNNER',32,0,''),('HBR','SHV','SHV',0,'SGT','Space Hulk Veteran Sergeant','Each Terminator is a Veteran and competent battlefield leader in their own right.\nThose who prove their leadership will be promoted to Sergeant and be tasked with leading squads of Terminators into battle.\nThese level-header and brave Veterans are capable of achieving the most difficult of missions almost singlehandedly.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','2+','18','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, TERMINATOR, SPACE HULK SERGEANT, LEADER',32,0,''),('HBR','SHV','SHV',3,'WAR','Space Hulk Veteran Warrior','Only the greatest heroes of Mankind are permitted to wear Terminator armour.\nCenturies of battlefield experience combined with some of the Imperium\'s most devastating weaponry make these Veterans the perfect battlefield asset to achieve a number of missions, from boarding newly discovered Space Hulks to assaulting enemy Titans.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','2+','18','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, TERMINATOR, SPACE HULK VETERAN, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('HBR','WDR','WDR',3,'WDB','Warpdiver Breacher','Breachers sacrifice their mobility to be able to bear the mightiest warpdiver weapons and to unleash volley after volley of heavy fire; because nothing protects imperial space better than bullets.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','9','WARPDIVERS, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, WARPDIVER, BREACHER',32,2,''),('HBR','WDR','WDR',4,'WDM','Warpdiver Marksman','Marksmen prefer to take down their foes from afar, putting them down with powerful ammunitions and precise shots before they become a threat to other warpdivers.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','WARPDIVERS, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, WARPDIVER, MARKSMAN',32,2,''),('HBR','WDR','WDR',5,'WDS','Warpdiver Specialist','Armed with some of the most advanced equipment available to the Astra Militarum, warpdiver specialists are deployed to take care of xenos and heretics with tailored weaponry.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','WARPDIVERS, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, WARPDIVER, SPECIALIST',32,2,''),('HBR','WDR','WDR',2,'WDT','Warpdiver Trooper','Fresh out of training and armed with standard-issue rifles and righteous hate for xenos, troopers constitute the backbone of any warpdiver team.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','4+','8','WARPDIVERS, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, WARPDIVER, TROOPER',32,2,''),('HBR','WDR','WDR',1,'WDV','Warpdiver Veteran','Warpdivers that successfully return from their first dives are destined to become veterans, unflinching paragons of liberty ready to the deliver the wrath of the Emperor in brutal close quarter combat','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','9','WARPDIVERS, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, WARPDIVER, LEADER, VETERAN',32,2,''),('IMP','AES','AES',1,'CAST','Arbites Castigator','It is the Castigator\'s role to ensure that the guilty receive due punishment, their hood-like helps steeling their resolve against curses and pleas alike. Once the quarry is located, the Castigator is charged with their subdual by any means - a task they perform with zealous dedication.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, CASTIGATOR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','AES','AES',2,'CHI','Arbites Chirurgant','These Arbitrators are highly skilled medical specialists, used to treating debilitating wounds inflicted by those resisting detention. They are also skilled in the tactical questioning of prisoners and have studied the limits to which the body can be pushed to elicit answers.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, MEDIC, ARBITES, CHIRURGANT',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','AES','AES',3,'GNR','Arbites Gunner','Gunners provide substantial firepower to Exaction Squad operations using weapons such as Heavy Stubbers - rapid-firing cannons whose solid shot can scythe through mobs. More specialist weapons may fire chemicals that paralyze, or grenades that crack open doors and armour alike.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','AES','AES',4,'LSH','Arbites Leashmaster','Leashmasters are specialists who command the caniform servitors known as Cyber-Mastiffs. They direct override the construct\'s basic protocols with advanced commands, and broadcast shouted orders to their guilt-ridden prey via the Cyber-Mastiff\'s emitters.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, LEASHMASTER',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','AES','AES',6,'MAL','Arbites Malocator','Technically gifted, Malocators carry bio-sample extractors to gather trace evidence on their team\'s quarry. They operate with an icy calm under fire, scrutinising evidence via their veriscant multi-lens array and informing their team of enemy weaknesses.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, MALOCATOR',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','AES','AES',7,'MRK','Arbites Marksman','The rabble-rouser lurking behind those they incite, the heavily armed bodyguard, or the fleeing criminal about to escape - such are the targets of the Marksman. Their long-barrelled shotguns fire shells so powerful that they leave wounds more akin to gory craters than bullet holes.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, MARKSMAN',32,0,'Marksman'),('IMP','AES','AES',0,'PE','Arbites Proctor-Exactant','Exaction Squads are selected and let by Proctor-Exactants. These experienced Arbitrators are ruthless tacticians and savvy fighters. They are also intimidating embodiments of Imperial justice and employ nuncio-aquilas to broadcast deafening orations that cow the guilty into submission.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','9','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, LEADER, ARBITES, PROCTOR-EXACTANT',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','AES','AES',8,'REV','Arbites Revelatum','Revelatums reconnoitre their target\'s movements in advance of the rest of the team, scouting hideouts and ascertaining criminal contacts. They then lead other Arbitrators straight to the guilty, using their soulguilt scanners to identify threats to their fellow officers.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, REVELATUM',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','AES','AES',5,'RVR','R-VR Cyber-Mastiff','Arbitrators employ many servo-constructs for intimidation, security, and pursuit. The Rantal-class Venatus Reclamator is an advanced Cyber-Mastiff used by Exaction Squads. The R-VR\'s detectors enable the to track their prey, while their iron jaws can break bones or kill on command.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, R-VR CYBER-MASTIFF',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','AES','AES',9,'SUB','Arbites Subductor','Subductors possess one of the most recognisable - and feared - silhouettes to the Imperium\'s criminal classes. Bearing Subjugation-pattern Assault Shields and crackling Shock Mauls, they are brutal front line brawlers capable of crushing the most stubborn dissent.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, SUBDUCTOR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','AES','AES',10,'VIG','Arbites Vigilant','Vigilants brutally sweep the guilty from existence with the signature Combat Shotgun of the Adeptus Arbites. These grim men and women are ever alert to malfeasance and unwavering in its punishment, unleashing devastating blasts at close range.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, VIGILANT',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','AES','AES',11,'VOX','Arbites Vox-Signifier','The team\'s Vox-Signifier listens for coded missives from mission command on their powerful precinct vox-relay. They issue updates to the rest of the Exaction Squad arising from changes to mission priorities and new intelligence - likely painfully extracted from prisoners.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, VOX-SIGNIFIER',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','AES24','AES24',2,'CAST','Arbites Castigator','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, CASTIGATOR',32,0,''),('IMP','AES24','AES24',3,'CHI','Arbites Chirurgant','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, MEDIC, ARBITES, CHIRURGANT',32,0,''),('IMP','AES24','AES24',4,'GNR','Arbites Gunner','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, GUNNER',32,0,''),('IMP','AES24','AES24',5,'LSH','Arbites Leashmaster','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, LEASHMASTER',32,0,''),('IMP','AES24','AES24',7,'MAL','Arbites Malocator','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, MALOCATOR',32,0,''),('IMP','AES24','AES24',8,'MRK','Arbites Marksman','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, MARKSMAN',32,0,''),('IMP','AES24','AES24',1,'PE','Arbites Proctor-Exactant','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','9','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, LEADER, ARBITES, PROCTOR-EXACTANT',32,0,''),('IMP','AES24','AES24',9,'REV','Arbites Revelatum','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, REVELATUM',32,0,''),('IMP','AES24','AES24',6,'RVR','R-VR Cyber-Mastiff','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, R-VR CYBER-MASTIFF',32,0,''),('IMP','AES24','AES24',10,'SUB','Arbites Subductor','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','3+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, SUBDUCTOR',32,0,''),('IMP','AES24','AES24',11,'VIG','Arbites Vigilant','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, VIGILANT',32,0,''),('IMP','AES24','AES24',12,'VOX','Arbites Vox-Signifier','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','EXACTION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, VOX-SIGNIFIER',32,0,''),('IMP','AOD','AOD',1,'ASGT','Assault Intercessor Sergeant','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','15','ANGEL OF DEATH , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, LEADER, ASSAULT INTERCESSOR, SERGEANT',32,0,''),('IMP','AOD','AOD',5,'AWAR','Assault Intercessor Warrior','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','ANGEL OF DEATH , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, ASSAULT INTERCESSOR, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('IMP','AOD','AOD',0,'CPT','Space Marine Captain','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','15','ANGEL OF DEATH , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, LEADER, SPACE MARINE CAPTAIN',32,0,''),('IMP','AOD','AOD',7,'GNR','Intercessor Gunner','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','ANGEL OF DEATH , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, INTERCESSOR, GUNNER',32,0,''),('IMP','AOD','AOD',4,'GRN','Assault Intercessor Grenadier','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','ANGEL OF DEATH , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, ASSAULT INTERCESSOR, GRENADIER',32,0,''),('IMP','AOD','AOD',6,'HGNR','Heavy Intercessor Gunner','','kt24','4\"','3','0','0','3+','18','ANGEL OF DEATH , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, HEAVY INTERCESSOR, GUNNER',32,0,''),('IMP','AOD','AOD',2,'ISGT','Intercessor Sergeant','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','15','ANGEL OF DEATH , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, LEADER, INTERCESSOR, SERGEANT',32,0,''),('IMP','AOD','AOD',3,'SNP','Eliminator Sniper','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','3+','12','ANGEL OF DEATH , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, ELIMINATOR, SNIPER',32,0,''),('IMP','AOD','AOD',8,'WAR','Intercessor Warrior','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','ANGEL OF DEATH , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, INTERCESSOR, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('IMP','DKK24','DKK24',2,'BRU','Death Korps Bruiser','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','DEATH KORPS , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, BRUISER',32,0,''),('IMP','DKK24','DKK24',3,'CON','Death Korps Confidant','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','DEATH KORPS , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, CONFIDANT',32,0,''),('IMP','DKK24','DKK24',4,'GNR','Death Korps Gunner','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','DEATH KORPS , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, GUNNER',32,0,''),('IMP','DKK24','DKK24',5,'MDC','Death Korps Medic','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','DEATH KORPS , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, MEDIC',32,0,''),('IMP','DKK24','DKK24',6,'SAP','Death Korps Sapper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','DEATH KORPS , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, SAPPER',32,0,''),('IMP','DKK24','DKK24',7,'SNP','Death Korps Sniper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','DEATH KORPS , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, SNIPER',32,0,''),('IMP','DKK24','DKK24',8,'SPT','Death Korps Spotter','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','DEATH KORPS , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, SPOTTER',32,0,''),('IMP','DKK24','DKK24',9,'TRP','Death Korps Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','DEATH KORPS , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, TROOPER',32,0,''),('IMP','DKK24','DKK24',10,'VET','Death Korps Veteran','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','DEATH KORPS , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, VETERAN',32,0,''),('IMP','DKK24','DKK24',11,'VOX','Death Korps Vox-Operator','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','DEATH KORPS , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, VOX-OPERATOR',32,0,''),('IMP','DKK24','DKK24',1,'WM','Death Korps Watchmaster','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','DEATH KORPS , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, LEADER, WATCHMASTER',32,0,''),('IMP','DKK24','DKK24',12,'ZLT','Death Korps Zealot','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','DEATH KORPS , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, ZEALOT',32,0,''),('IMP','ECC','AF',8,'AF','Arco-Flagellant','The Ecclesiarchy punishes those guilty of heresy in a number of ways. Those subjected to arco-flagellation are painfully remade - fitted with cybernetic weapons and sensory suppressors - then driven into a frenzy and unleashed as near-mindless killing machines.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','10','ECCLESIARCHY, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MINISTORUM, ARCO-FLAGELLANT',32,0,'Scout,Combat'),('IMP','ECC','BS',3,'GNR','Battle Sister Gunner','Some Sisters are blessed to receive training in the use of special-issue, close-assault weapons. These sisters ritually maintain their Storm Bolters, Flamers, and Meltaguns, which they use in battle to unleash a blistering repudiation of heresy.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','ECCLESIARCHY, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MINISTORUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, BATTLE SISTER, GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','ECC','BS',4,'HGNR','Battle Sister Heavy Gunner','Among the highly trained Adepta Sororitas, those Sisters granted the honour to bear the most potent armaments enable their team to engage heavily armoured opposition. Their expert eye for target prioritisation and enemy weak points makes them powerful assets.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','ECCLESIARCHY, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MINISTORUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, BATTLE SISTER, GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','ECC','BS',2,'IB','Battle Sister Icon Bearer','These Sisters are thrice blessed to bear the holy icons known as Simulacrum Imperialis. Each artefact is an object of fervent devotion - representations of martyred warriors, recreations of objects and deeds associated with them or repositories of their mortal remains.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','ECCLESIARCHY, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MINISTORUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, BATTLE SISTER, ICON BEARER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','ECC','BS',1,'SUP','Battle Sister Superior','The Sisters Superior form the crux of each squad of Battle Sisters. They speak with an authority derived from years of combat and supreme faith in the God-Emperor.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','9','ECCLESIARCHY, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MINISTORUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, BATTLE SISTER, LEADER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman,Combat'),('IMP','ECC','BS',5,'WAR','Battle Sister Warrior','Battle Sisters are the foot soldiers of the God-Emperor. Before their thundering boltguns, countless aliens, traitors, heretics, and mutants have met their doom. With voices raised high in prayer, their faith forms a shield around their souls.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','ECCLESIARCHY, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MINISTORUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, BATTLE SISTER, WARRIOR',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','ECC','REP',7,'REP','Sister Repentia','It is rare but not unknown for a Sister to fail in her duty, suffering disgrace as a result. Those who do are offered a change of redemption. Stripped of armour, they are sent to wreak penintent slaughter upon the enemy with cleaving blows from brutal eviscerators.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','7','ECCLESIARCHY, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MINISTORUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, REPENTIA, SISTER',32,0,'Scout,Combat'),('IMP','ECC','REP',0,'SUP','Repentia Superior','The solemn task of guiding wayward Sisters in their atonement falls to Repentia Superior. These veterans are stern taskmasters who drive their charges forward with bellowed prayers and lashes from their neural whips, watching vigilantly for any remnant signs of sinfulness.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','9','ECCLESIARCHY, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MINISTORUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, REPENTIA, SUPERIOR, LEADER',32,0,'Staunch,Combat'),('IMP','ESS','ESS',1,'CAN','Canid','Countless strains of Canid are bred or vat-grown to fulfil hunting, attack, or intimidation roles, and many Rogue Traders appreciate the combination of loyalty and aggression. Elucia Vhane named her beast Aximillion - her Voidsmen-at-Arms training it as guardian and companion.','kt21','4[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','6','ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, CANID',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('IMP','ESS','ESS',2,'DCE','Death Cult Executioner','For a Death Cult Executioner, the act of living is a blasphemy only balanced by the tally of souls they reap. They deliver death up close and master numerous combat styles. A follower of Vhane, the Death Cult Executioner Knosso Prond has vowed to kill a thousand different xenos.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','6+','8','ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER, IMPERIUM, DEATH CULT EXECUTIONER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('IMP','ESS','ESS',0,'EV','Elucia Vhane','Once master of the New Dawn, the Rogue Trader Elucia Vhane comes from an ancient dynasty. Her familial training honed her innate leadership and she wields her cane-rapier, Blur, as a master duellist. Ever does she keep an eye out for foes via a multi-spectral auspicator.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER, IMPERIUM, ASTRA CARTOGRAPHICA, LEADER, ELUCIA VHANE',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','ESS','ESS',3,'LM','Lectro-Maester','Habouring a connection to the Motive Force, these Tech-Priests are followers of the Cult Mechanicus, able to generate a protective voltagheist field from the mechanism on their back. Lectro-Maester Larsen van der Gauss joined Vhane\'s explorations for the change of esoteric discoveries.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, LECTRO-MAESTER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','ESS','ESS',7,'PSA','Privateer Support Assets','Even the lowest Rogue Trader has their own well-appointed ship, and many operate entire fleets.\nSuch ships are often armed far in excess of their size to see off pirates, xenos, over-inquisitive officials or even to secure deals via literal gunboat diplomacy.\nMost contain vast hangars that accommodate not only bulk haulers, but also atmospheric strikecraft.\nTheir precision firepower can be called upon by a Rogue Trader\'s elite operatives to ensure the success of clandestine missions.','kt21','-','-','-','-','-','-','-',32,0,'N/A'),('IMP','ESS','ESS',4,'REJAD','Rejuvenat Adept','These operatives are masters of healing and longevity. They provide pain-numbing agents and emergency surgery, even in the most horrific of environments. Rejuvenat Adept Sanistasia Minst took up with the Startstriders in her obsessive search for a panacea.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER, IMPERIUM, MEDIC, REJUVENAT ADEPT',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','ESS','ESS',6,'VM','Voidsman','Voidsmen commonly serve on warships, slaying any who threaten their vessel or its crew. Girded in baroque armour, they keep enemies at bay with las-fire. Among Voidmaster Nitsch\'s squad, the veteran Stromian Grell bears a rotor cannont by right of his consistent fire patterns.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, VOIDSMAN',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','ESS','ESS',5,'VMST','Voidmaster','Voidmasters lead squads of naval soldiery. Barking commands to ensure fire discipline, their adherence to Naval codes is unwavering. Voidmaster Nitsch and his squad were seconded to Vhane from the warship Vengeance, and his bravery under fire is legendary.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, VOIDMASTER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','ESS24','ESS24',1,'CAN','Canid','','kt24','8\"','2','0','0','5+','7','ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER, IMPERIUM, CANID',32,0,''),('IMP','ESS24','ESS24',2,'DCE','Death Cult Executioner','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','5+','8','ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER, IMPERIUM, DEATH CULT EXECUTIONER',32,0,''),('IMP','ESS24','ESS24',0,'EV','Elucia Vhane','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','4+','8','ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER , IMPERIUM, LEADER, ELUCIA VHANE',32,0,''),('IMP','ESS24','ESS24',3,'LM','Lectro-Maester','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER , IMPERIUM, LECTRO-MAESTER',32,0,''),('IMP','ESS24','ESS24',4,'REJAD','Rejuvenat Adept','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER , IMPERIUM, MEDIC, REJUVENAT ADEPT',32,0,''),('IMP','ESS24','ESS24',6,'VM','Voidsman','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, VOIDSMAN',32,0,''),('IMP','ESS24','ESS24',5,'VMST','Voidmaster','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','ELUCIDIAN STARSTRIDER , IMPERIUM, NAVIS, VOIDMASTER',32,0,''),('IMP','FW','SIC',0,'INF','Sicarian Infiltrator Trooper','Experts in penetrating enemy strongholds, Sicarian Infiltrators emit a white noise that attacks their foes\' sensoriums with a painful neurostatic bombardment.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','10','FORGE WORLD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, SICARIAN, INFILTRATOR, TROOPER',32,0,''),('IMP','FW','SIC',0,'INFPRI','Sicarian Infiltrator Princeps','Princeps lead coordinated assaults under cover of their insidious auras. Once Sicarians, their worth to the Machine God led them to be rebuilt from destruction.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','11','FORGE WORLD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, SICARIAN, INFILTRATOR, PRINCEPS',32,0,''),('IMP','FW','SIC',0,'PRI','Sicarian Ruststalker Princeps','Excelling in assassination missions and surprise attacks, Princeps lead their Ruststalkers in the hu8nt for any their Tech-Priest masters have marked for death.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','11','FORGE WORLD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, LEADER, SICARIAN, RUSTSTALKER, PRINCEPS',32,0,''),('IMP','FW','SIC',0,'TRP','Sicarian Ruststalker Trooper','The Ruststalkers fall upon their foes in a stabbing, slashing frenzy. Their transonic blades are wielded in a blur of attacks, capable of bypassing armour.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','10','FORGE WORLD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, SICARIAN, RUSTSTALKER, TROOPER',32,0,''),('IMP','FW','SKR',0,'ALP','Skitarii Ranger Alpha','Ranger Alphas are the most dedicated of their kind, relied upon to formulate reconnaissance and hunting parameters, and to lead their unit in gruelling duties.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','FORGE WORLD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, LEADER, SKITARII, RANGER, ALPHA',32,0,''),('IMP','FW','SKR',0,'GNR','Skitarii Ranger Gunner','In the hunt for the most dangerous of hereteks or xeons aggressors, a forge world\'s ruling Tech-Priests may issue high-performing Rangers with advanced weaponry. Strange, esoteric technologies power such armaments, rendering them lethal indeed to the Rangers\' foes.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','FORGE WORLD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, RANGER, GUNNER',32,0,''),('IMP','FW','SKR',0,'TRP','Skitarii Ranger Trooper','Skitarii Rangers hunt the foes of the Machine God relentlessly, and their bionically enhanced stamina is legendary. They pursue like patient predators, inexorably tracking their prey before taking the killing shot with their long rifles of ancient design.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','FORGE WORLD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, RANGER, TROOPER',32,0,''),('IMP','FW','SKV',0,'ALP','Skitarii Vanguard Alpha','Skitarii Alphas have passed a point called the Crux Mechanicus. With bodies more machine than flesh, they enact Tech-Priest overseers\' orders like holy commands.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','FORGE WORLD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, LEADER, SKITARII, VANGUARD, ALPHA',32,0,''),('IMP','FW','SKV',0,'GNR','Skitarii Vanguard Gunner','Many of the most powerful forge world weapons are potentially hazardous to the wielder. Vanguard marksmen, however, are already inured to the irradiating effects of their wargear - a price they willingly pay in devotion to their techno-arcane religion.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','FORGE WORLD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, VANGUARD, GUNNER',32,0,''),('IMP','FW','SKV',0,'TRP','Skitarii Vanguard Trooper','Skitarii Vanguard are so infused with baleful energies that simply being near them is deadly. So much radiation bleeds out from their shells fired by their Radium Carbines that they contaminate the air around them, as well as their targets.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','FORGE WORLD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, VANGUARD, TROOPER',32,0,''),('IMP','GK','GK',0,'GNR','Grey Knight Gunner','It takes years of intensive training for a Grey Knight to master the psychically charged specialist weapons of their Chapter, but those who do are capable of unleashing barrages of esoteric firepower that rip through the heaviest opposition.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','11','GREY KNIGHT, IMPERIUM, SANCTIC ASTARTES, <BROTHERHOOD>, PSYKER, GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','GK','GK',0,'JST','Grey Knight Justicar','Justicars are the lynchpin of their team. In psychic communion, they lead their brothers in carefully divined tactical ploys, arcane battle rites, and psychic rituals.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','GREY KNIGHT, IMPERIUM, SANCTIC ASTARTES, <BROTHERHOOD>, PSYKER, LEADER, JUSTICAR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','GK','GK',0,'WAR','Grey Knight Warrior','Grey Knights are martial elites clad in ward-etched armour. They combine the genetic augmentation of Space Marines with an indomitable psychic might, smiting those who traffic with the daemonic wherever they hide.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','11','GREY KNIGHT, IMPERIUM, SANCTIC ASTARTES, <BROTHERHOOD>, PSYKER, WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','HC','HC',2,'SIIP','Sicarian Infiltrator Princeps','Sicarian Infiltrator Princeps have a greater detachment from emotion than even others of their kind. No hunting mission is too dangerous for them, and no assassination task too harrowing.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','11','HUNTER CLADE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, LEADER, SICARIAN, INFILTRATOR, PRINCEPS',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','HC','HC',20,'SIIT','Sicarian Infiltrator Tracker','Experts in penetrating enemy strongholds, Sicarian Infiltrator Trackers emit a white noise that attacks their foes\' sensoriums with a painful neurostatic bombardment.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','10','HUNTER CLADE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, SICARIAN, INFILTRATOR, TRACKER',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','HC','HC',20,'SIRA','Sicarian Ruststalker Assassin','Ruststalker Assassins fall upon their foes in a stabbing, slashing frenzy, unleashing a blur of attacks. They are selected for kill team duties due to their level of dogged determination to hunt quarries to the death, above and beyond others of their kind.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','10','HUNTER CLADE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, SICARIAN, RUSTSTALKER, ASSASSIN',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('IMP','HC','HC',1,'SIRP','Sicarian Ruststalker Princeps','Excelling in assassination missions and surprise attacks, Princeps lead their Ruststalkers in the hunt for any theuir Tech-Priest masters have marked for death. In their lives, Princeps have claimed many foes in the most hazardous environments.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','11','HUNTER CLADE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, LEADER, SICARIAN, RUSTSTALKER, PRINCEPS',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('IMP','HC','HC',3,'SKRA','Skitarii Ranger Alpha','Ranger Alphas are the most dedicated of their kind, relied upon to formulate reconnaissance and hunting parameters, and to lead their Hunter Clade in gruelling duties.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HUNTER CLADE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, LEADER, SKITARII, RANGER, ALPHA',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','HC','HC',7,'SKRD','Skitarii Ranger Diktat','The enhanced data-tethers carried by these Skitarii enable them to communicate directly with their Tech-Priest masters. It is a great honour to be chosen to carry one, as it is seen as the mouthpiece of the Tech-Priests, who are said to be prophets of the Machine God itself.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','HUNTER CLADE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, RANGER, DIKTAT',32,0,'Scout'),('IMP','HC','HC',8,'SKRG','Skitarii Ranger Gunner','In the hunt for the most dangerous of hereteks or xenos aggressors, a forge world\'s ruling Tech-Priests may issue high-performing Hunter Clade Rangers with advanced weaponry. Strange, esoteric technologies power such armaments, redndering them lethal indeed to the Rangers\' foes.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','HUNTER CLADE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, RANGER, GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','HC','HC',20,'SKRM','Skitarii Ranger Marksman','Skitarii Ranger Marksmen hunt the foes of the Machine God relentlessly, and their bionically enhanced stamina is legendary. They pursue like patient predators, inexorably tacking their prey before taking the killing shot with their long rifles of ancient design.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','HUNTER CLADE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, RANGER, MARKSMAN',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','HC','HC',9,'SKRS','Skitarii Ranger Surveyor','The omnispex wielded by these Skitarii is a device fitted with a Raptor-class machine spirit. This can glean all kinds of data from a killzone and from a Hunter Clade\'s enemies. Not only is it useful for the kill team in battle, but such information is a fine devotion to the Machine God itself.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','HUNTER CLADE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, RANGER, SURVEYOR',32,0,'Scout'),('IMP','HC','HC',4,'SKVA','Skitarii Vanguard Alpha','Skitarii Alphas have passed a point called the Crux Mechanicus. With bodies more machine than flesh, they enach Tech-Priests overseers\' orders like holy commands','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HUNTER CLADE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, VANGUARD, GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','HC','HC',11,'SKVD','Skitarii Vanguard Diktat','To be a Diktat amond Skitarii is to be obeyed without question, due to their direct link with the Tech-Priests. Hunter Clades receiving word from their masters through these warriors are filled with zealous conviction, willing to drive through unimaginable terrors to find and slay their quarry.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','HUNTER CLADE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, VANGUARD, DIKTAT',32,0,'Staunch'),('IMP','HC','HC',12,'SKVG','Skitarii Vanguard Gunner','These Skitarii wield some of the most dangerous man-portable weapons in a forge world\'s arsenal - to the carrier as will as the Omnissiah\'s enemies. To have survived long enough to join a Hunter Clade while carrying this kind of weapon shows the Machine God\'s favour.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','HUNTER CLADE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, VANGUARD, GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','HC','HC',13,'SKVS','Skitarii Vanguard Surveyor','The omnispex\'s machine spirit can read heat emissions, data signatures, and biological waveforms, even at extreme range. Should it be kept focused for an extended period, it will reveal the enemy\'s weaknesses. This is perfect for Hunter Clades, whose primary purpose is to eliminate key targets.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','HUNTER CLADE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, VANGUARD, SURVEYOR',32,0,'Staunch'),('IMP','HC','HC',20,'SKVST','Skitarii Vanguard Shocktrooper','So much radiation pours from these Skitarii and their ammunition that they contaminate the air around them. Showing toughness, resilience, and dauntless bravery above others of their kind, Vanguard Shocktroopers advance into the fray, securing key positions for their Hunter Clade.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','HUNTER CLADE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, <FORGE WORLD>, SKITARII, VANGUARD, SHOCKTROOPER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','HC24','HC24',2,'SIP','Sicarian Infiltrator Princeps','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','11','HUNTER CLADE , ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, LEADER, SICARIAN, INFILTRATOR, PRINCEPS',32,0,''),('IMP','HC24','HC24',5,'SIW','Sicarian Infiltrator Warrior','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','10','HUNTER CLADE , ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, SICARIAN, INFILTRATOR, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('IMP','HC24','HC24',3,'SRGA','Skitarii Ranger Alpha','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','HUNTER CLADE , ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, LEADER, SKITARII, RANGER, ALPHA',32,0,''),('IMP','HC24','HC24',7,'SRGD','Skitarii Ranger Diktat','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','HUNTER CLADE , ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, SKITARII, RANGER, DIKTAT',32,0,''),('IMP','HC24','HC24',8,'SRGG','Skitarii Ranger Gunner','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','HUNTER CLADE , ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, SKITARII, RANGER, GUNNER',32,0,''),('IMP','HC24','HC24',9,'SRGS','Skitarii Ranger Surveyor','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','HUNTER CLADE , ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, SKITARII, RANGER, SURVEYOR',32,0,''),('IMP','HC24','HC24',10,'SRGW','Skitarii Ranger Warrior','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','HUNTER CLADE , ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, SKITARII, RANGER, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('IMP','HC24','HC24',1,'SRSP','Sicarian Ruststalker Princeps','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','11','HUNTER CLADE , ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, LEADER, SICARIAN, RUSTSTALKER, PRINCEPS',32,0,''),('IMP','HC24','HC24',6,'SRSW','Sicarian Ruststalker Warrior','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','10','HUNTER CLADE , ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, SICARIAN, RUSTSTALKER, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('IMP','HC24','HC24',4,'SVA','Skitarii Vanguard Alpha','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','HUNTER CLADE , ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, LEADER, SKITARII, VANGUARD, ALPHA',32,0,''),('IMP','HC24','HC24',11,'SVD','Skitarii Vanguard Diktat','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','HUNTER CLADE , ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, SKITARII, VANGUARD, DIKTAT',32,0,''),('IMP','HC24','HC24',12,'SVG','Skitarii Vanguard Gunner','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','HUNTER CLADE , ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, SKITARII, VANGUARD, GUNNER',32,0,''),('IMP','HC24','HC24',13,'SVS','Skitarii Vanguard Surveyor','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','HUNTER CLADE , ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, SKITARII, VANGUARD, SURVEYOR',32,0,''),('IMP','HC24','HC24',14,'SVW','Skitarii Vanguard Warrior','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','HUNTER CLADE , ADEPTUS MECHANICUS, SKITARII, VANGUARD, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('IMP','IG','GM',1,'COMMS','Guardsman Comms','Equipped with heavy vox-casters, comms specialists keep the team tethered to their regiment\'s rigid hierarchy of command, enabling them to relay their comanders\' orders while reporting back on enemy troop movements or spotting for artillery.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','IMPERIAL GUARD, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, GUARDSMAN, COMMS',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','IG','GM',2,'GNR','Guardsman Gunner','These Guardsmen are often the team\'s sharpshooters, issued with additional  training for the heavier weaponry they carry, and supporting their fellow soldiers with devastating anti-armour firepower, incinerating blazes, and pinpoint sniper fire.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','IMPERIAL GUARD, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, GUARDSMAN, GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman'),('IMP','IG','GM',0,'SGT','Guardsman Sergeant','Guardsman Sergeants coordinate their team with grizzled experience and tactical nous, enforcing their superiors\' orders to ensure the success of the mission.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','IMPERIAL GUARD, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, LEADER, GUARDSMAN, GUNNER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','IG','GM',3,'TRP','Guardsman Trooper','Grunts of the Imperial Guard, Guradsmen are recruited, trained, and equipped in their millions to doggedly fight wherever the Imperium needs them. They carry varying patterns of the dependable lasgun, along with any extra kit the manage to acquire.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','5+','7','IMPERIAL GUARD, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, GUARDSMAN, TROOPER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','IG','TS',1,'COMMS','Tempestus Scion Comms','Bearing advanced vox-casters, these Scions provide updated tactical information, keeping their team in contact with regimental headquarters. Some are also trained in counter-intelligence and the interception of signals, allowing their team to outmanoeuvre the foe.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','IMPERIAL GUARD, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <TEMPESTUS REGIMENT>, TEMPESTUS SCION, TROOPER',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','IG','TS',2,'GNR','Tempestus Scion Gunner','Tempestus Scions are an elite force within the Astra Militarum, equipped with specialist wargear to conduct dangerous missions. They typically bear high-powered hot-shot lasguns and wear dense carapace armour that provides extra protection in deadly kill zones.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','IMPERIAL GUARD, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <TEMPESTUS REGIMENT>, TEMPESTUS SCION, GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman'),('IMP','IG','TS',0,'SGT','Tempestor','Skilled tacticians and leaders, Tempestors design the kill zone insertions that the Scions are justifiably famed for. They are also granted prestige weapons normally reserved to high-rnaking officers, making them devastatingly effective fighters in their own right.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','9','IMPERIAL GUARD, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <TEMPESTUS REGIMENT>, LEADER, TEMPESTUS SCION, TEMPESTOR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','IG','TS',3,'TRP','Tempestus Scion Trooper','Tempestus Scions are an elite force within the Astra Militarum, equipped with specialist wargear to conduct dangerous missions. They typically bear high-powered hot-shot lasguns and wear dense carapace armour that provides extra protection in deadly kill zones.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','IMPERIAL GUARD, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <TEMPESTUS REGIMENT>, TEMPESTUS SCION, TROOPER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','INB','INB',1,'ARM','Navis Armsman','Well-trained, well-drilled and well-equipped, the Armsmen of Imperial Navy Breacher kill teams are formidable troops in the close confines of ship-to-ship combat. Any foe they cannot blast aside with their powerful shotguns they hack down with vicious blows from their hatchets.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','4+','7','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, ARMSMAN',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','INB','INB',2,'AXE','Navis Axejack','Sometimes, the only solution to a problem toced by Imperial Navy Breachers is a heavy, two-handed axe. The Axejacks who carry these weapons can not only smash through blocked doorways and obstacles, they are also formidable fighters who hack apart any enemy in their way.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, AXEJACK',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','INB','INB',3,'CAT','Navis C.A.T. Unit','Cyber-altered Task Units are tracked reconnaissance vehicles that have served the Imperium for millenia. Fitted with pict-recording equipment and frequency scanning augurs, they can be remotely operated to provide vital tactical information for their kill team.','kt21','4[CIRCLE]','1','1','2','5+','5','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, C.A.T. UNIT',32,0,'N/A'),('IMP','INB','INB',4,'END','Navis Endurant','Only the biggest Armsmen in a squad become known as Endurants. To them falls the task of carrying an Endurant shield and heavy shotgun while either taking point or guarding the rear of the squad. Their sheer bulk makes them highly intimidating to their enemies.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','2+','10','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, ENDURANT',32,0,'Staunch'),('IMP','INB','INB',7,'GNR','Navis Gunner','The largest troops in the squad who don\'t fulfil the role of Endurants carry their squad\'s heaviest ranged weapons. A las-volley unleashes devastating salvoes, the searing heat of a meltagun shot burns through a reinforced bulkhead, and even heavily-armoured enemies cannot withstand a plasma gun.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','INB','INB',6,'GRN','Navis Grenadier','It is the life of an Imperial Navy Breacher to become very accustomed to explosions. Even more so for the Grenadiers, These Armsmen carry demolition charges designed to crack through bulkheads and sealed doors enabling their squadmates to keep moving and reach their objectives.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, GRENADIER',32,0,'Staunch'),('IMP','INB','INB',5,'GS','Navis Gheistskull','These servo-skulls are often made from the heads of former Imperial Navy Breachers. As a result, they are often named \"DeadMan\'s Revenge\" or regarded as the perished soldier\'s \"Last Laugh\" for their ability to detonate and kill all around them in a final act of defiance to the enemy.','kt21','4[CIRCLE]','1','1','2','5+','5','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, FLY, NAVIS, GHEISTSKULL',32,0,'N/A'),('IMP','INB','INB',8,'HC','Navis Hatchcutter','It is vital for the Imperial Navy Breachers to be able to move through enemy ships quickly to reach their objectives. Hatchcutters can not only cut through barricades with their chainfists and plasma torches, they can use the latter to seal shut paths the foe might otherwise use.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, HATCHCUTTER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','INB','INB',0,'SGT','Navis Sergeant-At-Arms','As disciplined fighters, often with years of experience at the mast, the leaders of Imperial Navy Breacher squads are as skilled in close-quarter fighting as they are in devising battle-winning tactics on the move.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, LEADER, NAVIS, SERGEANT-AT-ARMS',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','INB','INB',9,'SRV','Navis Surveyor','Knowing what is around a corner can mean life or detah for Imperial Navy Breachers. By using a C.A.T. unit, which is capable of navigating narrow tunnels and holes, a Surveyor can investigate and prepare their squad for what might be ahead.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, SURVEYOR',32,0,'Scout'),('IMP','INB','INB',10,'VJ','Navis Void-Jammer','It falls to the Void-Jammers in an Imperial Navy Breachers kill team to operate Gheistskulls - servo-skulls fitted with an explosive device and an electro-magnetic pulse emitter. These devices can move quickly, fly through the air and navigate terrain far too dense for the Armsmen in order to reach the foe.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, VOID-JAMMER',32,0,'Scout'),('IMP','INB24','INB24',1,'ARM','Navis Armsman','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, ARMSMAN',32,0,''),('IMP','INB24','INB24',2,'AXE','Navis Axejack','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, AXEJACK',32,0,''),('IMP','INB24','INB24',3,'CAT','Navis C.A.T. Unit','','kt24','8\"','2','0','0','5+','5','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, C.A.T. UNIT',32,0,''),('IMP','INB24','INB24',4,'END','Navis Endurant','','kt24','4\"','2','0','0','2+','10','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, ENDURANT',32,0,''),('IMP','INB24','INB24',7,'GNR','Navis Gunner','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, GUNNER',32,0,''),('IMP','INB24','INB24',6,'GRN','Navis Grenadier','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, GRENADIER',32,0,''),('IMP','INB24','INB24',5,'GS','Navis Gheistskull','','kt24','8\"','2','0','0','5+','5','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, FLY, NAVIS, GHEISTSKULL',32,0,''),('IMP','INB24','INB24',8,'HC','Navis Hatchcutter','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, HATCHCUTTER',32,0,''),('IMP','INB24','INB24',0,'SGT','Navis Sergeant-At-Arms','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, LEADER, NAVIS, SERGEANT-AT-ARMS',32,0,''),('IMP','INB24','INB24',9,'SRV','Navis Surveyor','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, SURVEYOR',32,0,''),('IMP','INB24','INB24',10,'VJ','Navis Void-Jammer','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','IMPERIAL NAVY BREACHER, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, VOID-JAMMER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','ANC-AES',1,'CAST','Arbites Castigator','It is the Castigator\'s role to ensure that the guilty receive due punishment, their hood-like helps steeling their resolve against curses and pleas alike. Once the quarry is located, the Castigator is charged with their subdual by any means - a task they perform with zealous dedication.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, CASTIGATOR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-AES',2,'CHI','Arbites Chirurgant','These Arbitrators are highly skilled medical specialists, used to treating debilitating wounds inflicted by those resisting detention. They are also skilled in the tactical questioning of prisoners and have studied the limits to which the body can be pushed to elicit answers.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, MEDIC, ARBITES, CHIRURGANT',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-AES',3,'GNR','Arbites Gunner','Gunners provide substantial firepower to Exaction Squad operations using weapons such as Heavy Stubbers - rapid-firing cannons whose solid shot can scythe through mobs. More specialist weapons may fire chemicals that paralyze, or grenades that crack open doors and armour alike.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-AES',4,'LSH','Arbites Leashmaster','Leashmasters are specialists who command the caniform servitors known as Cyber-Mastiffs. They direct override the construct\'s basic protocols with advanced commands, and broadcast shouted orders to their guilt-ridden prey via the Cyber-Mastiff\'s emitters.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, LEASHMASTER',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-AES',6,'MAL','Arbites Malocator','Technically gifted, Malocators carry bio-sample extractors to gather trace evidence on their team\'s quarry. They operate with an icy calm under fire, scrutinising evidence via their veriscant multi-lens array and informing their team of enemy weaknesses.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, MALOCATOR',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-AES',7,'MRK','Arbites Marksman','The rabble-rouser lurking behind those they incite, the heavily armed bodyguard, or the fleeing criminal about to escape - such are the targets of the Marksman. Their long-barrelled shotguns fire shells so powerful that they leave wounds more akin to gory craters than bullet holes.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, MARKSMAN',32,0,'Marksman'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-AES',8,'REV','Arbites Revelatum','Revelatums reconnoitre their target\'s movements in advance of the rest of the team, scouting hideouts and ascertaining criminal contacts. They then lead other Arbitrators straight to the guilty, using their soulguilt scanners to identify threats to their fellow officers.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, REVELATUM',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-AES',5,'RVR','R-VR Cyber-Mastiff','Arbitrators employ many servo-constructs for intimidation, security, and pursuit. The Rantal-class Venatus Reclamator is an advanced Cyber-Mastiff used by Exaction Squads. The R-VR\'s detectors enable the to track their prey, while their iron jaws can break bones or kill on command.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, R-VR CYBER-MASTIFF',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-AES',9,'SUB','Arbites Subductor','Subductors possess one of the most recognisable - and feared - silhouettes to the Imperium\'s criminal classes. Bearing Subjugation-pattern Assault Shields and crackling Shock Mauls, they are brutal front line brawlers capable of crushing the most stubborn dissent.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, SUBDUCTOR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-AES',10,'VIG','Arbites Vigilant','Vigilants brutally sweep the guilty from existence with the signature Combat Shotgun of the Adeptus Arbites. These grim men and women are ever alert to malfeasance and unwavering in its punishment, unleashing devastating blasts at close range.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, VIGILANT',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-AES',11,'VOX','Arbites Vox-Signifier','The team\'s Vox-Signifier listens for coded missives from mission command on their powerful precinct vox-relay. They issue updates to the rest of the Exaction Squad arising from changes to mission priorities and new intelligence - likely painfully extracted from prisoners.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, VOX-SIGNIFIER',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-INB',1,'ARM','Navis Armsman','Well-trained, well-drilled and well-equipped, the Armsmen of Imperial Navy Breacher kill teams are formidable troops in the close confines of ship-to-ship combat. Any foe they cannot blast aside with their powerful shotguns they hack down with vicious blows from their hatchets.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','4+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, ARMSMAN',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-INB',2,'AXE','Navis Axejack','Sometimes, the only solution to a problem toced by Imperial Navy Breachers is a heavy, two-handed axe. The Axejacks who carry these weapons can not only smash through blocked doorways and obstacles, they are also formidable fighters who hack apart any enemy in their way.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, AXEJACK',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-INB',3,'CAT','Navis C.A.T. Unit','Cyber-altered Task Units are tracked reconnaissance vehicles that have served the Imperium for millenia. Fitted with pict-recording equipment and frequency scanning augurs, they can be remotely operated to provide vital tactical information for their kill team.','kt21','4[CIRCLE]','1','1','2','5+','5','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, C.A.T. UNIT',32,0,'N/A'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-INB',4,'END','Navis Endurant','Only the biggest Armsmen in a squad become known as Endurants. To them falls the task of carrying an Endurant shield and heavy shotgun while either taking point or guarding the rear of the squad. Their sheer bulk makes them highly intimidating to their enemies.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','2+','10','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, ENDURANT',32,0,'Staunch'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-INB',7,'GNR','Navis Gunner','The largest troops in the squad who don\'t fulfil the role of Endurants carry their squad\'s heaviest ranged weapons. A las-volley unleashes devastating salvoes, the searing heat of a meltagun shot burns through a reinforced bulkhead, and even heavily-armoured enemies cannot withstand a plasma gun.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-INB',6,'GRN','Navis Grenadier','It is the life of an Imperial Navy Breacher to become very accustomed to explosions. Even more so for the Grenadiers, These Armsmen carry demolition charges designed to crack through bulkheads and sealed doors enabling their squadmates to keep moving and reach their objectives.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, GRENADIER',32,0,'Staunch'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-INB',5,'GS','Navis Gheistskull','These servo-skulls are often made from the heads of former Imperial Navy Breachers. As a result, they are often named \"DeadMan\'s Revenge\" or regarded as the perished soldier\'s \"Last Laugh\" for their ability to detonate and kill all around them in a final act of defiance to the enemy.','kt21','4[CIRCLE]','1','1','2','5+','5','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, FLY, NAVIS, GHEISTSKULL',32,0,'N/A'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-INB',8,'HC','Navis Hatchcutter','It is vital for the Imperial Navy Breachers to be able to move through enemy ships quickly to reach their objectives. Hatchcutters can not only cut through barricades with their chainfists and plasma torches, they can use the latter to seal shut paths the foe might otherwise use.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, HATCHCUTTER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-INB',9,'SRV','Navis Surveyor','Knowing what is around a corner can mean life or detah for Imperial Navy Breachers. By using a C.A.T. unit, which is capable of navigating narrow tunnels and holes, a Surveyor can investigate and prepare their squad for what might be ahead.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, SURVEYOR',32,0,'Scout'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-INB',10,'VJ','Navis Void-Jammer','It falls to the Void-Jammers in an Imperial Navy Breachers kill team to operate Gheistskulls - servo-skulls fitted with an explosive device and an electro-magnetic pulse emitter. These devices can move quickly, fly through the air and navigate terrain far too dense for the Armsmen in order to reach the foe.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, NAVIS, VOID-JAMMER',32,0,'Scout'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-KAS',2,'DEMO','Kasrkin Demo-Trooper','Clad in heavier armour and carrying a devastating melta mine, these Karskin serve in a necessary but incredibly dangerous role. It is their job - often under enemy fire - to place, prepare, and detonate a melta mine, blasting their way into an armoured bunker or through fortress walls.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, INQUISITORIAL AGENT DEMO-TROOPER',32,0,'Staunch'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-KAS',3,'GNR','Kasrkin Gunner','These specialists receive additional training in using a range of different weapons, whether they be flamers for burning foes frrom cover, hot-shot volley guns for scything through enemy heavy infantry, or meltaguns for burning into the toughest armour.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, INQUISITORIAL AGENT GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-KAS',1,'MED','Kasrkin Combat Medic','Though the Kasrkin place great pride in being able to fight on, even if wounded, many kill teams include Combat Medics. These Karskin have additional training and equipment to treat the injured and return them to the fight as soon as possible.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, MEDIC, INQUISITORIAL AGENT COMBAT MEDIC',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-KAS',4,'REC','Kasrkin Recon-Trooper','With their advanced auspex systems, these Kasrkin are the eyes and ears of their kill teams. They can detect enemy troops and ambushes from significant distances, and can scan local terrain and analyse ambient sounds for dangers.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, INQUISITORIAL AGENT RECON-TROOPER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-KAS',5,'SS','Kasrkin Sharpshooter','These patient, keen-eyed Kasrkin are skilled snipers. With their hot-shot Marksman Rifles they can kill key targets and provide covering fire for the rest of their kill team. Thanks to their camo cloaks, Sharpshooters can infiltrate contested areas and remain hidden for protracted periods.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, INQUISITORIAL AGENT SHARPSHOOTER',32,0,'Marksman'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-KAS',6,'TRP','Kasrkin Trooper','The rank and file of Kasrkin squads, these soldiers are consummate professionals. Many have seen action in the harshest of killzones and emerged victorious.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, INQUISITORIAL AGENT TROOPER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-KAS',7,'VOX','Kasrkin Vox-Trooper','Carrying advanced vox systems, these Kasrkin are their kill team\'s link with higher command. It is their job to relay orders and intelligence between senior officers and their comrades, all of whom wear their own vox-links for quick intra-squad communication.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, INQUISITORIAL AGENT VOX-TROOPER',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-SOS',11,'SOSPRO','Sister Of Silence Prosecutor','Protected from the malevlence of witches by their rare anti-psychic mutation and shielded frrom the weapons of the foe by their finely crafter power armour, Prosecutors advance unflinching into the heart of battle. Their Boltguns thunder ceaselessly, each explosive shell ending another heretic life.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ANATHEMA PSYKANA, SISTER OF SILENCE, PROSECUTOR',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','ANC-SOS',12,'SOSVIG','Sister Of Silence Vigilator','The surest way t bring an end to a witch\'s malefic rampage is to strike their head from their body. Such is the doctrine of the Vigilators, who ghost across the battlefield before charging head-first into the fray, their double-handed Power Blades singing a keeing song of death.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ANATHEMA PSYKANA, SISTER OF SILENCE, VIGILATOR',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','ANC-SOS',13,'SOSWSK','Sister Of Silence WitchSeeker','WitchSeekers wield sanctified flamers as they hunt. Closing with their heretical quarry, they employ their Null powers to close off the psychic trickery that renders witches so deadly, before unleashing a roaring conflagration to immolate the foe.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ANATHEMA PSYKANA, SISTER OF SILENCE, WITCHSEEKER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','ANC-TS',14,'TSCOM','Tempestus Scion Comms','Equipped with powerful Vox units, these Tempestus Scions can relay orders and accurate tactical data to their squadmates quickly and efficiently. Some are also trained in counter-intelligence and the interception of signals, allowing their fellow Agents to outmanoeuvre the foe.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, TEMPESTUS SCION, COMMS',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','ANC-TS',15,'TSGUN','Tempestus Scion Gunner','Tempestus Scions have access to a wider variety of special weapons that are ideally suited to all manner of missions. Gunners are well trained in their use - whether that be clearing a bunker with a flamer or raking down a swarm of heavily armoured foes with a hot-shot Volley Gun.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, TEMPESTUS SCION, GUNNER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','ANC-TS',16,'TSMED','Tempestus Scion Medic','On missions far behing enemy lines, Tempestus Scions can suffer casualties many miles from their base of operations. Their Medics are vital for providing life-saving aid to the wounded - getting them back into the fight sooner or keeping them alive long enough to be taken to safety.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, TEMPESTUS SCION, MEDIC',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','ANC-TS',17,'TSTRP','Tempestus Scion Trooper','Elite and highly-disciplined soldiers, Tempestus Scion Troopers carry out order unflinchingly. Having undergone ruthless training from their youth, there are few hardships they cannot endure and few enemies they cannot overcome.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, TEMPESTUS SCION, TROOPER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','ANC-VG',0,'BRS','Bruiser Veteran','For some, war and fighting just agrees with them. Bruiser Veterans are such people. They look the galaxy’s endless malevolent threats in the eye with a trench club in their hand, ready to bludgeon anything and everything to death.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, BRUISER VETERAN',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-VG',0,'COMMS','Comms Veteran','Comms Veterans are consummate professionals, accompanying their leaders wherever required whilst carrying heavy equipment, all to receive and transmit communications that are vital for their comrades and superiors to understand the inevitable confusion of battle.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, COMMS VETERAN',32,0,'Scout,Staunch'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-VG',0,'DEMO','Demolition Veteran','Whether blowing up ammo dumps or cracking open defences, many kill teams need explosives experts. Demolition Veterans are such troops. Naturally daring, they often have to put themselves in harm’s way to plant their remote mines at the optimum point to blow their target into smithereens.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, DEMOLITION VETERAN',32,0,'Scout,Staunch'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-VG',0,'GNR','Gunner Veteran','With experience and skills in wielding a whole host of specialist weapons, Gunner Veterans are called whether a Sergeant Veteran needs a xenos nest burned to nothing, a bunker reduced to melted sludge or to bring down heavy enemy infantry that lasguns are insufficient for.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, GUNNER VETERAN',32,0,'Marksman'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-VG',0,'HARD','Hardened Veteran','Some Veterans are resilient above and beyond even their peers. These troops are steel in body as well as in mind, with bionics in the place of body parts lost in battle. Despite the horrific wounds they have suffered, they fight on still, unbowed.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, HARDENED VETERAN',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-VG',0,'MDC','Medic Veteran','The efforts of the Medic Veteran is all that stands between life and \nmiserable death for the troops of his squad. Equipped with little more \nthan basic medical equipment, they strive to keep their comrades alive \nin the most hazardous conditions.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, MEDIC, MEDIC VETERAN',32,0,'Scout,Staunch'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-VG',0,'SNP','Sniper Veteran','Expert marksmen, their skills honed in the harsh conditions of numerous battlefields, Sniper Veterans are sharpshooters who specialise in cutting down key enemy troops at extreme ranges - all unseen by the foe.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, SNIPER VETERAN',32,0,'Marksman'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-VG',0,'TRP','Trooper Veteran','Astra Militarum Veterans have a great deal of combat experience, gained over experiencing harsh fighting for months or even years. Armed with lasguns and bayonets, they have faced down terrible danger time and time again.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, TROOPER VETERAN',32,0,'Scout,Marksman'),('IMP','INQ','ANC-VG',0,'ZLT','Zealot Veteran','Zealot Veterans are deeply spiritual warriors, often claiming their survival through the horrifying battlefields they’ve experienced is only thanks to the direct intervention of the Emperor himself.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, ZEALOT VETERAN',32,0,'Staunch'),('IMP','INQ','INQ',2,'AS','Autosavant','Little remains of the original human the Autosavant once was. Much of their form has been replaced with bionics dedicated to the recording of information. Whether in their base of operations or the heat of battle, they never cease their scribblings of every word and deed they witness.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, AUTOSAVANT',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','INQ',5,'ENL','Enlightener','Known to some as Excruciators or Truth-Peelers, these sadistic individuals are highly valued by Inquisitors for their utter lack of mercy and uncanny skill in extracting valuable information, even from the most uncooperative of prisoners.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, ENLIGHTENER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','INQ',6,'GUNS','Gun Servitor','More machine than human, Gun Servitors are commonplace across the Imperium, and lobotomised to the extent that they lack any kind of capacity for independent thought. Used to fulfil mundane and difficult tasks, they carry hefty loads often including heavy weapons.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','1','1','3','4+','11','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, GUN SERVITOR',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','INQ',7,'HEX','Hexorcist','Hexorcists are holy men and women that are often mistaken for priests by the uninitiated. They believe that the Imperial Faith will only be spread at the barrel of a gun, and are experienced enough in the Galaxy\'s many horrors to know they must fight tooth and nail for it.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, HEXORCIST',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','INQ',0,'INT','Interrogator','Ruthless, resourceful, and skilled in all manner of clandestine and war-making skills, Interrogators are selected by the Inquisitor they serve for their dogged determination and unflagging loyalty, and are on the path to becoming Inquisitors themselves.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','5+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, LEADER, INTERROGATOR',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','INQ',8,'MYS','Mystic','Using their empyric senses to \"see\" hidden truths and the souls of those they hunt, Mystics engage in the most arcane of missions. They provide vital support to their team, scrying the future for dangers or creating shields of psychic energy.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, MYSTIC',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','INQ',9,'PEN','Penal Legionnaire','There are few better sources of expendable fighters with unusual skills and a need for repentance than an Imperial Penal Legion. These hardened criminals are useful with a blade and have nothing left to lose - perfect for the kind of suicidal missions Inquisitorial Agents must face in the Emperor\'s service.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, PENAL LEGIONNAIRE',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','INQ',10,'PST','Pistolier','Sometimes known as Desperados, these Agents are skilled killers who have honed their talents in the crime-ridden underbowels of hive worlds. Alongside the quick draw they have learned the value of the silent kill, as well as the ostentasiously explosive.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, PISTOLIER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','INQ',3,'QK','Questkeeper','Questkeepers - known also as Knights-Errant, Penitents, and many other names - are fanatical zealots dedicated to the Imperial Creed. With an intense hatred for foes of the Emperor, they execute sworn quests to slaughter heretics and traitors.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, QUESTKEEPER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','INQ',1,'TS','Tome-Skull','These familiars are specialised servo-skulls designed to secure and hold open a treasured volume. The books chosen by Interrogators for a Tome-Skull to bear in the field are seeped in holy power and filled with arcane lore, sanctifying ground and renouncing daemonic spirits.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','1','2','2','5+','5','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, FLY, TOME-SKULL',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ','INQ',4,'VET','Deathworld Veteran','Every Inquisitor knows that Death Worlds produce the toughest soldiers in the Imperium. Many go to great lengths to draft experienced Death Worlders, for these warriors\' fighting skills are vital for hunting down the heretic.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, DEATH WORLD VETERAN',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-AES24',2,'CAST','Arbites Castigator','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, CASTIGATOR',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-AES24',3,'CHI','Arbites Chirurgant','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, MEDIC, ARBITES, CHIRURGANT',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-AES24',4,'GNR','Arbites Gunner','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, GUNNER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-AES24',5,'LSH','Arbites Leashmaster','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, LEASHMASTER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-AES24',7,'MAL','Arbites Malocator','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, MALOCATOR',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-AES24',8,'MRK','Arbites Marksman','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, MARKSMAN',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-AES24',9,'REV','Arbites Revelatum','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, REVELATUM',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-AES24',6,'RVR','R-VR Cyber-Mastiff','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, R-VR CYBER-MASTIFF',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-AES24',10,'SUB','Arbites Subductor','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','3+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, SUBDUCTOR',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-AES24',11,'VIG','Arbites Vigilant','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, VIGILANT',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-AES24',12,'VOX','Arbites Vox-Signifier','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ARBITES, ARBITES, VOX-SIGNIFIER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-DKK24',2,'BRU','Death Korps Bruiser','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, BRUISER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ