n Vox-Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, VOX-TROOPER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-SOS24',11,'SOSPRO','Sister Of Silence Prosecutor','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','3+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ANATHEMA PSYKANA, SISTER OF SILENCE, PROSECUTOR',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-SOS24',12,'SOSVIG','Sister Of Silence Vigilator','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','3+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ANATHEMA PSYKANA, SISTER OF SILENCE, VIGILATOR',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-SOS24',13,'SOSWSK','Sister Of Silence WitchSeeker','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','3+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ANATHEMA PSYKANA, SISTER OF SILENCE, WITCHSEEKER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-TS24',15,'TSGUN','Tempestus Scion Gunner','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, TEMPESTUS SCION, GUNNER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-TS24',16,'TSMED','Tempestus Scion Medic','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, TEMPESTUS SCION, MEDIC',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-TS24',17,'TSTRP','Tempestus Scion Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, TEMPESTUS SCION, TROOPER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ-TS24',14,'TSVOX','Tempestus Scion Vox-Operator','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, TEMPESTUS SCION, COMMS',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ24',2,'AS','Autosavant','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, AUTOSAVANT',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ24',5,'ENL','Enlightener','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, ENLIGHTENER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ24',6,'GUNS','Gun Servitor','','kt24','6\"','1','0','0','4+','11','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, GUN SERVITOR',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ24',7,'HEX','Hexorcist','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, HEXORCIST',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ24',0,'INT','Interrogator','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, LEADER, INTERROGATOR',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ24',8,'MYS','Mystic','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, MYSTIC',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ24',9,'PEN','Penal Legionnaire','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, PENAL LEGIONNAIRE',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ24',10,'PST','Pistolier','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, PISTOLIER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ24',3,'QK','Questkeeper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, QUESTKEEPER',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ24',1,'TS','Tome-Skull','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','5','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, TOME-SKULL',32,0,''),('IMP','INQ24','INQ24',4,'VET','Deathworld Veteran','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','INQUISITORIAL AGENT, IMPERIUM, INQUISITION, DEATH WORLD VETERAN',32,0,''),('IMP','INTS','INTS',4,'AIGRN','Assault Intercessor Grenadier','Equipped with an array of deadly grenades, these\nspecialists provide close-range support when facing\nswarms of lesser foes or heavily armoured targets.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','14','INTERCESSION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, ASSAULT INTERCESSOR, GRENADIER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','INTS','INTS',1,'AISGT','Assault Intercessor Sergeant','These mission leaders understand the optimal moment\nto unleash charges. They are exemplars in the press of\nmelee, rending foes in twain with their deadly close\ncombat weapons.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','15','INTERCESSION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, LEADER, ASSAULT INTERCESSOR, SERGEANT',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','INTS','INTS',3,'AIWAR','Assault Intercessor Warrior','Protected by Mk X Tacticus armour, Assault Intercessor\nWarriors charge into battle swinging large chainswords\nand firing mass-reactive shells from their pistols','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','14','INTERCESSION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, ASSAULT INTERCESSOR, WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','INTS','INTS',6,'IGNR','Intercessor Gunner','These specialists provide long-range supporting fire from\ntheir rifle’s underslung auxiliary grenade launcher. They\nare capable of delivering explosive charges that inflict\nmaximum devastation on the most densely defended or\nshielded positions','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','14','INTERCESSION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, INTERCESSOR, GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman,Staunch'),('IMP','INTS','INTS',2,'ISGT','Intercessor Sergeant','Intercessor Sergeants lead their teams in levelling\nsalvoes of firepower against targets in ever-changing\nkillzones. They often carry specialist weaponry into the\nfray to support their battle-brothers.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','15','INTERCESSION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, LEADER, INTERCESSOR, SERGEANT',32,0,'Marksman,Staunch'),('IMP','INTS','INTS',5,'IWAR','Intercessor Warrior','Intercessor Warriors lay down punishing volleys of fire\nfrom their bolt rifles. Their tactics and wargear are\nadaptable to countless situations, making them a core\nasset for any Intercession Squad.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','14','INTERCESSION SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, INTERCESSOR, WARRIOR',32,0,'Marksman,Staunch'),('IMP','KAS','KAS',2,'DEMO','Kasrkin Demo-Trooper','Clad in heavier armour and carrying a devastating melta mine, these Karskin serve in a necessary but incredibly dangerous role. It is their job - often under enemy fire - to place, prepare, and detonate a melta mine, blasting their way into an armoured bunker or through fortress walls.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','KASRKIN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, KASRKIN DEMO-TROOPER',32,0,'Staunch'),('IMP','KAS','KAS',3,'GNR','Kasrkin Gunner','These specialists receive additional training in using a range of different weapons, whether they be flamers for burning foes frrom cover, hot-shot volley guns for scything through enemy heavy infantry, or meltaguns for burning into the toughest armour.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','KASRKIN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, KASRKIN GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman'),('IMP','KAS','KAS',1,'MED','Kasrkin Combat Medic','Though the Kasrkin place great pride in being able to fight on, even if wounded, many kill teams include Combat Medics. These Karskin have additional training and equipment to treat the injured and return them to the fight as soon as possible.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','KASRKIN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, MEDIC, KASRKIN COMBAT MEDIC',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','KAS','KAS',4,'REC','Kasrkin Recon-Trooper','With their advanced auspex systems, these Kasrkin are the eyes and ears of their kill teams. They can detect enemy troops and ambushes from significant distances, and can scan local terrain and analyse ambient sounds for dangers.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','KASRKIN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, KASRKIN RECON-TROOPER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','KAS','KAS',0,'SGT','Kasrkin Sergeant','Leaders of Kasrkin kill teams, sergeants are extremely skilled and experienced soldiers who lead from the front. They experience all the same hardships as those who follow them, and are unflappable figures of authority who know how to get the best out of their troops.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','9','KASRKIN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, LEADER, KASRKIN SERGEANT',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','KAS','KAS',5,'SS','Kasrkin Sharpshooter','These patient, keen-eyed Kasrkin are skilled snipers. With their hot-shot Marksman Rifles they can kill key targets and provide covering fire for the rest of their kill team. Thanks to their camo cloaks, Sharpshooters can infiltrate contested areas and remain hidden for protracted periods.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','KASRKIN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, KASRKIN SHARPSHOOTER',32,0,'Marksman'),('IMP','KAS','KAS',6,'TRP','Kasrkin Trooper','The rank and file of Kasrkin squads, these soldiers are consummate professionals. Many have seen action in the harshest of killzones and emerged victorious.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','KASRKIN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, KASRKIN TROOPER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','KAS','KAS',7,'VOX','Kasrkin Vox-Trooper','Carrying advanced vox systems, these Kasrkin are their kill team\'s link with higher command. It is their job to relay orders and intelligence between senior officers and their comrades, all of whom wear their own vox-links for quick intra-squad communication.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','KASRKIN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, KASRKIN VOX-TROOPER',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','KAS24','KAS24',3,'DT','Kasrkin Demo Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','KASRKIN , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, DEMO-TROOPER',32,0,''),('IMP','KAS24','KAS24',4,'GNR','Kasrkin Gunner','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','KASRKIN , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, GUNNER',32,0,''),('IMP','KAS24','KAS24',2,'MDC','Kasrkin Combat Medic','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','KASRKIN , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, MEDIC, COMBAT MEDIC',32,0,''),('IMP','KAS24','KAS24',5,'RT','Kasrkin Recon-Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','KASRKIN , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, RECON-TROOPER',32,0,''),('IMP','KAS24','KAS24',1,'SGT','Kasrkin Sergeant','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','4+','9','KASRKIN , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, LEADER, SERGEANT',32,0,''),('IMP','KAS24','KAS24',6,'SS','Kasrkin Sharpshooter','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','KASRKIN , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, SHARPSHOOTER',32,0,''),('IMP','KAS24','KAS24',7,'TRP','Kasrkin Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','KASRKIN , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, TROOPER',32,0,''),('IMP','KAS24','KAS24',8,'VOX','Kasrkin Vox-Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','KASRKIN , IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, VOX-TROOPER',32,0,''),('IMP','NOV','NOV',2,'CON','Novitiate Condemnor','Sorcerers and witches are among the Adepta Sororitas’ most hated foes. Such psychic abominations are terrible threats to the Emperor’s realm, and cutting them down is a key priority. Novitiates Condemnor are especially equipped to deal with this kind of enemy.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, NOVITIATE CONDEMNOR',32,0,'Combat,Marksman'),('IMP','NOV','NOV',3,'DIA','Novitiate Dialogus','These Novitiates are in training to join the Orders Dialogus, while \nlearning warfare under the guidance of experienced Battle Sisters. Their\n training in cryptography makes them of great value to kill teams - they\n can unlock obscure ciphers and find hidden patterns in communiques.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, NOVITIATE PRECEPTOR',32,0,'Scout'),('IMP','NOV','NOV',4,'DUE','Novitiate Duellist','Some Novitiates have a natural affinity for bladework, their reaction times and dexterity greater than that of their fellow warriors. They take to the field eager to prove their skill, wishing to claim the heads of the most capable enemies and emulate the warrior-saints of legend.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, NOVITIATE DUELLIST',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','NOV','NOV',5,'EXA','Novitiate Exactor','Some zealous Novitiates are given neural whips with which to inflict \nphysical and mental anguish on the foe. On occasion, the bearer will \nturn these weapons on fellow Novitiates they feel are lacking in \ncommitment and need to be dissuaded from lapses in bravery and faith.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, NOVITIATE EXACTOR',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('IMP','NOV','NOV',6,'HOS','Novitiate Hospitaller','Curing the physical and spiritual ills of the Imperium’s battlefield \nwounded is an onerous task, one that requires countless hours of \npractice. Novitiates seeking admission into the Orders Hospitaller hone \ntheir skills in the field, aiding their fellow Novitiates In whichever \nway they can.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, NOVITIATE HOSPITALLER',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','NOV','NOV',7,'MIL','Novitiate Militant','Novitiates Militant are Battle Sisters in training. They have yet to \nearn the power armour and boltguns of fully fledged Battle Sisters, but \nare zealous warriors of the Emperor nonetheless, eager to join the ranks\n of their Order Militant.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, NOVITIATE MILITANT',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','NOV','NOV',8,'PEN','Novitiate Penitent','Some Novitiates are ordered to wield brutal eviscerators as a mark of \nshame for minor transgressions. Urged to earn their redemption \nface-to-face with the enemy, such Sisters will fight with unrestrained \nfury to earn hack their honour.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, NOVITIATE PENITENT',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','NOV','NOV',9,'PRE','Novitiate Preceptor','These Novitiates are expected to rigidly enforce their Order’s precepts, ensuring their fellows faithfully adhere to the prescribed standards. They are often chosen as their Superior’s second in command, and serve as exemplars by eagerly striding into the fray to smite the Emperor’s foes.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, NOVITIATE PRECEPTOR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','NOV','NOV',10,'PRO','Novitiate Pronatus','To serve in the Orders Pronatus a candidate must learn everything there is to know of countless kinds of relics, as well being highly skilled warriors. They are expected to retrieve and guard highly precious - and sometimes extremely dangerous - artefacts.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, NOVITIATE PRONATUS',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','NOV','NOV',11,'PUR','Novitiate Purgatus','Novitiates Purgatus have the holy duty of bringing cleansing flame to \nthe enemies of Mankind. When they unleash their Ministorum flamers at \nthe enemy, they leave little more than ash behind.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, NOVITIATE PURGATUS',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','NOV','NOV',12,'REL','Novitiate Reliquarius','Some Novitiates bear inspiring icons, such as an ornate tapestry, a \nreliquary containing a saint’s mortal remains or a simulacrum of a \nfamous artefact. Novitiates who look upon such relics know the holy \npower of the God-Emperor is with them, and fight all the harder for it.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, NOVITIATE RELIQUARIUS',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('IMP','NOV','NOV',1,'SUP','Novitiate Superior','A fully fledged Battle Sister of an Order Militant, a Superior has the \ntask of leading Novitiates in battle. They make command decisions, steer\n the faith of their charges and serve as inspirational examples of how a\n warrior of the Adepta Sororitas acts at all times.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, <ORDER>, LEADER, NOVITIATE SUPERIOR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','NOV24','NOV24',2,'CON','Novitiate Condemnor','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, CONDEMNOR',32,0,''),('IMP','NOV24','NOV24',3,'DIA','Novitiate Dialogus','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS,PRECEPTOR',32,0,''),('IMP','NOV24','NOV24',4,'DUE','Novitiate Duellist','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, DUELLIST',32,0,''),('IMP','NOV24','NOV24',5,'EXA','Novitiate Exactor','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, EXACTOR',32,0,''),('IMP','NOV24','NOV24',6,'HOS','Novitiate Hospitaller','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, HOSPITALLER',32,0,''),('IMP','NOV24','NOV24',7,'MIL','Novitiate Militant','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, MILITANT',32,0,''),('IMP','NOV24','NOV24',8,'PEN','Novitiate Penitent','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, PENITENT',32,0,''),('IMP','NOV24','NOV24',9,'PRE','Novitiate Preceptor','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, PRECEPTOR',32,0,''),('IMP','NOV24','NOV24',10,'PRO','Novitiate Pronatus','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, PRONATUS',32,0,''),('IMP','NOV24','NOV24',11,'PUR','Novitiate Purgatus','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, PURGATUS',32,0,''),('IMP','NOV24','NOV24',12,'REL','Novitiate Reliquarius','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, RELIQUARIUS',32,0,''),('IMP','NOV24','NOV24',1,'SUP','Novitiate Superior','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','9','NOVITIATE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTA SORORITAS, LEADER, SUPERIOR',32,0,''),('IMP','PHO','PHO',11,'INCML','Incursor Minelayer','Some Incursors carry heavy haywire mines into battle, planting them at pre-cogitated nexuses of probable enemy movement. The electrophantasmic blasts of these weapons can banish machine spirits from enemy wargear and cripply augmetic enhancements.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, INCURSOR, MINELAYER',32,0,'Scout,Staunch'),('IMP','PHO','PHO',10,'INCMRK','Incursor Marksman','As though the combination of a highly-trained Space Marine and a potent mark of Bolt Carbine were not deadly enough, the Incrusor Marksman employs his Divinator-class auspex to precognitively track where his targets will be, then places killing shots accordingly.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, INCURSOR, MARKSMAN',32,0,'Scout,Marksman'),('IMP','PHO','PHO',2,'INCSGT','Incursor Sergeant','Tending towards aggressive and dynamic strategies, Incursor Sergeants lead Phobos Strike Teams in furious covert offensives that leave enemy command structures and logistical chains in tatters, ripe for planetary onslaught by a full-blown Space Marine strike force.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','13','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, LEADER, INCURSOR, SERGEANT',32,0,'Scout,Marksman'),('IMP','PHO','PHO',12,'INCWAR','Incursor Warrior','Incursors are potent offensive skirmishers. They use oracular auspexes slaved to their Occulus Bolt Carbines to spot enemy targets, even through solid walls. They then press swiftly upon their foes\' positions before engaging in bloody, one-sided firefights with the manoeuvred enemy.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, INCURSOR, WARRIOR',32,0,'Scout,Marksman'),('IMP','PHO','PHO',5,'INFCOM','Infiltrator Commsman','The Infiltrator Commsman acts as a strategic nexus upon the battlefield, a conduit through which voxexchanges and intelligence inloads pass like lightning. The presence of such a battle-borther increases the strike team\'s versatility and swiftness of action.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, INFILTRATOR, COMMSMAN',32,0,'Scout,Marksman'),('IMP','PHO','PHO',6,'INFHEL','Infiltrator Helix Adept','Operating as they do - far behind enemy lines wihtout support - Phobos Strike Teams require the medicae support of Helix Adepts to get wounded battle-brothers back into the fight, and to recalim the geneseed of the slain for the Chapter.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, MEDIC, INFILTRATOR, HELIX ADEPT',32,0,'Scout,Staunch'),('IMP','PHO','PHO',7,'INFSAB','Infiltrator Saboteur','Carrying a deadly array of melta charges, super-krak munitions and even anti-plant canisters into battle, the Infiltrator Saboteur is well prepared to rig any target for destruction. This task completed, they fall back swiftly before triggering a blast like the Emperor\'s wrath.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, INFILTRATOR, SABOTEUR',32,0,'Scout,Staunch'),('IMP','PHO','PHO',1,'INFSGT','Infiltrator Sergeant','Exemplar to their brothers; strategic and tactical leader of exceptional skill; deadly enemy to the Emperor\'s does; the Infiltrator Sergeant must be all of these things, for it is by his words and actions that the Phobos Strike Team stands or falls.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','13','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, LEADER, INFILTRATOR, SERGEANT',32,0,'Scout,Marksman'),('IMP','PHO','PHO',4,'INFVET','Infiltrator Veteran','The most experienced Infiltrator battle-brothers stalk their enemies like armoured gheists, wielding weaponry selected from the Chapter\'s most rarefied armouries, each one augmented through the careful attentions of master artificers. So armed, they can act as the nemeses of any foe.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, INFILTRATOR, VETERAN',32,0,'Scout,Marksman'),('IMP','PHO','PHO',8,'INFVOX','Infiltrator Voxbreaker','The Voxbreaker makes was in both the physical and data-spectral realms. Not only does their specialised equipment allow them to scan and isolate enemy threats, but they can also break into the foe\'s communications and plunder them for strategic intelligence.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, INFILTRATOR, VOXBREAKER',32,0,'Scout,Marksman'),('IMP','PHO','PHO',9,'INFWAR','Infiltrator Warrior','The Infiltrators who fight as part of Phobos Strike Teams are swift and aggressive in thought and deed, even by the standards of their warrior brotherhood. Few foes can long evade their pinpoint volleys or the bone-crushing blows of their armoured fists.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, INFILTRATOR, WARRIOR',32,0,'Scout,Marksman'),('IMP','PHO','PHO',3,'RVRSGT','Reiver Sergeant','Reiver Sergeants are masters of psychological warfare and terror tactics. Their remit is to wield their Phobos Strike Team like a scalpel, slicing apart the tenuous strands of enemy morale until the foe\'s forces are reduced to a nerveless and broken tangle.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','13','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, LEADER, REIVER, SERGEANT',32,0,'Scout,Marksman,Combat'),('IMP','PHO','PHO',13,'RVRWAR','Reiver Warrior','Bursting from the shadows amidst vox-amplified howls, Reivers fall upon their horrified victims with pistols booming and blades swinging. As their foes reel from the disorienting blasts of their Shock Grenades, the Reivers make short and bloody work of their victims.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, REIVER, WARRIOR',32,0,'Scout,Marksman,Combat'),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24',9,'INCMARK','Incursor Marksman','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, INCURSOR, MARKSMAN',32,0,''),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24',10,'INCML','Incursor Minelayer','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, INCURSOR, MINELAYER',32,0,''),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24',8,'INCSGT','Incursor Sergeant','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','3+','13','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, LEADER, INCURSOR, SERGEANT',32,0,''),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24',11,'INCWAR','Incursor Warrior','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, INCURSOR, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24',2,'INFCOM','Infiltrator Commsman','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, INFILTRATOR, COMMSMAN',32,0,''),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24',3,'INFHEL','Infiltrator Helix Adept','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, MEDIC, INFILTRATOR, HELIX ADEPT',32,0,''),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24',4,'INFSAB','Infiltrator Saboteur','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, INFILTRATOR, SABOTEUR',32,0,''),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24',1,'INFSGT','Infiltrator Sergeant','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','3+','13','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, LEADER, INFILTRATOR, SERGEANT',32,0,''),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24',5,'INFVET','Infiltrator Veteran','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, INFILTRATOR, VETERAN',32,0,''),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24',6,'INFVOX','Infiltrator Voxbreaker','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, INFILTRATOR, VOXBREAKER',32,0,''),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24',7,'INFWAR','Infiltrator Warrior','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, INFILTRATOR, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24',12,'RVRSGT','Reiver Sergeant','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','3+','13','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, LEADER, REIVER, SERGEANT',32,0,''),('IMP','PHO24','PHO24',13,'RVRWAR','Reiver Warrior','','kt24','7\"','3','0','0','3+','12','PHOBOS STRIKE TEAM , IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, REIVER, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('IMP','SCT','SCT',1,'HGNR','Scout Heavy Gunner','These operatives are highly able warriors who use heavy weapons - from Missile Launchers to Heavy Bolters - to engage and destroy powerful enemy targets.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','10','SCOUT SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, SCOUT, HEAVY GUNNER',32,1,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','SCT','SCT',2,'HNTR','Scout Hunter','Armed with grapnel launchers, Hunters can swiftly traverse dangerous terrain and negotiate challenging ground to circumnavigate enemy strongpoints, set up ambushers, or evade pursuers.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','10','SCOUT SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, SCOUT, HUNTER',32,1,'Combat,Scout'),('IMP','SCT','SCT',0,'SGT','Scout Sergeant','Veterans of their Chapter, these highly experienced warriors choose to train the next generation of battle-brothers. They lead by example, commanding the respect of their charges with their courage and tactical acumen.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','4+','11','SCOUT SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, LEADER, SCOUT, SERGEANT',32,1,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','SCT','SCT',3,'SNP','Scout Sniper','Snipers excel in fulfilling the fundamental elements of assassinations and reconnaissance in Scout Squad missions. They carefully observe enemy movements from hidden positions they hold for days, waiting for the precise moment to take a killing shot.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','10','SCOUT SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, SCOUT, SNIPER',32,1,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','SCT','SCT',4,'TRK','Scout Tracker','Trackers carry highly powerful auspexes - scanners capable of analysing the battlefield Thanks to the information such devices provide, Scout Squads can identify targets or rapidly plan deadly ambushes.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','10','SCOUT SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, SCOUT, TRACKER',32,1,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','SCT','SCT',5,'WAR','Scout Warrior','These operatives are skilled fighters, committed to their squad and and determined to ascend to full battle-brother status. No matter what the mission demands of them, they will fight furiously to defeat the enemy and prove themselves.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','10','SCOUT SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, SCOUT, WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','SCT24','SCT24',2,'HGNR','Scout Heavy Gunner','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','10','SCOUT SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, HEAVY GUNNER',32,1,''),('IMP','SCT24','SCT24',3,'HNT','Scout Hunter','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','10','SCOUT SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, HUNTER',32,1,''),('IMP','SCT24','SCT24',1,'SGT','Scout Sergeant','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','4+','11','SCOUT SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, LEADER, SERGEANT',32,1,''),('IMP','SCT24','SCT24',4,'SNP','Scout Sniper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','10','SCOUT SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, SNIPER',32,1,''),('IMP','SCT24','SCT24',5,'TRK','Scout Tracker','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','10','SCOUT SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, TRACKER',32,1,''),('IMP','SCT24','SCT24',6,'WAR','Scout Warrior','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','10','SCOUT SQUAD, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('IMP','SFJ','SFJ',2,'ACU','Brother Acules','Acules is a Heavy Intercessor of the Ultramarines Chapter and a member of the Strike Force Justian Kill Team Unit.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','18','STRIKE FORCE JUSTIAN, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, BROTHER ACULES',32,1,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','SFJ','SFJ',0,'CAP','Captain Justian','Justian is a Captain in the Ultramarines Chapter, who commands the Strike Force Justian Kill Team Unit.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','15','STRIKE FORCE JUSTIAN, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, CAPTAIN JUSTIAN',32,1,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','SFJ','SFJ',3,'DEC','Brother Decian','Decian is an Assault Intercessor in the Ultramarines Chapter and a member of the Strike Force Justian Kill Team Unit.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','14','STRIKE FORCE JUSTIAN, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, BROTHER DECIAN',32,1,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','SFJ','SFJ',4,'FLA','Brother Flavian','Flavian is a Vanguard Eliminator in the Ultramarines Chapter and a member of the Strike Force Justian Kill Team Unit.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','STRIKE FORCE JUSTIAN, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, BROTHER FLAVIAN',32,1,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','SFJ','SFJ',1,'SGT','Sergeant Marius','Marius is a Sergeant in the Ultramarines Chapter and a member of the Strike Force Justian Kill Team Unit.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','15','STRIKE FORCE JUSTIAN, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, SERGEANT MARIUS',32,1,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','SFJ','SFJ',5,'THY','Brother Thysor','Thysor is an Intercessor Grenadier of the Ultramarines Chapter and a member of the Strike Force Justian Kill Team Unit.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','14','STRIKE FORCE JUSTIAN, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, BROTHER THYSOR',32,1,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','SFJ','SFJ',6,'VIG','Brother Vignius','Vignius is a Sniper in the Ultramarines Chapter and a member of the Strike Force Justian Kill Team Unit.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','14','STRIKE FORCE JUSTIAN, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, BROTHER VIGNIUS',32,1,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','SM','AINT',1,'SGT','Assault Intercessor Sergeant','Assault Intercessor Sergeants understand the optimal moment to unleash charges, and lead by example in melee by rending foes in twain with their chainswords.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','14','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, LEADER, ASSAULT INTERCESSOR, SERGEANT',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','SM','AINT',2,'WAR','Assault Intercessor Warrior','Protected by Mk X Tacticus Armour, Assault Intercessors charge into the fray with their chainswords swinging and mass-reactive shells firing from heavy bolt pistols','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','13','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, ASSAULT INTERCESSOR, WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','SM','DW',3,'FTR','DeathWatch Fighter','Those Deathwatch Veterans who excel in bloody close combat wield a variety of pistols, blades, and powered hammers that can pulverise almost any foe.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','11','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, DEATHWATCH VETERAN, FIGHTER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','SM','DW',4,'GNR','DeathWatch Gunner','Veteran xenos hunters know the alien has many forms, each as repugnant as the next. Those who prefer to slay at range equip themselves with artificer-wrought rifles and advanced combination assault guns, firing chitin-piercing rounds or shells filled with mutagenic acid.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','11','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, DEATHWATCH VETERAN, GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','SM','DW',5,'HGNR','DeathWatch Heavy Gunner','These Deathwatch Veterans bear the most potent of xenos-killing firepower, and support kill teams facing especially dangerous horrors.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','11','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, DEATHWATCH VETERAN, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','SM','DW',1,'SGT','DeathWatch Sergeant','Deathwatch Watch Sergeants are deadly combatants and tacticians who carry an array of specialist weapons and have an instinct for divining their prey\'s next move.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, LEADER, DEATHWATCH VETERAN, SERGEANT',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','SM','DW',2,'WAR','DeathWatch Warrior','Deathwatch kill teams comprise experienced warriors equipped with rare weapons and equipment, including specialist ammunition tailored to kill various xenos.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','11','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, DEATHWATCH VETERAN, WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','SM','HINT',3,'HGNR','Heavy Intercessor Heavy Gunner','Heavy Intercessors are assigned even more powerful bolt weapons than their brothers. They are enormous, rapid-firing guns that leave a bloody trail of destruction.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','18','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, LEADER, HEAVY INTERCESSOR, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','SM','HINT',1,'SGT','Heavy Intercessor Sergeant','Assigning target priorities and monitoring fire lanes, Heavy Intercessor Sergeants are always ready for any sign of enemy counter-attack.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','19','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, LEADER, HEAVY INTERCESSOR, SERGEANT',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','SM','HINT',2,'WAR','Heavy Intercessor Warrior','Shielded by extremely thick armour, Heavy Intercessors are capable of securing key objectives and holding them against an onslaught of foes. They are immovable in defence, and their volleys of heavy firepower keep all but the most foolhardy enemies at bay.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','18','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, LEADER, HEAVY INTERCESSOR, WARRIOR',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','SM','INC',1,'SGT','Incursor Sergeant','Incursor Sergeants coordinate their team\'s multi-spectrum analyses, building predictive models of their opponents\' fighting patterns. They lead their warriors in knife-fighting techniques and direct specialists in laying heavy-duty haywire mines to knowck out enemy armour.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','13','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, INCURSOR, SERGEANT',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','SM','INC',2,'WAR','Incursor Warrior','Incursors fulfill an aggressive, close-quarters gun-fighting role within the Adeptus Astartes. Fed with targeting data from their backpack-mounted auspexes, they can detect their foes through dense smoke, atmospheric phenomena, and even solid walls.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, INCURSOR, WARRIOR',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','SM','INF',1,'SGT','Infiltrator Sergeant','Sergeants of Infiltrator teams drill their charges in self-sufficiency and survival techniques, preparing them for extended missions without Chapter support. Patient and imaginative tacticians, they guide their brothers in outflanking manoeuvres and long-range reconnaissance.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','13','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, LEADER, INFILTRATOR, SERGEANT',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','SM','INF',2,'WAR','Infiltrator Warrior','The flexible armour worn by Infiltrators enables them to advance quickly and stealthily. They frequently attack behind enemy lines, disrupting communications and silencing key targets. Their omni-scramblers and unerring kill shots sow discord and fear among the foe.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, INFILTRATOR, WARRIOR',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','SM','INT',1,'SGT','Intercessor Sergeant','Intercessor Sergeants lead their brothers in levelling salvoes of firepower against targets in ever-changing kill zones. They often carry specialist weaponry into battle.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','14','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, INTERCESSOR, SERGEANT, LEADER',32,0,'Marksman,Staunch'),('IMP','SM','INT',2,'WAR','Intercessor Warrior','Space Marines equipped to fight as Intercessors lay down punishing volleys of fire from their bolt rifles. Their tactics and wargear are adaptable to countless situations, and they form the core of many Chapters\' battle companies','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','13','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, INTERCESSOR, WARRIOR',32,0,'Marksman,Staunch'),('IMP','SM','RVR',1,'SGT','Reiver Sergeant','Reiver Sergeants lead teams of skull-masked warriors in unpredictable shock assaults that spread terror through enemy lines. They meticulously plot their insertion strategies, whether advancing through tangled ruins or using grapnels to scale vast heights.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','13','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, LEADER, REIVER, SERGEANT',32,0,'Marksman,Scout,Combat'),('IMP','SM','RVR',2,'WAR','Reiver Warrior','Reivers are rapid-insertion terror troops without compare. They wear Phobos armour that allows them to stalk their foes in silence, but when they strike, Reivers unleash shock grenades and sonic waves that emot amplified roars as they gut the foe with combat knives.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, PRIMARIS, REIVER, WARRIOR',32,0,'Marksman,Scout,Combat'),('IMP','SM','SCT',5,'HGNR','Scout Heavy Gunner','Scouts must become proficient with a wide variety of armaments, and their dangerous missions often demand powerful support. A Heavy Bolter is a common addition to a unit\'s firepower, as is a missile launcher with its flexible and optional payloads.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, SCOUT, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,'Scout,Marksman'),('IMP','SM','SCT',1,'SGT','Scout Sergeant','Throughout their field training, Scouts are instructed by their Sergeant. Commonly elder Space Marines, these Sergeants are the shepherds of the Chapter\'s future, exacting in their standards and ruthless in their pursuit of perfection from their wards.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','9','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, LEADER, SCOUT, SERGEANT',32,0,'Scout,Marksman,Combat'),('IMP','SM','SCT',4,'SNP','Scout Sniper','Scouts learn not only about unleashing their strength in the fury of melee, but also about the stoic patience of the precision killer. They regularly untdertake missions of assassination and infiltration, and acquire the skills to stalk and strike unseen from afar as death incarnate.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, SCOUT, SNIPER',32,0,'Scout,Marksman'),('IMP','SM','SCT',2,'SNPSGT','Scout Sniper Sergeant','Through unerring headshots, Scout Sergeants espouse in young warriors the inevitability of their enemy\'s demise, and the futility of the foe\'s attempts to flee.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','9','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, LEADER, SCOUT, SNIPER SERGEANT',32,0,'Scout,Marksman'),('IMP','SM','SCT',3,'WAR','Scout Warrior','Scouts are Chapter recruits, part way through the genetic transformation to become full Space Marines. They conduct reconnaissance missions, commando raids, ambushes and sabotage runs, mastering the whole gamut of skills to be judged true battle brothers.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, SCOUT, WARRIOR',32,0,'Scout'),('IMP','SM','TAC',3,'GNR','Tactical Marine Gunner','Space Marines train with countless weapon types in support of their flexible role. Depending on the mission, they wield thermal weapons to melt armour, infantry-roasting flamers, or ancient firearms that discharge dangerous energy.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','11','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, TACTICAL MARINE, GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman,Staunch'),('IMP','SM','TAC',4,'HGNR','Tactical Marine Heavy Gunner','Far too large to be wielded by any unaugmented Human, the heaviest weaponry can overturn a tank, demolish signal arrays, and obliterate most enemies.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','11','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, TACTICAL MARINE, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman,Staunch'),('IMP','SM','TAC',1,'SGT','Tactical Marine Sergeant','These grizzled leaders have emerged victorious through countless battles. They are canny individuals, able to pick out the threats and opportunities of battle.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, LEADER, TACTICAL MARINE, SERGEANT',32,0,'Marksman,Staunch,Combat'),('IMP','SM','TAC',2,'WAR','Tactical Marine Warrior','Dependable and flexible, Space Marines assigned to Tactical Squads are called upon to fulfill a wide range of battlefield roles. When armed with the Boltgun, they can hold ground, provide fire support, and unload suppressive salvoes while rapidly advancing.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','11','SPACE MARINE, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS ASTARTES, <CHAPTER>, TACTICAL MARINE, WARRIOR',32,0,'Marksman,Staunch'),('IMP','TEMPAQ','TEMPAQ',2,'GF','Aquilon Gunfighter','','kt24','6\"','2','1','0','4+','8','TEMPESTUS AQUILON, IMPERIUM, GUNFIGHTER',32,0,''),('IMP','TEMPAQ','TEMPAQ',3,'GNR','Aquilon Gunner','','kt24','6\"','2','1','0','4+','8','TEMPESTUS AQUILON, IMPERIUM, GUNNER',32,0,''),('IMP','TEMPAQ','TEMPAQ',1,'GRN','Aquilon Grenadier','','kt24','6\"','2','1','0','4+','8','TEMPESTUS AQUILON, IMPERIUM, GRENADIER',32,0,''),('IMP','TEMPAQ','TEMPAQ',4,'MRK','Aquilon Marksman','','kt24','6\"','2','1','0','4+','8','TEMPESTUS AQUILON, IMPERIUM, MARKSMAN',32,0,''),('IMP','TEMPAQ','TEMPAQ',5,'PRE','Aquilon Precursor','','kt24','6\"','2','1','0','4+','8','TEMPESTUS AQUILON, IMPERIUM, PRECURSOR',32,0,''),('IMP','TEMPAQ','TEMPAQ',6,'SS','Aquilon Servo-Sentry','','kt24','4\"','2','1','0','3+','10','TEMPESTUS AQUILON, IMPERIUM, SERVO-SENTRY',32,0,''),('IMP','TEMPAQ','TEMPAQ',0,'TEMP','Aquilon Tempestor','','kt24','6\"','3','1','0','4+','9','TEMPESTUS AQUILON, IMPERIUM, LEADER, TEMPESTOR',32,0,''),('IMP','TEMPAQ','TEMPAQ',7,'TRP','Aquilon Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','1','0','4+','8','TEMPESTUS AQUILON, IMPERIUM, TROOPER',32,0,''),('IMP','TOE','CG',0,'LDR','Custodian Guard Leader','Some Custodians inevitably rise to prominence, exemplifying their companions\' traits of supreme martial prowess, keen intellect, and scrutinizing minds. They carry artificer-crafted, powered blades that are capable of cleaving traitor Space Marines in two.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','2+','19','TALONS OF THE EMPEROR, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS CUSTODES, <SHIELD HOST>, CUSTODIAN GUARD, LEADER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','TOE','CG',0,'WAR','Custodian Guard Warrior','Custodian Guard are steadfast in defence and unstoppable on the attack, working ceaselessly to defend the Emperor\'s realm. Created through arcane gene-tech, each of them have a fragment of the Emperor\'s might flowing through their veins.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','2+','18','TALONS OF THE EMPEROR, IMPERIUM, ADEPTUS CUSTODES, <SHIELD HOST>, CUSTODIAN GUARD, WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','TOE','SOS',0,'PRO','Sister Of Silence Prosecutor','Among the psychic nulls who make up the Sisters of Silence, Prosecutors form the core of their sinister cadres. Lethal in both attack and defence, Prosecutors cut down congregations of mutant sorcerers and rogue psykers with salvoes from their Umbra-pattern boltguns.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','TALONS OF THE EMPEROR, IMPERIUM, ANATHEMA PSYKANA, SISTER OF SILENCE, PROSECUTOR',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','TOE','SOS',0,'SUP','Sister Of Silence Superior','Once fully trained, a Sister of Silence takes the Oath of Tranquility, vowing never to utter a word, and communicates instead via  a secretive sign language. Sisters Superior are experts in their Battlemark form, coordinating their team\'s assault in unnerving silence.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','9','TALONS OFTHE EMPEROR, IMPERIUM, ANATHEMA PSYKANA, LEADER, SISTER OF SILENCE, SUPERIOR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','TOE','SOS',0,'VIG','Sister Of Silence Vigilator','Vigilators capitalise on their innate gifts, assaulting their prey when the effects of their soulless aura are at their most potent. They train tirelessly with enormous Greatblades in an ancient form of combat, laying open their victims\' guard before landing a decapitating blow.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','TALONS OF THE EMPEROR, IMPERIUM, ANATHEMA PSYKANA, SISTER OF SILENCE, VIGILATOR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','TOE','SOS',0,'WSK','Sister Of Silence Witchseeker','Like all of their kind, Witchseekers bear the rare Pariah gene. They have no presence in the Warp and exude an intense aura that causes psykers pain and horror. Once Witchseekers corner their psychic quarry, they purify their taint with blazing infernos of fire.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','TALONS OF THE EMPEROR, IMPERIUM, ANATHEMA PSYKANA, SISTER OF SILENCE, WITCHSEEKER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('IMP','VG','VG',0,'BRS','Bruiser Veteran','For some, war and fighting just agrees with them. Bruiser Veterans are such people. They look the galaxy’s endless malevolent threats in the eye with a trench club in their hand, ready to bludgeon anything and everything to death.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','VETERAN GUARDSMAN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, BRUISER VETERAN',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','VG','VG',0,'CNF','Confidant Veteran','Even the best Sergeant Veterans need to call on solid tactical advice - and their confidants are experts. Experienced troops and capable leaders themselves, they can be trusted to carry out the sergeant’s orders in the field as well as contribute to the formulation of a solid battle plan.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','VETERAN GUARDSMAN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, CONFIDANT VETERAN',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','VG','VG',0,'COMMS','Comms Veteran','Comms Veterans are consummate professionals, accompanying their leaders wherever required whilst carrying heavy equipment, all to receive and transmit communications that are vital for their comrades and superiors to understand the inevitable confusion of battle.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','VETERAN GUARDSMAN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, COMMS VETERAN',32,0,'Scout,Staunch'),('IMP','VG','VG',0,'DEMO','Demolition Veteran','Whether blowing up ammo dumps or cracking open defences, many kill teams need explosives experts. Demolition Veterans are such troops. Naturally daring, they often have to put themselves in harm’s way to plant their remote mines at the optimum point to blow their target into smithereens.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','VETERAN GUARDSMAN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, DEMOLITION VETERAN',32,0,'Scout,Staunch'),('IMP','VG','VG',0,'GNR','Gunner Veteran','With experience and skills in wielding a whole host of specialist weapons, Gunner Veterans are called whether a Sergeant Veteran needs a xenos nest burned to nothing, a bunker reduced to melted sludge or to bring down heavy enemy infantry that lasguns are insufficient for.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','VETERAN GUARDSMAN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, GUNNER VETERAN',32,0,'Marksman'),('IMP','VG','VG',0,'HARD','Hardened Veteran','Some Veterans are resilient above and beyond even their peers. These troops are steel in body as well as in mind, with bionics in the place of body parts lost in battle. Despite the horrific wounds they have suffered, they fight on still, unbowed.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','VETERAN GUARDSMAN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, HARDENED VETERAN',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('IMP','VG','VG',0,'MDC','Medic Veteran','The efforts of the Medic Veteran is all that stands between life and \nmiserable death for the troops of his squad. Equipped with little more \nthan basic medical equipment, they strive to keep their comrades alive \nin the most hazardous conditions.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','VETERAN GUARDSMAN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, MEDIC, MEDIC VETERAN',32,0,'Scout,Staunch'),('IMP','VG','VG',0,'SGT','Sergeant Veteran','Veteran Sergeants command squads of Veterans in battle. Calm under pressure and unphased by the horrors of war, they are solid combat leaders who will fight tooth and nail to achieve victory as well as see their comrades survive to fight another day.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','VETERAN GUARDSMAN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, LEADER, SERGEANT VETERAN',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('IMP','VG','VG',0,'SNP','Sniper Veteran','Expert marksmen, their skills honed in the harsh conditions of numerous battlefields, Sniper Veterans are sharpshooters who specialise in cutting down key enemy troops at extreme ranges - all unseen by the foe.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','VETERAN GUARDSMAN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, SNIPER VETERAN',32,0,'Marksman'),('IMP','VG','VG',0,'SPOT','Spotter Veteran','To direct battle-winning heavy fire, forward observers form a part of kill teams. These Spotter Veterans possess great focus, accurately guiding salvoes of mortar fire from safe lines even when under immense pressure. With this they can stymie enemy attacks or pin them down in their defences.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','VETERAN GUARDSMAN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, SPOTTER VETERAN',32,0,'Scout'),('IMP','VG','VG',13,'TACASS','Tactical Assets','This Ancillary Support consists of 2 tactical assets. Tactical assets \nare not operatives, therefore are not recorded on your roster/dataslate.\n Each time you select this asset, select two options from the list below\n to use in the battle. You can select each option once.','kt21','-','-','-','-','-','-','-',32,1,''),('IMP','VG','VG',0,'TRP','Trooper Veteran','Astra Militarum Veterans have a great deal of combat experience, gained over experiencing harsh fighting for months or even years. Armed with lasguns and bayonets, they have faced down terrible danger time and time again.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','5+','7','VETERAN GUARDSMAN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, TROOPER VETERAN',32,0,'Scout,Marksman'),('IMP','VG','VG',0,'ZLT','Zealot Veteran','Zealot Veterans are deeply spiritual warriors, often claiming their survival through the horrifying battlefields they’ve experienced is only thanks to the direct intervention of the Emperor himself.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','VETERAN GUARDSMAN, IMPERIUM, ASTRA MILITARUM, <REGIMENT>, ZEALOT VETERAN',32,0,'Staunch'),('NEC','HIER','HIER',5,'APP','Apprentek','More than mere assistants to their Cryptek masters and mistresses, Apprenteks are conduits for their power. They and their staffs serve as nodes and focusing lenses for the Crypteks\' abilities, who can even see through their eyes at will.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','12','HIEROTEK CIRCLE, NECRON, <DYNASTY>, APPRENTEK',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('NEC','HIER','HIER',0,'CHRON','Chronomancer','With their Aeonstaves and Entropic Lances, Chronomancers can slow down or speed up weaponised time. Wily manuipulators of temporal energies, they can wither their foes to ancient dust with but a word or gesture.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','13','HIEROTEK CIRCLE, NECRON, <DYNASTY>, FLY, LEADER, CRYPTEK, CHRONOMANCER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman,Scout'),('NEC','HIER','HIER',6,'DM','Deathmark','No target can evade the Deathmarks. Watching from dimensional oubliettes, these expert snipers track enemy movements, communications, and even teleport signatures before striking. They do so in a blaze of synaptic disintegrator fire that shreds not only their victims\' bodies, but also their very minds.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','10','HIEROTEK CIRCLE, NECRON, <DYNASTY>, DEATHMARK',32,0,'Marksman'),('NEC','HIER','HIER',7,'ID','Immortal Despotek','Senior-level Immortals, a Despotek serves as both a mouthpiece and an enforcer for their Cryptek in Hierotek Circles, as well as a strategic conduit. In addition to this, they are superb warriors in their own right.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','12','HIEROTEK CIRCLE, NECRON, <DYNASTY>, IMMORTAL, DESPOTEK',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('NEC','HIER','HIER',8,'IG','Immortal Guardian','Immortal Guardians provide their masters with a powerful core of skilled soldiery. Retaining a level of individuality after biotransference, they can employ a number of strategies even without command, and their firepower makes them deadly in close- or mid-range engagements.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','10','HIEROTEK CIRCLE, NECRON, <DYNASTY>, IMMORTAL, GUARDIAN',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('NEC','HIER','HIER',3,'PA','Plasmacyte Accelerator','It is the purpose of these Plasmacytes to enhance the mental processing capabilities of nearby Necrons an improve their operational efficiency.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','2','5+','5','HIEROTEK CIRCLE, NECRON, <DYNASTY>, FLY, PLASMACYTE, ACCELERATOR',32,0,'Scout'),('NEC','HIER','HIER',4,'PR','Plasmacyte Reanimator','These Plasmacytes have been designed to ensure that nearby Necrons reanimate more quickly if they sustain serious damage, using their monomolecular proboscis to inject rapid-repair enabling fluids.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','2','5+','5','HIEROTEK CIRCLE, NECRON, <DYNASTY>, FLY, PLASMACYTE, REANIMATOR',32,0,'Scout'),('NEC','HIER','HIER',1,'PSYCH','Psychomancer','Psychomancers study the science of fear. They are expert manipulators, conjuring phantasms and temporary hard-light constructs that trigger primal survival instincts in their victims\' minds, or overload even the most advanced sensoria. No being is safe from the Psychomancer\'s art.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','13','HIEROTEK CIRCLE, NECRON, <DYNASTY>, FLY, LEADER, CRYPTEK, PSYCHOMANCER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman,Scout'),('NEC','HIER','HIER',2,'TECH','Technomancer','Master manipulators of technology of all kinds, Technomancers are particularly skilled at repairing downed Necrons and Canoptek constructs, or enhancing their abilities','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','3+','13','HIEROTEK CIRCLE, NECRON, <DYNASTY>, FLY, MEDIC, LEADER, CRYPTEK, TECHNOMANCER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman,Scout'),('NEC','HIER24','HIER24',6,'APP','Apprentek','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','11','HIEROTEK CIRCLE , NECRON, APPRENTEK',32,0,''),('NEC','HIER24','HIER24',1,'CHRON','Chronomancer','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','HIEROTEK CIRCLE , NECRON, LEADER, CRYPTEK, CHRONOMANCER',32,0,''),('NEC','HIER24','HIER24',7,'DM','Deathmark','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','3+','10','HIEROTEK CIRCLE , NECRON, DEATHMARK',32,0,''),('NEC','HIER24','HIER24',8,'ID','Immortal Despotek','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','3+','11','HIEROTEK CIRCLE , NECRON, IMMORTAL, DESPOTEK',32,0,''),('NEC','HIER24','HIER24',9,'IG','Immortal Guardian','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','3+','10','HIEROTEK CIRCLE , NECRON, IMMORTAL, GUARDIAN',32,0,''),('NEC','HIER24','HIER24',4,'PA','Plasmacyte Accelerator','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','5+','5','HIEROTEK CIRCLE , NECRON, PLASMACYTE, ACCELERATOR',32,0,''),('NEC','HIER24','HIER24',5,'PR','Plasmacyte Reanimator','','kt24','7\"','2','0','0','5+','5','HIEROTEK CIRCLE , NECRON, MEDIC, PLASMACYTE, REANIMATOR',32,0,''),('NEC','HIER24','HIER24',2,'PSYCH','Psychomancer','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','HIEROTEK CIRCLE , NECRON, LEADER, CRYPTEK, PSYCHOMANCER',32,0,''),('NEC','HIER24','HIER24',3,'TECH','Technomancer','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','HIEROTEK CIRCLE , NECRON, LEADER, CRYPTEK, TECHNOMANCER',32,0,''),('NEC','TW','DM',0,'LDR','Deathmark Leader','Especially keen-eyed and merciless Deathmarks know how best to lead their fellows into battle. Such android assassins serve as excellent tools for the more dishonourable amongst the Necron nobility, eliminating their enemies from the shadows.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','11','TOMB WORLD, NECRON, <DYNASTY>, DEATHMARK, LEADER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('NEC','TW','DM',0,'WAR','Deathmark Warrior','There is nothing of old Codes of Honour about the way a Deathmark fights, yet they are ferociously effective. Their synaptic disintegrators obliterate the directing animus of their victims, causing seemingly unharmed beings to convulse then drop dead like puppets with cut strings.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','10','TOMB WORLD, NECRON, <DYNASTY>, DEATHMARK, WARRIOR',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('NEC','TW','FLO',0,'LDR','Flayed One Leader','These Flayed Ones are the most devious and driven of their kind. They hunt down their victims with supernatural skill, stalking inescapably after the foe with a single-mindedness that is terrifying to behold. Others of the kind flock after them eager to join in the nightmare hunt.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','10','TOMB WORLD, NECRON, <DYNASTY>, FLAYED ONE, LEADER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('NEC','TW','FLO',0,'WAR','Flayed One Warrior','Tormented by a gruesome curse, Flayed Ones are warped in both mind and android body. Possessed of flensing finger-blades and a nightmarish hunger for flesh and blood, these awful creatures stalk their prey from the shadows and don their victims\' tattered hides after the kill.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','9','TOMB WORLD, NECRON, <DYNASTY>, FLAYED ONE, WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('NEC','TW','IMM',0,'LDR','Immortal Leader','Some Immortals retain a little more of the sentience that was stolen from their kind during the horrors of biotransference. Far from benifitting the Immortal itself, these characteristics simply make them excellent squad leaders, ultimately furthering the whims of their overlords.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','11','TOMB WORLD, NECRON, <DYNASTY>, IMMORTAL, LEADER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('NEC','TW','IMM',0,'WAR','Immortal Warrior','Immortals are elite foot soldiers. They are built to endure even the most punishing firefights and close-quarters brawls. They also carry sizeable Gauss or Tesla firearms of their own, directing their formidable firepower with the ingrained tactical cunning that is their hallmark.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','10','TOMB WORLD, NECRON, <DYNASTY>, IMMORTAL, WARRIOR',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('NEC','TW','NC',0,'NEC','Necron Warrior','The rank-and-file of the Necron legions are still formidable combatants. Android killers with just enough sentience to follow their masters\' commands, they are relentless and frighteningly resilient, and boast firepower sufficient to flay their victims down to the component atoms.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','9','TOMB WORLD, NECRON, <DYNASTY>, NECRON WARRIOR',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('ORK','GSK','BOY',0,'BN','Boss Nob','Orks grow bigger and more belligerent the more they fight. Over time, the most experienced fighters become hulking greenskins. Nobz have survived endless war and infighting through a combination of strength, cunning, and the instinct to destroy anything that challenges them.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','13','GREENSKIN, ORK, <CLAN>, LEADER, BOY, BOSS NOB',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('ORK','GSK','BOY',0,'FTR','Boy Fighter','Boys form the muscled, brutal majority of any teeming Ork horde. No self-respecting Ork would be without a loud slugga and at least one enormous choppa with which to vent their wild fury. They live only for the joy of violence and the clamouring din of war.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','GREENSKIN, ORK, <CLAN>, BOY, FIGHTER',32,0,'Combat,Marksman'),('ORK','GSK','BOY',0,'GNR','Boy Gunner','Orks enjoy the din and recoil of the large firearms they refer to collectively as shootas, as much as the weapons\' gory results. Shootas are often cobbled together from scrap, but unleash hails of solid shot that can rip apart almost anything through sheer volume.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','GREENSKIN, ORK, <CLAN>, BOY, GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('ORK','GSK','BOY',0,'GRE','Gretchin','Gretchin - or grots - are stunted, sneaky, and vicious. They are more nimble than their Okr masters, able to squeeze through narrow spaces and operate more complicated gubbins. Their sharp eyes enable them to act as lookouts and sentries, and their screech of alarm is piercing.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','6+','5','GREENSKIN, ORK, <CLAN>, BOY, GRETCHIN',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('ORK','GSK','CK',0,'FTR','Clan Kommando Fighter','Kommandos epitomise the Orky virtue of low cunning, taking a less directly confrontational approach to their peers. Few things make them happier than sneakin gup on an unsuspecting enemy and hacking, slashing, and shooting before the foe can strike back.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','GREENSKIN, ORK, <CLAN>, CLAN KOMMANDO, FIGHTER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('ORK','GSK','CK',0,'NOB','Clan Kommando Nob','The sneakiest of all their tribe\'s sneaky gits, Kommando Nobs are both brutal and cunning enough to boss about the most conniving of their species as they lead espionage operations behind enemy lines.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','13','GREENSKIN, ORK, <CLAN>, CLAN KOMMANDO, KOMMANDO NOB',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('ORK','GSK','SPE',0,'BUR','Burna Boy','Burna Boyz are pyromaniacs all, obsessed with raging infernos - the bigger and hotter the better. Their burnas can weed hiding enemies out of cover, belching roaring flames that rush into defensive networks and incinerate lighter barriers entirely.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','GREENSKIN, ORK, <CLAN>, SPESHULIST, BURNA BOY',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('ORK','GSK','SPE',0,'LOO','Loota','Lootas are the most heavily armed of all Orks - because they steal the best weapons from everyone else! They are kleptomaniacs obsessed with owning and firing the loudest and most destructive guns, modifying them to make them ever more ostentatious and killy.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','GREENSKIN, ORK, <CLAN>, SPESHULIST, LOOTA',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('ORK','GSK','SPE',0,'SPN','Spanner','On the lower hierarchical rungs of the madcap geniuses known as Meks, Spanners help to keep Ork technology working. They obsessively acquire loot and scrap to build weapons and contraptions, as well as kustom weapons that unleash strange energy beams or ammo.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','GREENSKIN, ORK, <CLAN>, LEADER, SPESHULIST, SPANNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('ORK','KOM','KOM',11,'BOM','Bomb Squig','Bomb squigs are among the most dangerous of their kind. In addition to being voracious predators, as the name suggests they carry all manner of explosives. In battle they race for the foe, blowing up enemy troops and destroying their defences.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','6','KOMMANDO, ORK, <CLAN>, BOMB SQUIG',32,0,'N/A'),('ORK','KOM','KOM',2,'BOY','Kommando Boy','Kommandos epitomise the Orky virtue of low cunning. Few things make them happier than sneaking up on an unsuspecting enemy and hacking, slashing and shooting before the foe strike back.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','KOMMANDO, ORK, <CLAN>, KOMMANDO BOY',32,0,'Scout,Staunch,Combat'),('ORK','KOM','KOM',5,'BRE','Kommando Breacha Boy','Kommando Breacha Boys have the task of barging into places and enemies \nalike and smashing them apart with their Breacha Rams. It is one they \nrelish, and those that see them in action and survive soon learn to \nespecially fear these brutal greenskins.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','KOMMANDO, ORK, <CLAN>, KOMMANDO BREACHA BOY',32,0,'Staunch,Combat'),('ORK','KOM','KOM',9,'BUR','Kommando Burna Boy','Burna Boyz are pyromaniacs all, obsessed with raging infernos - the \nbigger and hotter the better. Those of the Kommandos display an \nextraordinary patience, knowing the wait makes the devastation they \nwreak with their burnas even more satisfying.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','KOMMANDO, ORK, <CLAN>, KOMMANDO BURNA BOY',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('ORK','KOM','KOM',8,'COM','Kommando Comms Boy','There’s no excuse for not following the boss’ plan, no matter how \nquestionably sane it seems. Kommando Comms Boys perform the function of \nensuring no Ork ‘forgets’ their orders on the field by relaying the \nboss’ instructions.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','KOMMANDO, ORK, <CLAN>, KOMMANDO COMMS BOY',32,0,'Scout,Staunch'),('ORK','KOM','KOM',7,'DAK','Kommando Dakka Boy','The sound of roaring dakka is music to the ears of many Orks, not least to Kommando Dakka Boys. They take great delight in pouring vast quantities of bullets into the enemy, destroying light cover, sending foes running and causing pandemonium.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','KOMMANDO, ORK, <CLAN>, KOMMANDO DAKKA BOY',32,0,'Scout,Marksman'),('ORK','KOM','KOM',3,'GRT','Kommando Grot','For Grots to last long in the brutal reality of Ork society, they have to learn to lie, cheat, steal, sneak, suck up and plan - traits all valuable to Kommando kill teams.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','5','KOMMANDO, ORK, <CLAN>, KOMMANDO GROT',32,0,'Scout'),('ORK','KOM','KOM',1,'NOB','Kommando Nob','The sneakiest of sneaky gits, Kommando Nobs are both brutal and cunning \nenough to boss about the most conniving of their species.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','13','KOMMANDO, ORK, <CLAN>, KOMMANDO NOB, LEADER',32,0,'Staunch,Combat'),('ORK','KOM','KOM',10,'RKT','Kommando Rokkit Boy','Rising from hidden locations, Kommando Rokkit Boyz fire rockets at bunkers, fuel silos, ammo dumps or even into the midst of an unsuspecting enemy - all with a broad grin at the havoc they’ve caused.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','KOMMANDO, ORK, <CLAN>, KOMMANDO ROKKIT BOY',32,0,'Marksman'),('ORK','KOM','KOM',4,'SLA','Kommando Slasha Boy','Slasha Boyz love getting into the thick of action, even by Ork standards. Festooned with all manner of blades, they hack and slash their way through enemy after enemy.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','KOMMANDO, ORK, <CLAN>, KOMMANDO SLASHA BOY',32,0,'Scout,Staunch,Combat'),('ORK','KOM','KOM',6,'SNP','Kommando Snipa Boy','Though few Orks have the patience to be a Kommando Snipa Boy, those who perform the role are experts in finding the best spots to fire at the enemy, kill a target and enjoy watching the survivors flail and panic in the confusion inevitably caused.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','KOMMANDO, ORK, <CLAN>, KOMMANDO SNIPA BOY',32,0,'Marksman'),('ORK','KOM24','KOM24',2,'BOY','Kommando Boy','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','10','KOMMANDO, ORK, BOY',32,0,''),('ORK','KOM24','KOM24',5,'BRC','Kommando Breacha Boy','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','10','KOMMANDO, ORK, BREACHA BOY',32,1,''),('ORK','KOM24','KOM24',9,'BRN','Kommando Burna Boy','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','10','KOMMANDO, ORK, BURNA BOY',32,1,''),('ORK','KOM24','KOM24',8,'COMMS','Kommando Comms Boy','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','10','KOMMANDO, ORK, COMMS BOY',32,1,''),('ORK','KOM24','KOM24',7,'DAK','Kommando Dakka Boy','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','10','KOMMANDO, ORK, DAKKA BOY',32,1,''),('ORK','KOM24','KOM24',3,'GROT','Kommando Grot','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','5','KOMMANDO, ORK, GROT',32,1,''),('ORK','KOM24','KOM24',1,'NOB','Kommando Boss Nob','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','5+','14','KOMMANDO, ORK, BOSS NOB',32,1,''),('ORK','KOM24','KOM24',10,'RKT','Kommando Rokkit Boy','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','10','KOMMANDO, ORK, ROKKIT BOY',32,1,''),('ORK','KOM24','KOM24',4,'SLS','Kommando Slasha Boy','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','10','KOMMANDO, ORK, SLASHA BOY',32,1,''),('ORK','KOM24','KOM24',6,'SNP','Kommando Snipa Boy','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','10','KOMMANDO, ORK, SNIPA BOY',32,1,''),('ORK','KOM24','KOM24',11,'SQUIG','Kommando Bomb Squig','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','5','KOMMANDO, ORK, BOMB SQUIG',32,1,''),('SPEC','ATP','ATP',0,'PRI','Prisoner','If the psychic prisoner known in sealed records as ZH00X/_I_ had a name, the memory of it has burned away in the fires of its insanity. Now unshackled aboard the Gallowdark, the prisoner\'s unnatural powers and ambition are swollen with the warp taint that saturates the space hulk.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','6+','10','CULT OF THE UNSHACKLED, LEADER, PSYKER, PRISONER',32,0,''),('SPEC','ATP','ATP',1,'THR','Thrall','All manner of dangerous or desperate fighters have gathered around the prisoner, including Chaos Cultists, Beastmen, and even other escapees of the prison barge. Drawn to its powers, or dominated by its maelfic will, they risk their sould to fight the prisoner\'s foes with a motley of crude weapons.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','7','CULT OF THE UNSHACKLED, THRALL',32,0,''),('SPEC','NPO','NPO',3,'BR-HVY','Brawler Heavy','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','',32,0,''),('SPEC','NPO','NPO',2,'BR-TGH','Brawler Tough','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','10','',32,0,''),('SPEC','NPO','NPO',1,'BR-TRP','Brawler Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','',32,0,''),('SPEC','NPO','NPO',6,'MM-HVY','Marksman Heavy','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','3+','14','',32,0,''),('SPEC','NPO','NPO',4,'MM-TRP','Marksman Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','',32,0,''),('SPEC','NPO','NPO',5,'MM-WAR','Marksman Warrior','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','8','',32,0,''),('TAU','CM','CM',0,'HND','Kroot Hound','Notoriously bad tempered, Kroot Hounds tack quarry with their keen senses. In combat, they use their beak-like mouths to rip at the vulnerable underbellies of their prey. The Kroot find them particularly useful in pursuing fleeing enemies.','kt21','4[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','CADRE MERCENARY, T\'AU EMPIRE, KROOT, HOUND',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('TAU','CM','CM',0,'KTX','Krootox','Krootox are lumbering creatures whose broad backs serve as mobile weapon platforms, upon which a heavy gun is mounted and operated by a Kroot Carnivore. Krootox will fights ferociously to defend their bipedal comrades, whom the best sees as herd brothers.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','4+','16','CADRE MERCENARY, T\'AU EMPIRE, KROOT, KROOTOX',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('TAU','CM','CM',0,'LDR','Kroot Carnivore Leader','Though not as significant in the Kroot hierarchy as the respected Shapers, some Kroot command smaller bands from their kindreds. Expert hunters with seemingly preternatural senses, they have feasted on the flesh of many species and tracked the most dangerous prey.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','9','CADRE MERCENARY, T\'AU EMPIRE, KROOT, CARNIVORE, LEADER',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('TAU','CM','CM',0,'WAR','Kroot Carnivore Warrior','Capable infiltrators, Kroot Carnivores sneak into ambush positions. When they attack, they unleash a volley of fire from their long rifles before closing the distance with the target and tearing into them with heavy blades and sharp maws.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','6+','8','CADRE MERCENARY, T\'AU EMPIRE, KROOT, CARNIVORE, WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('TAU','FSKB','FSKB',1,'BH','Kroot Bow-Hunter','The accelerator bows wielded by these Kroot are distinctive weapons, with a Kroot rifle at their core. When fired, the bow\'s curves crackle with energy, charging the loaded arrow\'s head. Effects on struck enemies vary depending on the material the arrowhead is made from.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','FARSTALKER KINBAND, KROOT, BOW-HUNTER',32,0,'Marksman'),('TAU','FSKB','FSKB',2,'CB','Kroot Cold-Blood','Cold-Bloods have fought as mercenaries for many years indeed. They have seen and experienced much, and little inspires fear in them. The knowledge they have gained makes them adept with different ammunition types, selecting the optimum shot for each kill they wish to make.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','9','FARSTALKER KINBAND, KROOT, COLD-BLOOD',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('TAU','FSKB','FSKB',3,'CS','Kroot Cut-Skin','These Kroot have fully embraced close-combat fighting. Swift and ferocious, Cut-Skins launch a flurry of savage blows against their foes, giving the enemy no opportunity to strike back before they are cut down.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','FARSTALKER KINBAND, KROOT, CUT-SKIN',32,0,'Combat'),('TAU','FSKB','FSKB',4,'HGNR','Kroot Heavy Gunner','Kroot will fight for or against almost any race in the galaxy. In the process they are paid with - or steal - exotic weapons such as Dvorgite Skinners, which charge biological material to create a searing stream of energy, or Londaxi tribalests - anti-armour weapons that fire solid shots a high speeds.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','FARSTALKER KINBAND, KROOT, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman'),('TAU','FSKB','FSKB',5,'HND','Kroot Hound','Fast, nimble, ferocious, and incredibly loyal to their Kroot masters, Kroot hounds are natural companions to the Farstalker Kinbands. These beasts can steal into narrow passageways, recover objects, and rip foes apart with their beaked jaws.','kt21','4[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','FARSTALKER KINBAND, KROOT, HOUND',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('TAU','FSKB','FSKB',0,'KB','Kroot Kill-Broker','Farstalker Kinbands are led by Kill-Brokers. These Kroot are not only expert tacticians and skilled fighters, but also able negotiators, ensuring their kin receive just rewards for their services.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','9','FARSTALKER KINBAND, LEADER, KROOT, KILL-BROKER',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('TAU','FSKB','FSKB',6,'LS','Kroot Long-Sight','The finest shots in Farstalker Kinbands, Long-Sights carry long-barrelled Kroot hunting rifles. They will gladly conceal themselves in position for days at a time to make the perfect shot. Few in their sights ever live to tell the tale.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','FARSTALKER KINBAND, KROOT, LONG-SIGHT',32,0,'Marksman'),('TAU','FSKB','FSKB',7,'PST','Kroot Pistolier','Cool under pressure and comfortable fighting close to the enemy, Kroot Pistoliers are dexterous and quick-thinking fighters. Once in optimum range, they unleash a fusillade from their pistols that is almost impossible to escape.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','FARSTALKER KINBAND, KROOT, PISTOLIER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('TAU','FSKB','FSKB',8,'STK','Kroot Stalker','Even among Kroot, these warriors are particularly able infiltrators and hunters. They possess an almost preternatural understanding of terrain and the art of concealment, able to get extremely close to an enemy before moving in for the kill.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','FARSTALKER KINBAND, KROOT, STALKER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('TAU','FSKB','FSKB',9,'TRK','Kroot Tracker','These Kroot share a very strong personal bond with their Pech\'ra - a bird that hails from Pech itself. The two work in a synchronised manner to aid their kinband. The Pech\'ra can not only distract enemies, but also warn the Kroot of the foe\'s presense.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','FARSTALKER KINBAND, KROOT, TRACKER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('TAU','FSKB','FSKB',10,'WAR','Kroot Warrior','Kroot Warriors are fierce fighters, expert hunters, and relentless trackers. Those of Farstalker Kindreds have spent many years as mercenaries, gaining much experience in was as well as consuming genetic material for the betterment of their kind\'s future.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','5+','8','FARSTALKER KINBAND, KROOT, WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('TAU','FSKB24','FSKB24',1,'BH','Kroot Bow-Hunter','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','FARSTALKER KINBAND, T’AU EMPIRE, KROOT, BOW-HUNTER',32,0,''),('TAU','FSKB24','FSKB24',2,'CB','Kroot Cold-Blood','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','9','FARSTALKER KINBAND, T’AU EMPIRE, KROOT, COLD-BLOOD',32,0,''),('TAU','FSKB24','FSKB24',3,'CS','Kroot Cut-Skin','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','FARSTALKER KINBAND, T’AU EMPIRE, KROOT, CUT-SKIN',32,0,''),('TAU','FSKB24','FSKB24',4,'HGNR','Kroot Heavy Gunner','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','FARSTALKER KINBAND, T’AU EMPIRE, KROOT, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,''),('TAU','FSKB24','FSKB24',5,'HND','Kroot Hound','','kt24','8\"','2','0','0','5+','7','FARSTALKER KINBAND, T’AU EMPIRE, KROOT, HOUND',32,0,''),('TAU','FSKB24','FSKB24',0,'KB','Kroot Kill-Broker','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','9','FARSTALKER KINBAND, T’AU EMPIRE, LEADER, KROOT, KILL-BROKER',32,0,''),('TAU','FSKB24','FSKB24',6,'LS','Kroot Long-Sight','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','FARSTALKER KINBAND, T’AU EMPIRE, KROOT, LONG-SIGHT',32,0,''),('TAU','FSKB24','FSKB24',7,'PST','Kroot Pistolier','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','FARSTALKER KINBAND, T’AU EMPIRE, KROOT, PISTOLIER',32,0,''),('TAU','FSKB24','FSKB24',8,'STK','Kroot Stalker','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','FARSTALKER KINBAND, T’AU EMPIRE, KROOT, STALKER',32,0,''),('TAU','FSKB24','FSKB24',9,'TRK','Kroot Tracker','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','FARSTALKER KINBAND, T’AU EMPIRE, KROOT, TRACKER',32,0,''),('TAU','FSKB24','FSKB24',10,'WAR','Kroot Warrior','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','FARSTALKER KINBAND, T’AU EMPIRE, KROOT, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('TAU','HC','DRN',0,'DS8','DS8 Tactical Support Turret','Tactical Support Turrets are automated defence batteries that provide support for Fire Warriors and T\'au kill teams. They are often deployed by Orca Dropships straight into fixed positions and add the considerable power of their missiles to the fight.','kt21','-','1','1','3','4+','9','HUNTER CADRE, T\'AU, <SEPT>, DRONE, DS8 TACTICAL SUPPORT TURRET',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('TAU','HC','DRN',0,'MB3','MB3 Recon Drone','These large drones are capable of collecting swathes of vital battlefield data that can make the difference between victory and defat. Being larger, they can also be mounted with heavier weaponry - their burst cannon can effectively suppress or cut down enemy infantry.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','12','HUNTER CADRE, T\'AU, <SEPT>, DRONE, FLY,  MB3 RECON DRONE',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman,Scout'),('TAU','HC','DRN',0,'MV1','MV1 Gun Drone','Using anti-gravitic motors and jet-thrusters, Gun Drones hover over the landscape, moving quickly to engage the enemy and record battlefield data. On kill team missions, they can distract enemies as well as partake in attacks alongside the T\'au warriors they serve.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','HUNTER CADRE, T\'AU, <SEPT>, DRONE, FLY,  MV1  GUN DRONE',32,0,'Marksman'),('TAU','HC','DRN',0,'MV31','MV31 Pulse Accelerator Drone','Pulse Accelerator Drones boost the pulse weapons carried by Pathfinders, making the technology much more powerful and giving them a vital edge.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','HUNTER CADRE, T\'AU, <SEPT>, DRONE, FLY,  MV31 PULSE ACCELERATOR DRONE',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('TAU','HC','DRN',0,'MV33','MV33 Grav-Inhibitor Drone','Grav-Inhibitor Drones are capable of manipulating gravity around, and significantly slowing the progress of, oncoming enemy troops. On countless occasions have Pathfinder kill teams escaped almost certain death thanks to the technology carried by these drones.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','HUNTER CADRE, T\'AU, <SEPT>, DRONE, FLY,  MV33 GRAV-INHIBITOR DRONE',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('TAU','HC','DRN',0,'MV36','MV36 Guardian Drone','These defensive drones have emitters that project a protective energy field to nearby field amplifier units borne by other operatives. Those amplifiers pick up the shielding force field of the Guardian Drone and spread it in an energised umbrella over their bearer.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','HUNTER CADRE, T\'AU, <SEPT>, DRONE, FLY,  MV36 GUARDIAN DRONE',32,0,'Staunch'),('TAU','HC','DRN',0,'MV4','MV4 Shield Drone','Shield Drones are fitted with shield generators rather than weaponry. It is their task to protect the Pathfinders they accompnay. Their saviour protocols ensure that, should a T\'au come under direct threat, the Shield Drone will protect them from harm.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','HUNTER CADRE, T\'AU, <SEPT>, DRONE, FLY,  MV4 SHIELD DRONE',32,0,'Staunch'),('TAU','HC','DRN',0,'MV7','MV7 Marker Drone','The high-intensity markerlights used by Marker Drones are vital for the synergy of T\'au forces. They indicate priority targets both for the Pathfinders they are alongside as well as other powerful T\'au assets. Whatever they pick out will soon be obliterated.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','HUNTER CADRE, T\'AU, <SEPT>, DRONE, FLY,  MV7 MARKER DRONE',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('TAU','HC','FW',0,'SL','Fire Warrior Shas\'La','Bred for war, Fire Warriors are rigorously trained soldiers committed wholly to the Greater Good. In addition to bearing powerful weapons systems and lightweight but durable body armour, their helmets contain sensors, target-tracking readouts, and communication uplinks.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','HUNTER CADRE, T\'AU, <SEPT>, FIRE WARRIOR, SHAS\'LA',32,0,'Marksman'),('TAU','HC','FW',0,'SU','Fire Warrior Shas\'Ui','These veteran Fire Warriors are driven to ensure their team\'s cohesion and the following of textbook martial tenets. Able combat commanders, they quickly react to changing battlefield situations and easily adapt their plans in accordance with new orders.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HUNTER CADRE, T\'AU, <SEPT>, LEADER, FIRE WARRIOR, SHAS\'UI',32,0,'Marksman'),('TAU','HC','PF',0,'HGNR','Pathfinder Heavy Gunner','Some Pathfinders wield their killteam\'s heavy weapons. Their task is a relitevely simple one - to kill or destroy what their Shas\'ui orders them to or what they deem to be an important target.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','HUNTER CADRE, T\'AU, <SEPT>, PATHFINDER, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('TAU','HC','PF',0,'SL','Pathfinder Shas\'La','Even the rank-and-file of Pathfinder teams are selfless adherents to the Greater Good, eagerly volunteering themselves for the most dangerous missions. They operate close to the enemy to learn all they can from them, as well as engaging them when necessary.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','HUNTER CADRE, T\'AU, <SEPT>, PATHFINDER, SHAS\'LA',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('TAU','HC','PF',0,'SU','Pathfinder Shas\'Ui','Shas\'ui Pathfinders are veteran warriors who have fought in many campaigns. They have passed dangerous trials of fire to reach the rank, and are dynamic and accomplished tacticians more than capable of leading their team to victory.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','HUNTER CADRE, T\'AU, <SEPT>, LEADER, PATHFINDER, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('TAU','HC','SBS',0,'SU','Stealth Battlesuit Shas\'Ui','Expert in fighting as \'lone wolves\', warriors in Stealth Battlesuits go behind enemy lines, seeking to destroy important targets. Their battlesuits are integrated with light-bending disruption technology and cloaking fields that make it all but impossible for foes to target them.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','10','HUNTER CADRE, T\'AU, <SEPT>, FLY, STEALTH BATTLESUIT, SHAS\'UI',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('TAU','HC','SBS',0,'SV','Stealth Battlesuit Shas\'Vre','Those Shas\'ui in Stealth teams who survive long enough to become Shas\'vre are al noted as eccentrics, famous for tactical innovations and daring raids deep behind enemy lines. They are ofent viewed with suspicion in the well-regimented T\'au society.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','11','HUNTER CADRE, T\'AU, <SEPT>, FLY, LEADER, STEALTH BATTLESUIT, SHAS\'VRE',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('TAU','PF','PF',0,'AG','Assault Grenadier Pathfinder','The most hot-blooded Pathfinders are trained to carry out extremely dangerous attacks against enemy positions, using their grenades to stun enemy troops and destroy bunkers. They are also outfitted with advanced helmets that render them immune to enemy efforts to stun them in turn.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','PATHFINDER, T’AU, <SEPT>, ASSAULT GRENADIER PATHFINDER',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('TAU','PF','PF',0,'BL','Blooded Pathfinder','Many experienced and respected Pathfinders earn the personal name of Mont’yr, which translates as ‘Blooded’, Many bear highly advanced bionics in place of lost limbs, and are entrusted with specialist technology such as suppressed weapons.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','PATHFINDER, T’AU, <SEPT>, BLOODED PATHFINDER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman,Scout'),('TAU','PF','PF',0,'COMMS','Communications Specialist Pathfinder','Communications Specialists are found in most Pathfinder kill teams, providing a connection with the team’s Commanders, other kill teams and vital support assets.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','PATHFINDER, T’AU, <SEPT>, COMMUNICATIONS SPECIALIST PATHFINDER',32,0,'Scout'),('TAU','PF','PF',0,'DC','Drone Controller Pathfinder','Drone Controller Pathfinders receive additional training in remote piloting the drones that frequently accompany their teams. With careful work and patience they can manipulate a drone to carry out complex tasks that the drones cannot complete using solely their programming.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','PATHFINDER, T’AU, <SEPT>, DRONE CONTROLLER PATHFINDER',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('TAU','PF','PF',0,'MARKS','Marksman Pathfinder','Marksman Pathfinders carry customised rail rifles with advanced optics and sophisticated inertial dampeners to ensure incredible accuracy. These Pathfinders are also issued with experimental dart ammunition that is all but inaudible to the foe when fired.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','PATHFINDER, T’AU, <SEPT>, MARKSMAN PATHFINDER',32,0,'Marksman'),('TAU','PF','PF',0,'MB3','MB3 Recon Drone','These large drones are capable of collecting swathes of vital battlefield data that can make the difference between victory and defeat. Being larger, they can also be mounted with heavier weaponry - their burst cannon can effectively suppress or cut down enemy infantry.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','12','PATHFINDER, T’AU, <SEPT>, DRONE, FLY, MB3 RECON DRONE',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman,Scout'),('TAU','PF','PF',0,'MDC','Medical Technician Pathfinder','In a Pathfinder kill team, the lives of the T’au are often in the hands of a Medical Technician. These selfless healers brave storms of enemy fire to reach the wounded.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','PATHFINDER, T’AU, <SEPT>, MEDIC, MEDICAL TECHNICIAN PATHFINDER',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('TAU','PF','PF',0,'MV1','MV1 Gun Drone','Using anti-gravitic motors and jet-thrusters, Gun Drones hover over the landscape, moving quickly to engage the enemy and record battlefield data. On kill team missions, they can distract enemies as well as partake in attacks alongside the T’au warriors they serve.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','PATHFINDER, T’AU, <SEPT>, DRONE, FLY, MV1 GUN DRONE',32,0,'Marksman'),('TAU','PF','PF',0,'MV31','MV31 Pulse Accelerator Drone','Pulse Accelerator Drones boost the pulse weapons carried by Pathfinders, making the technology much more powerful and giving them a vital edge against the enemy.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','PATHFINDER, T’AU, <SEPT>, DRONE, FLY, MV31 PULSE ACCELERATOR DRONE',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('TAU','PF','PF',0,'MV33','MV33 Grav-Inhibitor Drone','Grav-inhibitor Drones are capable of manipulating gravity around, and significantly slowing the progress of, oncoming enemy troops. On countless occasions have Pathfinder kill teams escaped almost certain death thanks to the technology carried by these drones.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','PATHFINDER, T’AU, <SEPT>, DRONE, FLY, MV33 GRAV-INHIBITOR DRONE',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('TAU','PF','PF',0,'MV4','MV4 Shield Drone','Shield Drones are fitted with shield generators rather than weaponry. It is their task to protect the Pathfinders they accompany. Their saviour protocols ensure that, should a T’au come under direct threat, the Shield Drone will protect them from harm.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','PATHFINDER, T’AU, <SEPT>, DRONE, FLY, MV4 SHIELD DRONE',32,0,'Staunch'),('TAU','PF','PF',0,'MV7','MV7 Marker Drone','The high-intensity markerlights used by Marker Drones are vital for the synergy of T’au forces. They indicate priority targets both for the Pathfinders they are alongside as well as other powerful T’au assets. Whatever they pick out will soon be obliterated.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','7','PATHFINDER, T’AU, <SEPT>, DRONE, FLY, MV7 MARKER DRONE',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('TAU','PF','PF',0,'SL','Shas\'La Pathfinder','Even the rank-and-file of Pathfinder teams are selfless adherents to the Greater Good, eagerly volunteering themselves for the most dangerous missions. They operate close to the enemy to learn all they can of them, as well as engaging them when necessary.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','PATHFINDER, T’AU, <SEPT>, SHAS’LA PATHFINDER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('TAU','PF','PF',0,'SU','Shas\'Ui Pathfinder','Shas’ui Pathfinders are veteran warriors who have fought in many campaigns. They have passed dangerous trials of fire to reach the rank, and are dynamic and accomplished tacticians more than capable of leading their team to victory.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','PATHFINDER, T’AU, <SEPT>, LEADER, SHAS’UI PATHFINDER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('TAU','PF','PF',0,'TSI','Transpectral Interference Pathfinder','Transpectral Interference Pathfinders are tasked with jamming enemy communications through the use of complex signal scramblers that can shut down electrical systems.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','PATHFINDER, T’AU, <SEPT>, TRANSPECTRAL INTERFERENCE PATHFINDER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('TAU','PF','PF',0,'WE','Weapons Expert Pathfinder','Weapons Experts Pathfinders wield their kill team’s heavy weapons. Their task is a relatively simple one to kill or destroy what their Shas’ui orders them to or what they deem to be an important target.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','PATHFINDER, T’AU, <SEPT>, WEAPONS EXPERT PATHFINDER',32,0,'Marksman'),('TAU','PF24','PF24',2,'AG','Assault Grenadier Pathfinder','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','PATHFINDER , T\'AU EMPIRE, ASSAULT GRENADIER',32,0,''),('TAU','PF24','PF24',3,'BL','Blooded Pathfinder','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','PATHFINDER , T\'AU EMPIRE, BLOODED',32,0,''),('TAU','PF24','PF24',4,'COMMS','Comms Specialist Pathfinder','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','PATHFINDER , T\'AU EMPIRE, COMMS SPECIALIST',32,0,''),('TAU','PF24','PF24',5,'DC','Drone Controller Pathfinder','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','PATHFINDER , T\'AU EMPIRE, DRONE CONTROLLER',32,0,''),('TAU','PF24','PF24',6,'MARKS','Marksman Pathfinder','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','PATHFINDER , T\'AU EMPIRE, MARKSMAN',32,0,''),('TAU','PF24','PF24',11,'MB3','MB3 Recon Drone','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','4+','12','PATHFINDER , T\'AU EMPIRE, MB3 RECON, DRONE',32,0,''),('TAU','PF24','PF24',7,'MDC','Medical Technician Pathfinder','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','PATHFINDER , T\'AU EMPIRE, MEDIC, MEDICAL TECHNICIAN',32,0,''),('TAU','PF24','PF24',12,'MV1','MV1 Gun Drone','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','4+','7','PATHFINDER , T\'AU EMPIRE, MV1 GUN, DRONE',32,0,''),('TAU','PF24'