''),('TYR','BBRO24','BBRO24',12,'MAG','Magus','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','4+','9','BROOD BROTHER, GENESTEALER CULT, BROODCOVEN, LEADER, PSYKER, MAGUS',32,0,''),('TYR','BBRO24','BBRO24',6,'MED','Brood Brother Medic','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','BROOD BROTHER, GENESTEALER CULT, BROODGUARD, MEDIC',32,0,''),('TYR','BBRO24','BBRO24',14,'PAT','Patriarch','','kt24','6\"','4','0','0','4+','21','BROOD BROTHER, GENESTEALER CULT, BROODCOVEN, LEADER, PSYKER, PATRIARCH',32,0,''),('TYR','BBRO24','BBRO24',15,'PRIM','Primus','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','4+','9','BROOD BROTHER, GENESTEALER CULT, BROODCOVEN, LEADER, PRIMUS',32,0,''),('TYR','BBRO24','BBRO24',7,'SAP','Brood Brother Sapper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','BROOD BROTHER, GENESTEALER CULT, BROODGUARD, SAPPER',32,0,''),('TYR','BBRO24','BBRO24',8,'SNP','Brood Brother Sniper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','BROOD BROTHER, GENESTEALER CULT, BROODGUARD, SNIPER',32,0,''),('TYR','BBRO24','BBRO24',11,'TRP','Brood Brother Trooper','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','BROOD BROTHER, GENESTEALER CULT, BROODGUARD, TROOPER',32,0,''),('TYR','BBRO24','BBRO24',9,'VET','Brood Brother Veteran','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','BROOD BROTHER, GENESTEALER CULT, BROODGUARD, VETERAN',32,0,''),('TYR','BBRO24','BBRO24',10,'VOX','Brood Brother Vox Operator','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','BROOD BROTHER, GENESTEALER CULT, BROODGUARD, VOX OPERATOR',32,0,''),('TYR','BC','AH',0,'FTR','Acolyte Hybrid Fighter','Employing their xeno-augmented strength, some Acolyte Hybrids wield monstrous pieces of mining equipment repurposed for close combat. Howling saws and churning drills intended to gouge a path through solid rock make short work of even the toughest foes.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','BROOD COVEN, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, ACOLYTE HYBRID, FIGHTER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('TYR','BC','AH',0,'GNR','Acolyte Hybrid Gunner','Some Acolyte Hybrids wield hand flamers as they charge into battle. Ideal weapons for confined spaces, these compact flamethrowers allow their wielders to engulf their victims in sheets of blazing promethium before they storm in and finish off their survivors hand-to-hand.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','BROOD COVEN, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, ACOLYTE HYBRID, GUNNER',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('TYR','BC','AH',0,'IB','Acolyte Hybrid Icon Bearer','Acolyte Hybrids bearing cult icons provide inspiration for their brood brothers and sisters to fight all the harder. The icons\' twisted wyrmforms sway above the bloody back and forth of battle, serving as rallying points and menacing reminders of the horrors at the heart of the cult.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','BROOD COVEN, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, ACOLYTE HYBRID, ICON BEARER',32,0,'Staunch'),('TYR','BC','AH',0,'LDR','Acolyte Hybrid Leader','Acolyte Hybrids typically follow the most monstrous of their brood into battle. Hissing through mouthfuls of needle fangs, these horrors lead their gene-kin into the heart of the fray, directing their weapons to greatest effect and rallying those who look likely to retreat.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','9','BROOD COVEN, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, ACOLYTE HYBRID, LEADER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('TYR','BC','AH',0,'TRP','Acolyte Hybrid Trooper','Bulky and inhuman, Acolyte Hybrids are marked indelibly with the stigma of their zeno-taint. Yet the mutations they bear only make them stronger and more resilient, able to wield sizeable weapons against the foe with the aid of their additional limbs.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','BROOD COVEN, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, ACOLYTE HYBRID, TROOPER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('TYR','BC','HM',0,'FTR','Hybrid Metamorph Fighter','When the Star Children draw near to the world on which the Genestealer Cultists lurk, the cult spawns monstrous bio-augmented Hybrid Metamorphs. Created purely for battle, these grotesque creatures can tear a abloody path through even the most determined of opponents.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','BROOD COVEN, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, HYBRID METAMORPH, FIGHTER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('TYR','BC','HM',0,'GNR','Hybrid Metamorph Gunner','Whether their wielders are battling through the pipes and crawlspaces of an Imperial hive city or lunging fromthe shadows in ambush upon the open battlefield, the hand flamers wielded by some Hybrid Metamorphs provide deadly close-ranged fire support.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','BROOD COVEN, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, HYBRID METAMORPH, GUNNER',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('TYR','BC','HM',0,'IB','Hybrid Metamorph Icon Bearer','Those Hybrid Metamorphs given cult icons to carry to war are doubly blessed. Not only does their xeno-tainted flesh bear the most overt blessings of the Star Children, but also they are accorded the honour of holding aloft the very wyrmform sigil of their cult.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','BROOD COVEN, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, HYBRID METAMORPH, ICON BEARER',32,0,'Staunch'),('TYR','BC','HM',0,'LDR','Hybrid Metamorph Leader','There can be little doubt who amongst a brood of Hybrid Metamorphs is the leader, for they bear the most grotesque bio-weaponry of their kind. Often wielding living boneswords like those carried by the Star Children themselves, they fall upon their foes with predatory hunger.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','9','BROOD COVEN, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, HYBRID METAMORPH, LEADER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('TYR','BC','NH',0,'GNR','Neophyte Hybrid Gunner','Some Neophyte Hybrids are fortunate enough to get their hands on a special weapon, traded on the black market or stolen from local defence forces. They unleash these weapons upon their former masters with grim delight, each shot another blow struck in the name of rebellion.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','BROOD COVEN, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, NEOPHYTE HYBRID, GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('TYR','BC','NH',0,'HGNR','Neophyte Hybrid Heavy Gunner','Hefting massive man-portable firearms and repurposed mining gear, these Neophytes rain heavy fire into the rangs of the enemy. So armed, they are able to lay low even large and formidable enemies, and provide covering fire for their brothers and sisters as they storm into battle.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','BROOD COVEN, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, NEOPHYTE HYBRID, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('TYR','BC','NH',0,'IB','Neophyte Hybrid Icon Bearer','It is a great honour for a lowly Neophyte Hybrid to bear aloft the icon of their cult. Those who do become rallying points for their brothers and sisters, beacons of unassailable faith int he will of the Boordmind and the coming of the Star Children.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','BROOD COVEN, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, NEOPHYTE HYBRID, ICON BEARER',32,0,'Staunch'),('TYR','BC','NH',0,'LDR','Neophyte Hybrid Leader','Rising up from the shadows, Neophyte Hubrids surge into battle with guns blazing. At their head stride the boldest and most ruthless of their number, natural leaders who direct their fellows while roaring encouragement and brandishing the best weapons their brood could acquire.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','BROOD COVEN, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, NEOPHYTE HYBRID, LEADER',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('TYR','BC','NH',0,'TRP','Neophyte Hybrid Trooper','Amongst the Genestealer Cults, Neophyte Hybrids most closely resemble untainted Humans. This allows them to infiltrate labour gangs ang the like before rising up en masse to overthrow their Imperial oppressors. What they lack in might, the make up for in numbers and zealoutry.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','5+','7','BROOD COVEN, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, NEOPHYTE HYBRID, TROOPER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('TYR','HF','GS',0,'FTR','Genestealer Fighter','Genestealers are swift and powerful predators with lightning-fast reflexes and serrated claws that can tear through the thickest armour. Their large, highly-adaptive brains give them a brood telepathy which enables them to operate independently from the Hive Mind.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','9','HIVE FLEET,TYRANID, <HIVE FLEET>, GENESTEALER, FIGHTER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('TYR','HF','GS',0,'LDR','Genestealer Leader','Within Genestealer Broods, there usually arises one Genestealer with the ability to impress its will upon others through their brood telepathy. This bioform ensures their kin kill those they need to, while infecting the most important prey with their genetic taint.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','10','HIVE FLEET,TYRANID, <HIVE FLEET>, GENESTEALER, LEADER',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('TYR','HF','TS',0,'HRM','Hormagaunt','Hormagaunts have razor-sharp talons specially developed for ripping and piercing flesh and  armour, and their powerful hind legs drive them after their prey.. Extraordinarily single-minded, they will pursue their victims without pause or fatigue until they run their quarry down.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','6+','7','HIVE FLEET,TYRANID, <HIVE FLEET>, TYRANID SWARM, HOMAGAUNT',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('TYR','HF','TS',0,'TRM','Termagant','Termagants are fast and cunning creatures. In battle they scuttle forwards, unleashing torrents of fire from their bio-weaponry. They also have a strong sense of self-preservation, and often find a way to circumvent ambushes as well as assail the foe from an unexpected quarter.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','6+','7','HIVE FLEET,TYRANID, <HIVE FLEET>, TYRANID SWARM, TERMAGAUNT',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('TYR','HF','TW',0,'FTR','Tyranid Warrior Fighter','Tyranid Warriors are the most adaptable of all Tyranid bioforms. They are unstoppable killing machines protected by a carapace of thick chitin, yet with reactions as fast as a whip. In battle they can be found in the thick of the fighting, in close quarters or at range.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','18','HIVE FLEET,TYRANID, <HIVE FLEET>, SYNAPSE, TYRANID WARRIOR, FIGHTER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('TYR','HF','TW',0,'HGNR','Tyranid Warrior Heavy Gunner','Tyranid Warriors have the mental flexibility to employ a wide variety of weapon-symbiotes, including heavy bio-cannons. They are dangerous and unforgiving foes, able to identify and exploit the weaknesses of their targets with innate shrewdness.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','18','HIVE FLEET,TYRANID, <HIVE FLEET>, SYNAPSE, TYRANID WARRIOR, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('TYR','HF','TW',0,'LDR','Tyranid Warrior Leader','Tyranid Warriors are synapse creatures, psychic resonators for the Hive Mind. In many broods one bioform will dominate, having a deeper connection to the alien will that drives them. This bioform directs where its brood hunts and where it spreads the malignancy of the Hive Mind.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','19','HIVE FLEET,TYRANID, <HIVE FLEET>, SYNAPSE, TYRANID WARRIOR, LEADER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('TYR','WB','WB',0,'GNR','Neophyte Gunner','Especially powerful weapons purloined from defence militias, acquired via criminal contacts, or even built in cult-owned weapons shops are issued to a Wyrmblade boord\'s most capable Gunners. These warriors gladly lay down salvoes on the move to protect their comrades and slay the cult\'s foes.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','WYRMBLADE, TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, NEOPHYTE, GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('TYR','WB','WB',0,'HGNR','Neophyte Heavy Gunner','Powerfully-built Neophytes - some more prominently bearing the blesed mark of their gene-sire - are granted the honour of bearing deadly, repurposed mining tools or weapons too hefty for normal Humans to carry. Their heavy firepower supports Wyrmblade missions by laying low the biggest threats.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','WYRMBLADE, TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, NEOPHYTE, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('TYR','WB','WB',0,'IB','Neophyte Icon Bearer','As strong in faith as their genetic inheritance makes them in body, Icon Bearers carry their holy sigils low until the time is right to raise them aloft and signal the attack. They are honoured wardens of their brood\'s holy icon, inspiring their brothers and sisters to feats of great sacrifice to ensure the mission succeeds','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','7','WYRMBLADE, TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, NEOPHYTE, ICON BEARER',32,0,'Staunch'),('TYR','WB','WB',0,'KLM','Kelermorph','The Kelermorph is a third-generation cult hybrid, bred to exploit the hopes of the downtrodden and embody their kin\'s desire for rebellion. They are seen as inspirational folk heroes, and it is often on Wyrmblade missions that their legend as unnaturally agile, gunslinging revolutionaries is forged.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','4+','9','WYRMBLADE, TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, CULT AGENT, KELERMORPH',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('TYR','WB','WB',0,'LDR','Neophyte Leader','Often a clandestine veteram of one of numerous Imperial martial or security institutions, the leaders of Wyrmblade broods are accomplished guerilla commanders. They are so highly skilled in unorthodox strikes and coordinating multipronged assaults that the gene sect\'s agents defer to their experience.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','5+','8','WYRMBLADE, TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, NEOPHYTE, LEADER',32,0,'Combat,Marksman,Scout'),('TYR','WB','WB',0,'LOC','Locus','Concealing a powerful, xenos-mutated form beneath heavy robes and a sinisterly still exterior, a Locus can erupt into a flurry of deadly attacks in the blink of an eye. Often appointed by the cult\'s Magus to protect a kill team\'s leader, these gene-bred bodyguards are also their master\'s eyes and ears.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','4+','9','WYRMBLADE, TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, CULT AGENT, SANCTUS, LOCUS',32,0,'Combat'),('TYR','WB','WB',0,'NBA','Neophyte Brood-Adept','Brood-Adepts are amongst the most experienced guerilla fighters of a cult\'s Neophyte Hybrids. They are veteran agitators and insurgents, ferociously loyal and deeply indoctrinated in the cult\'s creed. They form the backbone of the elite Wyrmblade broods sent deep into the oppressor\'s territory.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','2','3','5+','7','WYRMBLADE, TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, NEOPHYTE, BROOD-ADEPT',32,0,'Marksman,Scout'),('TYR','WB','WB',0,'SNP','Sanctus Sniper','Escape is almost impossible once a Sanctus Sniper has selected its target. Fixed by the assassin\'s tri-lens goggles and centred in the crosshairs of their calibrated rifle, the target is doomed. The Sanctus\' aim is further refined by their Soulsight Familiar, through which the cult\'s Patriarch directs the killer','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','4+','9','WYRMBLADE, TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, CULT AGENT, SANCTUS, SNIPER',32,0,'Marksman'),('TYR','WB','WB',0,'TAL','Sanctus Talon','Some Sanctuses wield atrophic blades, each grown within bubbling pools containing the liquefied psychic essences of slain cultists. Clutching these deadly weapons, a Sanctus will track its target for days, squeezing its multijointed limbs through narrow spaces while following its victim\'s psychic spoor.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','3','1','3','4+','9','WYRMBLADE, TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, <CULT>, CULT AGENT, SANCTUS, TALON',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('TYR','WB24','WB24',4,'GNR','Neophyte Gunner','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','WYRMBLADE, TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, NEOPHYTE, GUNNER',32,0,''),('TYR','WB24','WB24',5,'HGNR','Neophyte Heavy Gunner','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','WYRMBLADE, TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, NEOPHYTE, HEAVY GUNNER',32,0,''),('TYR','WB24','WB24',6,'IB','Neophyte Icon Bearer','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','WYRMBLADE, TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, NEOPHYTE, ICON BEARER',32,0,''),('TYR','WB24','WB24',2,'KLM','Kelermorph','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','4+','9','WYRMBLADE, TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, CULT AGENT, KELERMORPH',32,0,''),('TYR','WB24','WB24',1,'LDR','Neophyte Leader','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','8','WYRMBLADE, TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, NEOPHYTE, LEADER',32,0,''),('TYR','WB24','WB24',3,'LOC','Locus','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','4+','9','WYRMBLADE, TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, CULT AGENT, SANCTUS, LOCUS',32,0,''),('TYR','WB24','WB24',7,'SNP','Sanctus Sniper','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','4+','9','WYRMBLADE, TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, CULT AGENT, SANCTUS, SNIPER',32,0,''),('TYR','WB24','WB24',8,'TAL','Sanctus Talon','','kt24','6\"','3','0','0','4+','9','WYRMBLADE, TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, CULT AGENT, SANCTUS, TALON',32,0,''),('TYR','WB24','WB24',9,'WAR','Neophyte Warrior','','kt24','6\"','2','0','0','5+','7','WYRMBLADE , TYRANIDS, GENESTEALER CULTS, NEOPHYTE, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('VOT','HKS','HKS',1,'DO','Hearthkyn Dozr','Subtlety and nuance are concepts these brawny Kin have little time for. They can smash open seales hatches or even solid walls with their Concussion Knux, punching a way through for their Kin. In battle, their weapons are even more devastating to ther unfortunate enemies.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, DOZR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch'),('VOT','HKS','HKS',4,'GNR','Hearthkyn Gunner','With wrecks often being home to myriad beasts, monsters, and enemies, Hearthkyn Salvagers have access to a wide variety of special and heavy weapons. Gunners select the tols best suited to the task at hand, and their blasts of heavy fire have been the saviours or many a kill team.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, GUNNER',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('VOT','HKS','HKS',3,'GRN','Hearthkyn Grenadier','Armed with bandoliers of grenades and explosives, Grenadiers performa  vital function for Hearthkyn Salvager teams. They can clear a corridor of foes in an instant, blow throughlocked doors, and provide tactical support to their Kin in the heat of a firefight.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, GRENADIER',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('VOT','HKS','HKS',5,'JMP','Hearthkyn Jump Pack Warrior','Hearhtkyn Salvagers have to overcome countless obstacles on their missions. Those using Jump Packs are able to navigate harsh terrain with ease, and in battle can utilise their equipment\'s power to increase the impact of their charge.','kt21','3[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, FLY, JUMP PACK WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Scout'),('VOT','HKS','HKS',6,'KL','Hearthkyn Kinlynk','Empyreal energies, voidship armour plating, and thick rock all threaten to interfere with squad comms, and the Kinlynks have to work tirelessly to ensure all their Kin can remain in contact. They calmly relay tactical information in the heat of battle, and even disrupt enemy comms.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, KINLYNK',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('VOT','HKS','HKS',7,'KOG','Hearthkyn Kognitaar','These Ironkin possess extremely complex artificial intelligences, and use this immense cogitational power to support their squad. Constantly receiving, organising, and analysing data, Kognitaar provide incredible real-time tactical information to their Kin whenever it is needed.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, KOGNITAAR',32,0,'Staunch'),('VOT','HKS','HKS',8,'LOK','Hearthkyn Lokatr','With dangers lying around every corner, in every vent, and even within a wreck\'s walls, the pan-spectral scanners of the Lokatrs are essential in allowing the Kin to anticipate threats and react in whichever way is the most practical.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, LOKATR',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('VOT','HKS','HKS',9,'LUG','Hearthkyn Lugger','In a wreck, where it is hard to insert vehicles, these redoubtable Kin carry enormous loads of essential equipment and supplies without complaint. Contributing every ounce of strength they have to their cause, they are highly regarded by their Kin.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, LUGGER',32,0,'Staunch'),('VOT','HKS','HKS',2,'MDC','Hearthkyn Field Medic','These Hearthkyn Salvagers are given exhaustive training in first aid under fire, as well as limited engineering tuition that enables them to provide care to damaged Ironkin. In a boarding action their skills are vital, for their squad will be far away from a fully-equipped Kin medical centre.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, MEDIC, FIELD MEDIC',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('VOT','HKS','HKS',0,'TH','Hearthkyn Theyn','Those Hearthkyn Salvagers who show particular aptitude for leadership are nominated by their superiors or comrades to be promoted to the rank of Theyn. In command of their own squad, Theyns are highly experienced hulk-delvers with countless boarding actions to their name.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','9','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, LEADER, THEYN',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman'),('VOT','HKS','HKS',10,'WAR','Hearthkyn Warrior','Hearthkyn Warriors are robust and grizzled individuals, fiercely proud of their role in hazardous boarding operations. Warriors provide vital support to their squad\'s specialists, gunning down foes as their comrades conduct mission-essential tasks.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, WARRIOR',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('VOT','HKS24','HKS24',2,'DO','Hearthkyn Dozr','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, DOZR',32,0,''),('VOT','HKS24','HKS24',5,'GNR','Hearthkyn Gunner','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, GUNNER',32,0,''),('VOT','HKS24','HKS24',4,'GRN','Hearthkyn Grenadier','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, GRENADIER',32,0,''),('VOT','HKS24','HKS24',6,'JMP','Hearthkyn Jump Pack Warrior','','kt24','8\"','2','0','0','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, FLY, JUMP PACK WARRIOR',32,0,''),('VOT','HKS24','HKS24',7,'KL','Hearthkyn Kinlynk','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, KINLYNK',32,0,''),('VOT','HKS24','HKS24',8,'KOG','Hearthkyn Kognitaar','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, KOGNITAAR',32,0,''),('VOT','HKS24','HKS24',9,'LOK','Hearthkyn Lokatr','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, LOKATR',32,0,''),('VOT','HKS24','HKS24',10,'LUG','Hearthkyn Lugger','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, LUGGER',32,0,''),('VOT','HKS24','HKS24',3,'MDC','Hearthkyn Field Medic','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, MEDIC, FIELD MEDIC',32,0,''),('VOT','HKS24','HKS24',1,'TH','Hearthkyn Theyn','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','3+','9','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, LEADER, THEYN',32,0,''),('VOT','HKS24','HKS24',11,'WAR','Hearthkyn Warrior','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','3+','8','HEARTHKYN SALVAGER, VOTANN, WARRIOR',32,0,''),('VOT','HKY','HKY',1,'BLD','Yaegir Bladekyn','','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HERNKYN YAEGIR, VOTANN, BLADEKYN',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Scout'),('VOT','HKY','HKY',2,'BOMB','Yaegir Bombast','','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HERNKYN YAEGIR, VOTANN, BLADEKYN',32,0,'Staunch,Marksman'),('VOT','HKY','HKY',3,'GNR','Yaegir Gunner','','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HERNKYN YAEGIR, VOTANN, GUNNER',32,0,'Marksman'),('VOT','HKY','HKY',4,'IRN','Yaegir Ironbraek','','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HERNKYN YAEGIR, VOTANN, IRONBRAEK',32,0,'Staunch,Scout'),('VOT','HKY','HKY',5,'RFL','Yaegir Riflekyn','','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HERNKYN YAEGIR, VOTANN, RIFLEKYN',32,0,'Marksman'),('VOT','HKY','HKY',0,'THEYN','Yeagir Theyn','The Theyns amongst the Hernkyn Yaegirs are hugely experienced warriors, explorers, survivalists, and adventurers. They lead their bands of Yaegirs with an iron-clad conviction in the service their mission will offer to the Votann.','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','9','HERNKYN YAEGIR, VOTANN, LEADER, THEYN',32,1,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman,Scout'),('VOT','HKY','HKY',6,'TRK','Yaegir Tracker','','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HERNKYN YAEGIR, VOTANN, TRACKER',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman,Scout'),('VOT','HKY','HKY',7,'WAR','Yaegir Warrior','','kt21','2[CIRCLE]','2','1','3','4+','8','HERNKYN YAEGIR, VOTANN, WARRIOR',32,0,'Combat,Staunch,Marksman,Scout'),('VOT','HKY24','HKY24',1,'BLD','Yaegir Bladekyn','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','4+','8','HERNKYN YAEGIR, VOTANN, BLADEKYN',32,0,''),('VOT','HKY24','HKY24',2,'BOMB','Yaegir Bombast','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','4+','8','HERNKYN YAEGIR, VOTANN, BOMBAST',32,0,''),('VOT','HKY24','HKY24',3,'GNR','Yaegir Gunner','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','4+','8','HERNKYN YAEGIR, VOTANN, GUNNER',32,0,''),('VOT','HKY24','HKY24',4,'IRN','Yaegir Ironbraek','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','4+','8','HERNKYN YAEGIR, VOTANN, IRONBRAEK',32,0,''),('VOT','HKY24','HKY24',5,'RFL','Yeaegir Riflekyn','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','4+','8','HERNKYN YAEGIR, VOTANN, RIFLEKYN',32,0,''),('VOT','HKY24','HKY24',0,'THEYN','Yeagir Theyn','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','4+','9','HERNKYN YAEGIR, VOTANN, LEADER, THEYN',32,1,''),('VOT','HKY24','HKY24',6,'TRK','Yaegir Tracker','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','4+','8','HERNKYN YAEGIR, VOTANN, TRACKER',32,0,''),('VOT','HKY24','HKY24',7,'WAR','Yaegir Warrior','','kt24','5\"','2','0','0','4+','8','HERNKYN YAEGIR, VOTANN, WARRIOR',32,0,'');
